{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "67",
 "name": "Shard",
 "file": "Map67_Shard.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":420,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North City Gates","descriptions":["The massive gates of the city of Shard rise up to the north.  The twin doors of steel-braced ironwood give access to the North Bridge across the Lake of Tears.  Somber guards watch on the battlements above."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":48,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":133,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["Esharis"]},
  {"id":2,"x":420,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["Shops and homes rise up on either side of the street, most locked up for the evening.  Cool, glassy cobblestones bubble up along the surface, glinting and reflecting darkly.  In the distance, toward the nexus of the city, a single silver tower blots out the stars, touched to a dull glow by the velvet glove of night.","Shops and homes rise up on either side of the street.  Warm, time-polished glass cobblestones bubble up along the street, glinting and reflecting the light.  Elothean children race by, canvas bags filled with books and papers banging against their backs.  In the distance, toward the nexus of the city, the top of a glittering tower of silver brushes up against the clouds."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":3,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":420,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["The street, straight and level, moves like a swift arrow toward the center of the city.  A glinting flash of water beyond the street on either side catches the reflection of the buildings and two bridges rising gracefully up to the east and west, molded entirely of polished crystal.  The solid structure of the Silver Eye Inn sits scant feet from the eastern bridge, its signboard swinging in a quiet breeze."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":4,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":438,"exit":"go","move":"go eye inn"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":420,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["The whisper of running water is bound by a thread of cool night air as it echoes down the street.  The glint of the stars overhead is watered down by the light shed by a tall post that flows up out of the street, the glowing sapphire stone caught in its grasp enough to make it compare to a lesser Xibar.","The whisper of running water echoes down the street through the curtain of sound created by the push of the crowds and the call of hawkers.  A tall post mounted with a glowing sapphire stone flows up out of the ground beside a supplies shop, the faintest nimbus of light streaming down from it to pool in a blue shadow on the street."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":452,"exit":"go","move":"go supplies shop"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":420,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["Charming buildings constructed of seasoned wood painted in shades of white, blue, or beige line the street on either side, some three stories and roofed with silverwood shingles, some squat and flat.  All bear the mark of Elothean and Elven architecture, with arched doorways and delicate paintings of vines, flowers, and small birds around the front and sides.","Shuttered and shadowed by the hand of night, the residencies that line the streets sleep with the land.  The faint traces of the mark of Elven and Elothean architecture can still be detected by the discriminating eye, the carefully painted vines, flowers, and birds that cover the front and sides of the homes chasing each other as if trying to catch up with something -- or get away from another.","Charming buildings constructed of seasoned wood line the street on either side.","Shuttered and shadowed by the hand of night, the residencies that line the streets sleep with the land."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":6,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":100,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":420,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["The imposing presence of a two-story building crouches like a shadowy beast by the side of the street.  The glow of candlelight flickers from the open windows, peering out with feral brilliance.  A banner of grey silk hangs over the doorway, the darkness obscuring its purpose.  Faintly, the drone of chanting or prayer echoes out from an arched window on the top center story.","The imposing presence of a two-story building dominates the east side of the street.  Built of dark grey, sanded but unpainted wood and topped with a steepled roof supported by two thick beams of uncarved black deobar that look more like trunks than finished pieces of wood, a banner of grey silk snaps over the doorway, the image of a steel dove sewn boldly into it.  The sounds of grunting and the clash of steel echo from what open windows there are to mingle with the bustle of the city."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":7,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":420,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["Darkened stores and homes stand like ranks of soldiers to either side, the air carrying the hint of fragrance from the closed etrana flowers that grow around the buildings.  One storefront, painted with dim shapes that could be butterflies, stands out amongst the others, a signboard engraved with what can be faintly made out to be a diamond hanging over the doorway.","Exquisitely painted stores and homes stand like ranks of soldiers to either side, the air fragrant with the etrana flowers that the city's lifesculpters see to blooming through even bitter winter.  One storefront stands out amongst all the others, painted a brilliant blue that would melt into the sky, but for the multitude of butterflies that have also been painted onto it.  A signboard engraved with a diamond hangs over the doorway."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":8,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":420,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["Posh homes and gated buildings surrounded by snowy-blossomed cherry trees slowly overtake the more compact and tightly packed shops and homes that occupy the portion of Shard closest to the city gates.  The street changes as it flows from north to south, its color shifting from bottle green to a dark, lapis blue.  A gate of ebony and steel to the south divides the upper city from the lower, a tangible boundary between castes."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":"go steel gate"},{"to":673,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":9,"x":420,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Diamond Street","descriptions":["The homes of the privileged of Shard are muted down to sober grays and blacks, their crystal windows dimmed and their gardens the color of dust.  The chuckle of a fountain splashing on through the night ripples through the streets, and the occasional reflection of candlelight glances over the road's dark blue stones.  A gate of ivory and brass divides the street to the north, its construction not daunting enough to keep the shadows at bay.","A splash of green from flourishing gardens and the glint of light off crystal windows offers a tantalizing view of the homes of the privileged of Shard.  Houses alternately built with the Elven mind for arches and spindly, steeple-like points take up residence with the Elothean touch of round buildings with faceted domes.  Groups of citizens trod down the lapis-hued street, entering or exiting to the north via an ivory and brass gate that divides the inner city from its outer, more common sister."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go brass gate"},{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go elven home"},{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go garden door"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":420,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Entrance of The Great Tower","descriptions":["A high plaster wall marks the end of Diamond Street, the road narrowing down until it splits into three parts.  One leads up to a sweeping marble archway, while the other two paths circumvent the barrier.  The night reflects off the tower's polished surface, blurring its outline until it seems to melt into the stars.","A high plaster wall marks the end of Diamond Street, the road narrowing down until it splits into three parts.  One leads up to a sweeping marble archway, while the other two paths circumvent the barrier.  A shining silver tower rises up from beyond the walls, the brisk snap of banners hanging with all the colors of the Elothean Houses bright against the gleaming liquid silver surface."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":71,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":516,"exit":"go","move":"go marble archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":11,"x":400,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["The wall of bone that curves in from the southwest blends in with a wall of plaster from the east.  Green vines drape like a sylph's locks over one side of the white-washed plaster wall, the verdant life of nature a curious contrast to the morbid unlife of death."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":12,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":385,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":380,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["A wall of carved bone encircles the Great Tower on its west face, the skulls that mount its rim glaring down with watchful intent.  Bits of cloth and threads from clothing cling to the teeth of some of the hollow-eyed guardians, and whether they were carefully placed there by enterprising city guards, or the skulls actually came to life to bite into trespassers, is a mystery few wish to test."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":13,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":380,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, West Entrance of The Great Tower","descriptions":["Moonstone Street quietly empties into the west entryway of the Great Tower, the dark street flowing like a carefully diverted river north, south, and east.  A wall of bones -- rumored to be a mixture of dragon, Dragon Priests, and the Elven and Elothean heroes who laid down their lives in the last great war -- embraces an arch of glittering crystal, the skulls that mount its rim glaring down on all who would trespass upon the Ferdahl's garden."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":85,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":518,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":14,"x":380,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["The wall of diamondique coming from the southeast bonds to the wall of bone that closes in from the north in a glittering lace that resembles a coating of frost upon an old battlefield.  The grass that edges the wall seems a little less green where it grows near the bones, as if it was lacking some vital nourishment."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":400,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["Nebulous swirls of crimson mix with the glowing diamondique of the wall that encircles the Great Tower.  Jagged spikes of crystal jut up all along the rim of the protective structure, twinkling with the dangerous beauty of a starry thorn.  A careful trick of the light bends and twists the red traces within the translucent material, causing them to form faceless figures with mouths open wide in a rictus of torment that seems like no trick at all.","Traces of crimson mix with the glowing diamondique of the wall that encircles the Great Tower.  Jagged spikes of crystal jut up all along the rim of the protective structure, catching the light and bending it into sparkling rainbows.  Legend has it that the red tinge within the translucent material is the blood of those who have dared the razorsharp thorns of the walls -- and failed.","Traces of crimson mix with the glowing diamondique of the wall that encircles the Great Tower.  Jagged spikes of crystal jut up all along the rim of the protective structure, catching the light and bending it into sparkling rainbows.  Legend has it that the red tinge within the translucent material is the blood of those who have dared the razorsharp \"thorns\" of the walls -- and failed."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":420,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Shard, South Entrance of The Great Tower","descriptions":["A wall composed of the glittering, extremely hard substance known as diamondique wraps around the gardens that circle the Great Tower of Shard.  A granite archway melts out of the otherwise seamless crystalline structure, the slots in its gated front revealing tantalizing slices of what lies beyond the walls.  Ruby Street rolls in from the south to fork off east and west into two paths that skirt the wall and one central path of white quartz that leads into the courtyard of the Tower."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":60,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":17,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":72,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":15,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":520,"exit":"go","move":"go granite archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":17,"x":420,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["The evidence of new Elven construction is readily apparent in the buildings that crouch closest to the Great Tower of Shard on Ruby Street.  The domed Elothean architecture that can be seen dominating the skyline to the south is replaced by rising spires of flanged stone and crystal to the north.  An arched gate of diamondique and steel separates the street to the south."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":"go arched gate"},{"to":181,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster building"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":420,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["Oldstyle Elothean architecture takes up most of the street on either side, the fluid, clean lines and golden rectangles of the structures at once efficiently utilizing the space the city has alloted them and aesthetically pleasing.  Out of place to the rest of the street's design is an arched gate of diamondique and steel that rises to the north, its Elven motif cutting rudely into the otherwise purely Elothean scape."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":"go arched gate"},{"to":174,"exit":"go","move":"go marble building"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":420,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["A gentle tranquility wraps this section of Ruby Street despite the fall of night and all the treacherous things its darkness conceals.  An inn built of seasoned wood is the only shop still open here, its windows and doorway bright with the glow of firelight and inviting the attention of those whose work does not end with the loss of sunlight.  A side street leads off into the stableyard of the inn, where the whinnying of horses can be heard.","Ruby Street cuts through the heart of the only section of Shard that survived the wars with the Dragon Priests, a fact that is readily apparent in the antique appearance of most of the shops here.  One inn built of seasoned wood seems to be the main attraction of this section of the lane, a cherrywood sign painted with a black rose hanging over the door.  Young children of the streetrat persuasion scamper past as they run out of or into a side street that leads to the inn's stableyard."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":20,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":165,"exit":"go","move":"go side street"},{"to":166,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":420,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["The wind sings a haunted lullaby through the abandoned streets of Ruby District as it chases itself around houses that are slowly going the way of the Wind Clan of the S'kra Mur.  To the southwest, the vague glow of the Tower of Honor reveals its location against the crystalline walls of Shard.","Small children dart around the skirts of old women and the wheels of caravans as the street marches to the orders of north and south.  To the southeast the Tower of Greenwalls is just barely visible, looking vaguely like a mound of moss growing out of the walls of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":164,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":420,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["Elothean architecture, with its curving roofs and rectangular shapes, dominates this section of Ruby Street.  On the eastern side of the street, a silvery star magnolia tree is illuminated by a nearby street lamp.  A wrought iron bench, its back twisted into a shesegri pattern, rests beneath it.","Elothean architecture, with its curving roofs and rectangular shapes, dominates this section of Ruby Street.  Rounded cobblestones glitter with fragments of white quartz and the occasional fleck of onyx.  On the eastern side of the street, the silvery leaves of a star magnolia tree brighten the view.  A wrought iron bench, its back twisted into a shesegri pattern, rests beneath it."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":22,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":117,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":420,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["Smooth grey cobblestone forms a wide avenue that glints with embedded rock crystal in the lantern light.  Crepe myrtles rustle gently in the evening breeze, scenting the air with their perfume.  They flank a curving parkway that stretches to the west.","Smooth grey cobblestone forms a wide avenue that glints with embedded rock crystal that shimmers like the nearby canals on a sunny day.  Crepe myrtles flank a curving parkway that stretches to the west, where grandiose buildings are visible against the cityscape of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":23,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":120,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":420,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["Pieces of the street's cobblestones have been pulled up to reveal the hard rock that is the city's foundation.  A decrepit building with a cracked domed roof and dangerously dark doorway is the only shop that appears to be doing any measure of good business here judging by the fresh coat of paint on its walls and the occasional customer leaving and entering.  A signboard hangs over its doorway, depicting a pile of Dokoras."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":24,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":158,"exit":"go","move":"go decrepit building"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":420,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["The Tower of Honor rises to the southwest, mocking the decay of Ruby Street with its glowing luminescence.  Most of the homes to the left or right seem either abandoned or condemned to pity, the businesses all tightly locked up against night's onslaught.  Gaps in the street where stones have been pried up make walking treacherous, and forbid the presence of carriages or horses.","The Tower of Honor rises to the southwest, mocking the decay of Ruby Street with its brightly born shadow.  Most of the homes to the left or right seem either abandoned or condemned to pity, and what businesses have stayed to brave the danger of their locale are guarded by armed and wary shopowners.  Gaps in the street where stones have been pried up make walking treacherous, and forbid the presence of carriages or horses."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":25,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":161,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":420,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruby Street","descriptions":["The apartments of the working class line the street, most of them new construction since the Outcast War.  Few lights burn in the windows of the homes of people who rise early and work late.","Human and Gor'Tog children, along with an occasional Elf or Elothean, play their games in the street.  The games may be rough at times, but the children learn to be alert and quick.  Their clothes may be patched and their faces dirty, but their eyes are bright and their limbs are sturdy."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":26,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":420,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Shard, South Square","descriptions":["Like a barren tree in springtime, this quarter of the city shows signs of renewed life.  Ruby Street to the north brings shoppers and travelers to a large cobbled square in an area that citizens and visitors once would have avoided.  The most prominent sign of the reawakening is the New South Bridge on the rebuilt side of the square."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":193,"exit":"go","move":"go new bridge"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":500,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["A jagged skyline of spires and symmetric chimneys darkens the sky to the south.  The sounds of the city by night are hushed to sinister proportions compared to the clamor of the day.  Darkened buildings -- their residents safely locked away inside -- hem Katamba's Crescent Road in so that it leaves little more than ten feet of passing room for the Trader's caravans that wend their way toward Brickwell Tower to the east.","Elegant chimneys and spires that looks as if they were spun from a sugar confectioner's dream create a jagged skyline to the south, testament to the strange beauty of Diamond Street.  The clamor of travelers let in by the North City Gates flushes the air with the vital chatter of men, women, and children as they progress toward their destinations -- whether that be Brickwell Tower to the east, the Great Tower at Shard's heart, or any of the other shops and streets that compose the city on the lake."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":580,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["Brickwell Tower, site for the Traders of Shard, rises to the southeast, a dark silhouette rendered grim by the painted shades of night.  The mumble of an in-city riverlet floats up from the same direction as the tower, the fresh scent of chilly water accompanying the sound on its journey.  Shadowed homes painted with indiscernable images hedge in the street to the south.","Brickwell Tower, site for the Traders of Shard, rises to the southeast, silhouetted against the sky in an impressive composition of grey and red brick.  The chatter of water rushing through the city floats up from the same direction.  The sides of cleanly whitewashed homes edge in the street, their walls painted with tiny tendrils of ivy and starflowers that at first glance lead the eye to believe them real."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":27,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":595,"exit":"go","move":"go cellar doors"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":680,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The courtyard of Brickwell Tower stretches beyond the keep's curved archway, the black iron teeth of the portcullis gleaming with intended malevolence for any who dare try to cross the pride and joy of the Shard Traders' Guild.  Murder holes glare out approximately thirty feet from the base, gazing down upon the Bridge of Sparrows that protects Shard's civilians from one of the water channels that rushes through the city with aimless abandon."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":378,"exit":"go","move":"search go channel bank","hidden":true},{"to":502,"exit":"go","move":"go brickwell tower"},{"to":378,"exit":"go","move":"go bank"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":720,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["Brickwell Tower and the Bridge of Sparrows can be seen over the tops of the city's homes, the illumination from small globes of magical glass-lights giving the face of the keep an eerie, ominous appearance.  The street shows signs of wear here where caravans rumble through it all day, heading to or from the great tower.","Brickwell Tower and the Bridge of Sparrows can be seen over the tops of the city's homes, the spires and flying buttresses of the elegant keep a tasteful match to the peaked architecture of the townhouses and quaint brickwork cottages of Diamond and Opal Street to the north and west.  Caravans rumble by, filled with goods and chattering Trader families on their way in or out."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":820,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["Palm-sized moons of some black substance have been pressed into the walls of the city at regular two-foot intervals, creating a geometric pattern that nicely offsets the glittering crystal.  How the moons remain fixed in the extremely hard material is a mystery, and judging by the small chips and scrapes that edge some of them, a mystery as yet to be solved by petty pilferers."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":30,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":820,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East City Gates","descriptions":["Flames from smoky torches mounted on the city's walls flutter in a lakeside breeze and throw a fitful light over the ground, casting shadows on the Eastern Gate.  The shadowy outline of the Tower of Brickwell rises up to the north, the faint sound of snapping cloth coming from the Keep's direction.","The Eastern Gate is the second most active entrance for the thriving trade of Shard.  The looming presence of the Tower of Brickwell dominates the view to the north, a multitude of pennants emblazoned with the arms of many kingdoms, baronies, and other sovereign states flying from its battlements and marking it indelibly as the staging grounds for the Shard Trader's Guild."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":93,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":130,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":132,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["Neharon"]},
  {"id":33,"x":820,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["A healthy array of well-tended gardens awaits onlookers who pass down this pocket street.  While the homes here are not the finest in Shard, there is no mistaking the mark of careful upkeep."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":34,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":106,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":706,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden doors"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":720,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["Fences draped with leaves painted black by the night point the way to Greenwall's Tower to the southwest.  A low-roofed shop all but hidden behind a nest of ivy sits darkened and locked up, slumbering away the evening with the other homes here.","Fences draped with vibrant green raspberry bushes and fragrant white sweethorn vines point the way to Greenwall's Tower to the southwest.  A low-roofed shop all but hidden behind a nest of ivy takes its place amongst the other homes here, the only discernible difference marking it as a business from a domestic building being an iron sign hanging over its doorway."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":35,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":711,"exit":"go","move":"go society arch"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go bowyer shop"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":680,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The mossy and almost entirely plant-covered Tower of Greenwalls grows out of the side of the crystalline city walls like a blade of grass through a sheath of glittering frost here.  To the northwest the Bridge of Silver sweeps in a graceful arch over a verdant water channel, its construction completely composed of several silverwillow trees that have been lifesculpted to interlock and form a bridge of boughs and leaves."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":65,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":143,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy path"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":580,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The once-sad shell of a ruined house has been refurbished to make a tiny red-shuttered shop.  While the renovations have rendered it habitable, it still retains its quirky charm as a home of sorts to the plant life of the area, the green children of the Rangers.  Bricks have been converted to pots that hold fragrant herbs, and the remains of support beams and the fence, now repaired, have been wrapped with ivy."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":144,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"},{"to":567,"exit":"go","move":"go black tent"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":500,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["A circular scorch mark blasts into the city walls here, reducing the crystalline material to slag near the center.  Deep scores and scratches are the only signs of a war long past, perhaps a reminder to the younger citizens of Shard as to just what their elders fought through to keep the city intact for future residents.","The repaired southern wall of the city stands tall and proud, burnished with a pale blue color to mirror the street's namesake.  The raised cobblestone road gives a good view of the arced road that runs around the outer edge of the great city, allowing passersby to see the Great Tower to the north.  Several caravans parked to the side are ready and awaiting offloading for nearby stores.","The repaired southern wall of the city stands tall and proud, burnished with a pale blue color to mirror the street's namesake.  The raised cobblestone road gives a good view of the arced road that runs around the outer edge of the great city, allowing passersby to see the Great Tower to the north.  Several caravans parked to the side are closed up tight, awaiting the new day to be unloaded."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":26,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":719,"exit":"go","move":"go granite arch"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":340,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The Tower of Honor to the west and north, despite the presence of nightfall, retains some remnant of the sun's light in its quartz stone, exuding a gentle glow that lends a moonlight-bright illumination to everything nearby.  The sounds of miserable coughing and clicking boots on crystalline wallwalks echoes up to the east where the unlucky south city gates guards make their rounds.","The white-gold glowing glory of the Tower of Honor lies west and north of here, its subtle magnificence striking out boldly from the decay that trails over Xibar's Crescent from Ruby Street.  Homes in various states of ruin or repair form a jagged skyline to the north, with the gates to the south entrance of the city visible to the east."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":644,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":260,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The Tower of Honor sweeps up to the northwest like a candle elegantly sculpted of fitted blocks of quartz.  A soft glow radiates out from the solitary structure, the result of the light-absorbing qualities of the stone by the masoner's account, the result of the pure spirits that serve the tower -- the Paladins of Ilithi -- by legend.","The Tower of Honor -- the only remarkable landmark from this point in the street -- sweeps up to the northwest, casting its pure shine down on Sapphire, Moonstone, and Ruby Streets.  The bell-like ring of metal-shod hooves on stone glances through the air as men and women clad in armor lead their steeds away or toward the great Tower, their squires following quickly behind with what gear the horses can't (or won't) carry."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":160,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The Tower of Honor -- home to the Paladins of Shard -- rises straight and tall out of the side of the winking facets of the city walls.  The milky white stone that composes the keep shines softly, for all the world looking as if it were an odd, earthbound piece of the fourth moon of legend.  To the northeast, the Bridge of Suns braces its goldenoak feet against the bank of a water channel that would separate Xibar Street from Sapphire Avenue.","The Tower of Honor -- home to the Paladins of Shard -- rises straight and tall out of the side of the glittering facets of the city walls.  The milky white stone that composes the keep is said to be imbued with the same powers as the legendary soulstones, changing color when the integrity of the guild begins to fail.  To the northeast, the Bridge of Suns braces its goldenoak feet against the bank of a water channel that would separate Xibar Street from Sapphire Avenue."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":77,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":231,"exit":"go","move":"go soulstone archway"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":120,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The white glow of the Tower of Honor can be glimpsed around a bend to the southeast, its soft luster challenging the Great Tower's at the heart of Shard for height.  A building painted in shadows and featuring wooden beams carved with obscure images sits, closed for the night, on the east side of the path, its doorway darkened.","The white gleam of the Tower of Honor can be glimpsed around a bend to the southeast, its peak challenging the Great Tower at the heart of Shard for height.  A building painted a stark grey and featuring wooden beams carved with images of swords, helms, and armor has taken up residence here, its open doorway revealing flashes of bright metal."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":550,"exit":"go","move":"go grey building"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":20,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Xibar's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The city seems to pause in this small pocket side street, just apart from the mad traffic of Moonstone Street to the north and the overbearing grace of the Tower of Honor to the south.  Shaded homes sit in tranquil silence beside the path's side, content in their small slice of peace."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":121,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":128,"exit":"climb","move":"climb city wall"},{"to":700,"exit":"go","move":"go society tower"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":20,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, West City Gates","descriptions":["The sound of chanting voices carries over the Lake of Tears and past the West Gate.  If the guards appear disturbed by the steady droning sound, they do not show it as they pace the wallwalks, eyes constantly scanning for any sign of danger in the night.","Glossy black and opaque, the diamondique West Gates of the city gleam alongside the brightly burnished armor of its guards.  The crystal walls are equally bright, all resulting in a whole that would be blinding were they any more perfect or the sun any more bright."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":78,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":42,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":127,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":129,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["Kureta"]},
  {"id":44,"x":20,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The dull glow of dark diamondique offers a tantalizing glimpse of the West Gates to the south, the shadow of Wyvern Mountain trying hard to steal what little light glances off the portal's softly rounded arch.  The lap of the water that surrounds the city is lulling, carrying over through the walls and foundations that protect Shard from the liquid's eroding power.","The sleek gleam of dark diamondique offers a tantalizing glimpse of the West Gates to the south, the shadow of Wyvern Mountain trying hard to steal the sunlight that would glance off the portal's softly rounded arch.  The lap of the water that surrounds the city is a lulling change from the sounds of Shard, carrying over through the walls and foundations that protect the city's denizens from the liquid's eroding power."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":43,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":120,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["A thundercloud mutters ancient epithets to the night to the northeast, its wrath emitting lightning bolts that illuminate the tower that sits just beneath it.  To the southwest the street winds down toward the West Gate, the faint echo of chanting floating up from the Lake of Tears and the mountain shrine that abides beside it.","A thundercloud mutters ancient epithets to the sky to the northeast, its wrath focused on the tower that sits just beneath it.  To the southwest the street winds down toward the West Gate."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":755,"exit":"go","move":"go crystalline tower"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":160,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["Stormwill Tower, home of the Warrior Mages and Empaths of Shard, dominates much of the view to the northwest, an ominous shadow that passes a heavy hand over the sky and stars.  Even more ominous is a cloud that hovers over the tower, churning and rumbling with thunder and lightning.  The babbling burble of water rushing brings comfort to the night's loneliness where the Bridge of Linden Leaves rises up, creating safe passage over one of Shard's many natural channels to the south.","Stormwill Tower, home of the Warrior Mages and Empaths of Shard, dominates much of the view to the northwest, its ominous black and grey masonry permanently overshadowed by a single dark cloud that hovers over the keep like a bad memory.  Citizens of the city hurriedly get about their business here, either completely skirting the tower or running in or out with modest haste.  The Bridge of Linden Leaves creates safe passage over a water channel that rushes through to the south."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":45,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":66,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":488,"exit":"go","move":"go stormwill tower"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":260,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["No grass grows within twenty feet of the city walls, and the homes are pulled back for at least forty.  The steep walls rise up high, their sides slick and smooth, unpitted by weather or wear.  To the southwest, Stormwill Tower bubbles up out of the walls, a small black-grey cloud hovering ominously above it.","To the southwest, Stormwill Tower bubbles up out of the walls, a small black-grey cloud hovering ominously above it."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":46,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":340,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Katamba's Crescent Road","descriptions":["The high walls of the city curve out of sight to the west, terminating at the city gates to the east.  Homes edge in on the trail, crowding up to the path before stopping their progression.  A small brass plaque is embedded into the walls, commemorating this place for some far away reason."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":47,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":566,"exit":"go","move":"go maintenance door"},{"to":134,"exit":"climb","move":"climb city wall"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":680,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street","descriptions":["The lane ends ten feet away from where the Bridge of Sparrows begins, leaving a patch of bare road between street and structure.  The currents of the water that rush through the canal the bridge arcs over is alive with the chuckling of unseen undines, if one is to believe the tales of the city.  Soft splashing follows the water as it rushes back to the Lake of Tears in a torrent of dark blues and greys.","The lane ends ten feet away from where the Bridge of Sparrows begins, leaving a patch of bare road between street and structure.  The currents of the water that rush through the canal the bridge arcs over is alive with flashes of azure, ivory, emerald, and agate.  The shimmer of rainbowed scales catches on the waves and pebbles before being washed away as the riverlet heads out of the city and back into the Lake of Tears."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":640,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street","descriptions":["Small shingle-roofed flats and whitewashed storefronts form the narrow lane of Opal Street, their shutters pulled tight and their chimney stacks releasing fragrant woodsmoke into the air.  Water collects in the small round potholes that have eaten away some of the cobblestones, no doubt to be deprived of their mercurial mirrored liquid come the morning and the arrival of adventurous children.","The Bridge of Sparrows can be seen just peeking up over the northeast horizon, its simple wooden construction diminished before the impressive front of Brickwell Tower beyond it.  The headquarters for the Traders League of the city, the rounded keep is built of brick upon dense brick of cut azure crystal.  Against that richly textured background, the houses that make up the narrow street pale in comparison."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":51,"x":600,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street","descriptions":["The sign on a small business proclaims it the local arms shop, shuttered to rest and await the haggling that dawn will bring.  Paintings of weapons and armor decorate the building's side, but much of the detail is lost in the dim light.  Something gleams over the doorway.","The sign on a small business proclaims it the local arms shop.  Detailed paintings of light swords, axes, and armor decorate the building's side, as is the style with most shops in the city.  Two battle-tempered (and securely bolted) longknives have been crossed over the doorway, the leather on their grips weather-worn but their edges still distinctly sharp."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":437,"exit":"go","move":"go arms shop"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":560,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street Green","descriptions":["The street creates a wide circle around a small patch of grass and trees that crop up out of the cobblestone bones of the city.  Faded to grey by night, the benches that have been set out for the comfort of passersby have now grown chilly from the lakeside breeze, rendering them closer to implements of subtle torture rather than a nice place to plop down and rest the legs and back.","The street creates a wide circle around a small patch of grass and trees that crop up out of the cobblestone bones of the city.  Benches and a fresh breeze compliment the setting, and a general feeling of peaceful relaxation incorporates itself into the air around the little slice of growing life."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":53,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":568,"exit":"go","move":"go house"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":480,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street","descriptions":["A covered cart parked next to the southeast ramp that leads up to the Bridge of Wrens marks that place as the permanent residence for a daytime vendor, now gone off to a deserved rest, no doubt.  An echo of light from the south heralds the presence of the Temple of Light, while southwest the Great Tower absorbs the moonlight, throwing it back as a dull gleam that covers its skin in a cascade the hue of buffed lead.","A cart filled with apples and manned by a cheery-faced Halfling with a striped smock on awaits all who pass over the Bridge of Wrens to the southeast either arriving to or leaving from Opal Street.  The roof of the Temple of Light can faintly be seen to the south, while southwest the Great Tower captures the eye with its bright gleam."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":88,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":54,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":460,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Opal Street","descriptions":["The street has a lonely feel to it, as if the night had sucked some vital element from it.  Planter boxes filled with closed flowers hang out from beneath the shuttered windows of the residences.  Pools of shadow collect at the feet of the walls, ranging from soft grey to a black deep enough to carry stars, were it so empowered.","The cobblestones have a freshly washed look to them, possibly accounting for the clean scent in the air.  Planter boxes filled with bright flowers hang out from beneath the windows of the residences, and the sound of women calling out to their neighbors from their balconies rings from the close walls of the street."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":94,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":10,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":805,"exit":"go","move":"go squat building"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":440,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["A high plaster wall creates a barrier around which the path curls.  Adjacent to that, the impeccable sides of the lavish homes of the privileged of Shard hem the other side of the path in, leaving little room for navigation.  Crouched beside the path and taking up much of the precious space is a ramshackle building that seems completely out of place.  A barely legible sign hangs over the doorway."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":454,"exit":"go","move":"go ramshackle building"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":460,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["Fine tendrils of vines curl over the top of the wall that hems in the trail.  The wall melts from plaster where it curves in from the northwest to the solid brick of the wall that sweeps in from the south.  The tops of the brick part of the wall have been embedded with black ironwrought pikes, their tips sharp and very pointy."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":55,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":460,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Entrance of The Great Tower","descriptions":["Sunstone Street ends in a three-way split before an ash arch that serves as the entryway into a flourishing garden.  A tall wall of brick imbedded at the top with pike tips creates a fearsome barrier between the gleaming silver tower beyond the wall, and the city before it."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":86,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":58,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":522,"exit":"go","move":"go ash arch","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":58,"x":460,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["Birdsong and the fragrance of orchids floats over the wall that encircles the Great Tower.  A high fence to the west neatly wedges in the path around the Tower, leaving just enough room for two Elves to walk through side-by-side.  The path -- a series of small stones of a multitude of colors -- meanders in a slow arc that vanishes as it curls north and southwest."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":59,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":440,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Yavash Circle","descriptions":["The circular wall to the north that hedges in the path shifts from the brick of its eastern half to the glittering diamondique of its western half in a noticeable and surely magical melding of the two substances.  Spikes of crystal jut from the top of the opaque western segment, while pikes of steel poke up out of the other section.","The circular wall to the north that hedges in the path shifts from brick to diamondique in a noticeable and surely magical melding of the two substances."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":460,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["Flecks of black minerals glitter in the cobblestones like dying stars whose true sickly nature has been revealed by the weak light of the evening.  Shadows gnaw at the foundations of the older buildings, crouching in deep pools at their feet.  The remnant scent of baked bread hovers around a small shop on the northeast side of the street, now closed for the evening.","The street glitters with mineral deposits, providing a crystal sheen to the brickish cobblestones that lends credence to the lane's name.  Signs of new construction in some of the older buildings mark the advance of time and change over the neighborhood.  The scents of baking food and cooking meat float on a delicate breeze from a small shop on the northeast side of the street."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":182,"exit":"go","move":"go bakery"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":480,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["Meager buildings line the street to the left and right, none rising over two stories, all bowing to the vaulted greatness of the silvery Great Tower to the northwest.","Meager buildings line the street to the left and right, none rising over two stories, all bowing to the vaulted greatness of the silvery Great Tower to the northwest.  Nestled between two of the modest structures, a little crimson-shingled shop seems to attract steady business despite its lackluster location.","Meager buildings line the street to the left and right, none rising over two stories, all bowing to the vaulted greatness of the silvery Great Tower to the northwest.  Nestled between two modest structures, a little crimson-shingled shop sits quietly in the nighttime gloom."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":62,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":801,"exit":"go","move":"go little shop"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":540,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["Decay has clawed away at many of the old buildings to the south, the ravaged remnants of one war of fire and destruction, and another of time and neglect.  Surprisingly, the buildings to the north have all been either refurbished or rebuilt entirely.  The line of construction here is more than just conjecture, it can be traced with the eye right down to the palpable discrepancy in the street's state of repair from one side to the next."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":61,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":183,"exit":"go","move":"go black building"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":580,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["The promise of thriving life that otherwise lingers in the rest of the city has died here.  Crumbling homes that can no longer support families, businesses that cannot stave off petty thieves or entice customers, and the shells of buildings have been left to rot along the street.  To the northwest, the grandiose beauty of the Great Tower seems to overshadow and demoralize what little dignity the residents here hope to cling to."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":116,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":62,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":163,"exit":"go","move":"go barn"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":620,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["The bleak outline of shattered homes can be discerned to the northwest.  While the buildings seem more intact here, there is a visible shift in integrity and a noticeable increase in decay as the streets draw closer to the northwest horizon.  In comparison, the buildings to the southeast are far more sturdy, maintained with fresh whitewash and bolstered by new construction."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":63,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":680,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Crystal Lane","descriptions":["The quiet rush of water under the Bridge of Silver creates sedate music for the sober and silent street.  The darkness to the northwest -- where Crystal Lane dissolves into shadow -- seems deeper than it should be, a feeling perhaps augmented by the slumped buildings that line the street.  The fragrant scent of jes-roses floats up from the banks of the water channel where they have been planted in lush rows.","The quiet rush of water under the Bridge of Silver creates sedate music for the sober and silent street.  Old homes that look within a feather's breath of cracking rise up to the northwest, their shadows -- falling gracefully over the cobblestones -- the only steady thing about them.  The banks of the water channel thrive with bright green plants, no doubt the touch of the local Ranger Guild."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":64,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":189,"exit":"go","move":"go tall building"},{"to":189,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":160,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Emerald Lane","descriptions":["Shadows dapple the two graceful linden trees that grow up from the banks of the icy and swiftly moving water channel here.  Grass springs up thickly along the sides of the channel's bank, nature's own tapestry muted to the color of demon's blood.  A carved statue of a woman guards the Bridge of Linden Leaves that rises over the churning waters, her visage dimmed by the night into one of sorrow.","Two graceful linden trees grow up from the banks of a water channel that excises a chunk of land from the rest of the city here.  Emerald green grass grows in a carefully maintained spread that eventually thins out as the street widens to the southeast.  A carved statue of a woman guards the Bridge of Linden Leaves that rises over the water channel, her face gentle and her hands spread before her, as if reaching out to touch someone."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":200,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Emerald Lane","descriptions":["Dark stones pebble the street, bubbling up out of the earth as if the ground had been scraped away to reveal a slice of the World Dragon's sinister black underbelly.  The street is stripped down to little more than a few homes to the left and right, leaving a wide lane suitable for the passage of heavy carts and pack animals.","Bottle green stones pebble the street, bubbling up out of the earth as if the ground had been scraped away to reveal a slice of the World Dragon's left flank.  The crisp clicking of hooves rings through the air as Traders from the far corners of the Realms and farmers from a little closer to home lead their animals toward the open market to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":66,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":240,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Emerald Lane Open Market","descriptions":["Closed stalls and tightly sealed tents are the only vestiges of the market's lively daytime visage.  Amidst the maze-like lanes of the bazaar is one lone Human, seated with legs folded in a meditative position and clutching a grim black staff.  He is unnaturally still and silent, appearing to be a guard for a strange black tent that sits alone and unchallenged in the heart of the street.","Makeshift stalls and patchwork tents create a small village of various hagglers and item mongers.  A Human with bones woven into his beard and a grim black staff capped with a sluagh skull sits outside a tent, his eyes lit with a strange light.  Fruit carts laden with the season's best sit alongside blankets laid out on the grass and covered with various curios."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":67,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":150,"exit":"none","move":"pull staff;pull staff"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":280,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Heart of the Emerald Lane Open Market","descriptions":["The soft whistling of nightbirds and the faint sound of footsteps lingers on the breeze, a pale echo of the open market activities during the day.  A bare circle of grass and benches intercepts the path, the wood of the worn seats glowing with a ghostly light in the eyes of the moons.","The ring of silver strings and the faint echo of Elven laughter weaves through the ever-changing makeshift alleys of the open market of Shard.  A bare circle of grass and benches is treated with sacred respect by the many merchants who pitch their tents here, leaving one place for people to gather and relax, safe from the push and clamor of the crowds."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":68,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":360,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Emerald Lane Open Market","descriptions":["Uneasily empty, the only company for the daytime-busy market is a statue that seems to carefully guard rather than diminish the silence and stalking darkness.  The curve of a bridge allows passage to Moonstone Street to the southwest, and the glimpse of tall, peaked towers to the southeast mark the presence of the city's alternative temple.","Patched tents and booths formed of slats of wood that vary wildly in type and color bloom in clumps of full and myriad colors around the stiffer and more prestigious backs of the homes on Diamond Street to the north and northeast.  The curve of a bridge allows passage to Moonstone Street to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":83,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":69,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":149,"exit":"go","move":"go sewer grate"}],"aliases":["Faenella"]},
  {"id":71,"x":380,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Emerald Lane","descriptions":["Shadows line the street in patchy clumps, deep enough to hide anything from golden eggs to crafty thieves.  The street narrows as it empties to the southeast, the hypnotic, star-arm spiral pattern of the ebony and agate stones swirling up to the feet of the dully gleaming Great Tower.  The sound of chanting drones through the air, coming from somewhere to the southwest.","Patches of bright green grass grows around the pebbled street.  The street narrows as it empties out to the southeast, the hypnotic, spiral pattern of its blue and green stones swirling up to the feet of the Great Tower.  The sound of hawkers and the call of a street faire entices passersby to the north."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":70,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":380,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue","descriptions":["The cobblestone street melts into the south entrance of the Great Tower to the northeast and leads off to a residential district and -- further along -- the Tower of Honor to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":360,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue","descriptions":["The lane sweeps in a clean angle northeast and southwest.  A curious, ramshackle two-story building juts like a growth waiting to be lanced amongst the other residentials.  Something shadowy and heavy hangs from the shop's darkened porch, and a strange, ghostly clicking floats through the air around it, sounding for all the world like some spectre rattling its fingerbones to scare off unwanted guests.","The lane sweeps in a clean angle northeast and southwest.  A curious, ramshackle two-story building has huddled down amongst the other residencies, trying hard to look like it belongs, failing miserably.  The skinned remains of some large beast hang down from the porch roof alongside a windchime made of various fingerbones.  The eerie *click clack click* that comes from the macabre ornament could account for why this street seems a little bit on the vacant side."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":74,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":83,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":384,"exit":"go","move":"go ramshackle building"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":300,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue Green","descriptions":["The street encircles lonely arms around a disk of darkened grass and softly whispering trees here.  The soft, shattered music of a fountain complements the sense of emptiness in a rain of silvered droplets.  The lane and the green are almost perfect in their solidarity, save for the occasional echo of an outburst of laughter coming from the general southwest direction and, more specifically, the tavern that lies in said direction.","The street encircles its arms around a disk of green grass and trees that has been planted for the enjoyment of weary travellers.  Benches and a small fountain complement the sense of rest and relaxation.  The thick canopy of many slight silver lunat trees creates an effective defense against snow and rain, although not a perfect one.  The scent of cooking meats from Liani's Heaven to the southwest indicates where most folk go when the weather becomes too much of a burden for mere leaves."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":75,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":260,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue","descriptions":["Shadows fall like curtains, blurring the features of the homes that line the darkly cobbled street.  In the distance, the Great Tower of Shard knifes the sky in a glow of silver light that shines through the night.  To the southwest the Tower of Honor echoes that glow, a pale pearl shadow of the city's heart.","A glimpse of green can be caught just to the northeast, and beyond that the shimmer of silver that marks the Great Tower of Shard.  Homes of varying sizes and upkeep march in orderly rows up the sides of the slick, dark blue cobblestone street.  The buildings on the east side are markedly older -- and in a shabbier state -- than the ones on the west."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go blue shop"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":220,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue","descriptions":["A round, squat building -- clearly of Halfling architecture -- curls like an over-excitable kitten amidst the otherwise sober and silent Elven and Elothean homes here.  Small drawings of butterflies, winged ale kegs, and tipsy Fae -- done in luminescent green and blue paint -- decorate the sides of the building.  The stalks of some bizarre plant jealously guard the well-lit entrance to the tavern, their flowers brushing all but the shortest patrons.","A cheerfully painted building of unconventional Halfling architecture sticks out like a rose amongst lilies here, its front and sides happily decorated with butterflies, winged ale kegs, and tipsy Fae.  Giant hollyhocks -- almost too tall to be believed -- jealously guard the entrance to the tavern, their stalks covered in red and pink blossoms that are surely kept in perpetual bloom by a local well-paid lifesculptor."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":77,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":245,"exit":"go","move":"go tavern"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":160,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sapphire Avenue","descriptions":["The Bridge of Suns spans confidently over the dark water channel that sweeps through Shard here.  Beyond it, the glowing Tower of Honor can be clearly seen casting a soft nimbus down on the grounds that lie about it.  There is a sense of safety here -- this is a place where the denizens leave their doors unlocked at night with no fear.","The Bridge of Suns spans confidently over the narrow water channel that sweeps through Shard here.  Beyond it, the prim and proper Tower of Honor can be clearly seen, its all but blinding gleam striking an impressive image.  The chime of hooves on stones echoes distinctly over the water, challenging the faint of heart to the call of the valiant and sure.  The homes that sit nearest to the bridge are austere and well maintained, bolstering the pride that emanates from the home of Ilithi's Paladins."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":60,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["The distant drone of chanting floats over the city from the west where Wyvern Mountain rises.  Held sacred by the true worshippers of the World Dragon, its primary shrine is open all year round, even if the gates that mark the end of Moonstone Street's journey west aren't.","The Bridge of Rooks rears up from the distant east like an exposed spine of black bone arching out of the dark river of cobblestones that is Moonstone Street.  Pilgrims in plain garments of woven linen move in a steady line from or to the west, heading for the city gates and the mountain that lies beyond the West Bridge where the famous shrine to the World Dragon -- built by Sh'kial -- lies."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":43,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":487,"exit":"go","move":"go white-domed building"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":100,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["The dark ribbon of the road flows in a smooth line, one way rolling without a ripple toward the looming presence of Wyvern Mountain to the west, the other toward the magnificence of the dully glowing Great Tower to the east.","Cobblestones the color of chips of obsidian cover Moonstone Street, their smooth, unmarred surface revealing to be clearly much sturdier than the color they simulate.  Carts drawn by exquisitely groomed horses pass toward the east, some empty, some filled with perishables or sundries, all led by handsomely dressed young men and women infused with the bolstered pride born of the money that employs them."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":78,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal-spired building"},{"to":484,"exit":"go","move":"go mercantile entrance"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":140,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["Deserted and lonely, a small, dark shop painted with strange gleaming markings is nearly dwarfed by the looming edifice of the nearby bank and the dramatic silhouette of the Great Tower.  A sign hangs over the doorway, swinging in the city's chilly lakeside breeze.","The glittering dome of the city's bank can be seen rising up to the east, the marble that composes it contrasting with the Great Tower that shoots up past it like a spear of silver breaking through a black cloud.  Judging by the number of people passing beneath its swinging sign to the goods that lie within, a shop painted a solemn dark blue and drawn in silver with stars and moons is the main attraction on the street."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":79,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal plaza"},{"to":790,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting tower"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":180,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["The darkly gleaming beauty of the city's bank stands out even at night, its polished facade engraved with the image of Kertigen.  Although the doors are shut and the lights mostly extinguished, the sound of movement from the patrol that prowls the bank's grounds can still be heard making their rounds.  The three-story office of the Provincial Administrator of Orders watches over the lonely street.","An Elven overseer dressed smartly in rainbowed chain and plate watches as four Gor'Tog guards prowl about the city's bank, her arms folded over her chest and her jaw set with determination.  Composed of marble mined from the local mountains, the domed building is Elothean in design and exudes the kind of overbearing snobbery and strength that can only be bought with platinum.  The three-story office of the Provincial Administrator of Orders looms over the street."],"exits":[{"to":82,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":80,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go bank"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":82,"x":220,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["The melodical chuckle of a fountain is the only sound to be heard echoing through the streets at this hour.  Immaculate homes make up much of the avenue, quiet with resting souls.  To the east, the Bridge of Rooks rises up from the street in a dark, sly arc of black wood that would be invisible were it sprinkled with stars.","There is a noticeable lack of streetwise peddlers in this part of town, and what children can be seen are kept under close watch by the appropriate guardians instead of set free to run free and underfoot.  The streets are immaculate, the gardens beautiful and ornate, kept so by heavy maintenance overseen by the city's lifesculptors.  To the east rises the dark Bridge of Rooks."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":260,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street via The Bridge of Rooks","descriptions":["Gleaming black railings of polished oak and planking of stained deobar compose the aptly named Bridge of Rooks.  To the east the warm glow of a building challenges the night for its control over the darkness, in no way aided by the shadow of the Great Tower that strikes out of the heart of the city further east.  The bridge connects the east and west ends of Moonstone Street, dividing near the center to meet up with Emerald Lane to the northeast and Sapphire Avenue to the southeast.","Gleaming black railings of polished oak and planking of stained deobar compose the aptly named Bridge of Rooks.  To the east the Great Tower challenges the sky for possession, its pennants rippling like a lady's ribbons in a gentle lakeside breeze.  The bridge connects the east and west ends of Moonstone Street, dividing near the center to meet up with Emerald Lane to the northeast and Sapphire Avenue to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":84,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":73,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":82,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":300,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["A splendid building composed of a fine blond wood supported by beams of crystal stands head above shoulders over all other establishments by the Bridge of Rooks on Moonstone Street.  Still more impressive is a completely crystal phoenix that seems to spring out of the doorway's lintel, its wings unfurling to sweep under the roof before curling up at the ends.  The sculpture's breathtaking beauty is only matched by the gleaming black elegance of the bridge to the west that rises up to embrace the air."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":462,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"},{"to":662,"exit":"go","move":"go gulley"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":340,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Moonstone Street","descriptions":["Dark grey stones cover the surface of Moonstone Street, creating artful whorls and spirals as the lane gradually fades away to the east.  A curious temple crouches quietly on the north side of the street, its front carved with thirteen faces that seem to fade when looked at directly.  The doors stand open despite the dark hour, and two guards wearing faceless hoods stand on either side of the door, wielding massive executioners' axes.","Dark grey stones cover the surface of Moonstone Street, creating artful whorls and spirals as the lane gradually narrows on its way east to the Great Tower.  A curious temple crouches quietly on the north side of the street, its front carved with the faces of the less beneficial aspects of the Thirteen.  A surprisingly steady traffic of curious visitors and dedicated followers keeps the temple a popular -- if uneasy -- attraction within the city."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":84,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":388,"exit":"go","move":"go curious temple","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":86,"x":500,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["This section of town seems completely unlike the rest, enfolded in a pocket of peace and tranquility that radiates from the sedate structure of the Temple of Light.  Even in darkness, the glow of hundreds of candles and fires from within keeps the building out of the shadows.  And even in darkness, the doors to the temple remain open, the gentle sound of rhythmic chanting floating out over the air.","The strained sense of purpose that permeates the rest of the busy city is blanketed by the presence of the temple, a classical building made of a light amber material.  Thirteen pillars uphold the slightly sloped roof, each support carved with a face of one of the the major gods of Elanthia, representing their benevolent aspects.  Rippling steps smoothed from two hundred years of feet lead up to a dark archway where figures in beige wool robes stand, their hoods drawn down."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":57,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go temple","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":87,"x":540,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["Small homes and shops sit between the city's temple to the west, and the Bridge of Wrens to the east.  One curious building covered entirely in ivy and closed etrana blossoms sits close to the riverlet's bank, its door chained shut.  The inquisitive twitter of sleeping birds floats down from the shop's eaves.","Small homes and shops sit between the city's temple to the west, and the Bridge of Wrens to the east.  One curious building covered entirely in ivy and etrana blossoms sits close to the riverlet's bank, its door chained shut.  The inquisitive twitter of birds floats down from the shop's eaves."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":88,"x":580,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street via The Bridge of Wrens","descriptions":["The sound of rushing water flows up from beneath the Bridge of Wrens.  The glassy material which composes the structure glows softly, as if with its own light.  Two parts of the bridge splits off to the north- and southwest, leading up to a darkened northeast street of Shard, while the rest of it connects smoothly to the west and east with Sunstone Street.","The Bridge of Wrens rises up over one of the great waterways of Shard, its surface glassy but pebbled to create a grippable -- albeit hard -- surface.  The air is fresh from where it wafts up from the sapphire blue channel below.  The bridge splits off to the north- and southwest, leading up to Opal Street, while the rest of it connects smoothly to the west and east with Sunstone Street."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":61,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":87,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":53,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":89,"x":620,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["Sunstone Street's cobblestones wink like fallen stars as the street sweeps slowly up to form the Bridge of Wrens to the west.  Quiet homes surrounded by shadowy gardens stand to either side of the lane, their painted fronts and sides dulled by the darkness.  High overhead the beating of wings chases over the velvet night, the call of a nightingale seeking to sing down the moons echoing over the stillness.","Pieces of blue and green cobblestones sweep in a smooth wave over the street as it slowly rises to form the Bridge of Wrens to the west.  Quaint homes surrounded by fragrant herb patches, built with small paths leading up to doorways framed in flowering vines, sprout up like brightly born blooms all up and down the street.  An Elven lifesculptor, dressed in the shifting green robes of his people, busies himself amongst the vegetation, an expression of peaceful serenity on his face."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":141,"exit":"go","move":"go small home"}]},
  {"id":90,"x":660,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["A building quite out of place to the rest of the city lords over a large part of this portion of Sunstone Street.  Horses have been painted around the cylindrical, white-washed exterior, and a brick pathway leads up to the arched entrance over which a sign reads, \"Rundmolen Bros. Storage Company.\"  Judging by the way many of the city's inhabitants seem to be carefully skirting it, the building would appear to be either very new, or very disturbing to the people of Shard.","A building quite out of place to the rest of the city lords over a large part of this portion of Sunstone Street.  Torches have been shoved into sconces along the sides, causing the horses that are painted on the building's walls to flicker and dance animatedly.  The light is too poor to illuminate the sign that hangs over the doorway, although by day it would be prominent enough."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":89,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":803,"exit":"go","move":"go carousel"}]},
  {"id":91,"x":700,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["A small shop adorned with hanging baskets outside its door is the only remarkable landmark on the street.  A cold breeze, sweeping up off the lake, clamps chilly fingers around everything with a viselike grip that is only shaken with plenty of coats and blankets.","A row of Elven women sit outside a small shop, reeds and strips of willow lying across their laps as they work to make baskets and mats.  One small girl sits nearby, watching as her mother works and learning the family's craft through silent observation.  The smells of the city -- a complex mixture of baking bread, yak dung, sweat, and green trees -- weave in and around anything and everything, racing over the people and the structures on a spirited lakeside breeze."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":90,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":740,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["The street is almost depressingly empty with the onset of night.  From time to time a cloaked and anxious-looking peasant scurries by, exposing themselves only briefly to the darkness before heading into the safety of a home or other establishment.","A lively and steady stream of civilians, traders, and heroes heading for the hunt passes through the street.  Some chatter incessantly with a seemingly perpetual abundance of energy, while others move quietly -- almost undetected.  Vendors attempt to attract the attention of the richer ones, their voices barking dry and loud through the air."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":91,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":780,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Sunstone Street","descriptions":["The gentle rise of the Bridge of Wrens glitters over the western horizon, its slow arch disappearing as it dips down.  Beyond that, the flanged spikes of the Temple of Light shoot up, snagging on the sky.  The shadow of the city walls falls heavily across the ground, protective of the houses and businesses it enfolds."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":92,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go well"}]},
  {"id":94,"x":520,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["Wagon wheels and pack animals' hooves clatter against the cobblestones of nearby Opal Street.  In contrast, the only traffic along this quiet side street is the occasional servant, making his way to the local well."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":54,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Pearl Street"]},
  {"id":95,"x":530,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["A low brick fence encloses a diamond-shaped patch of greenery that grows in the middle of the cobblestone street.  The road splits to swerve around the tiny herb garden maintained by local residents.  Culinary herbs fill the garden, arranged in an intricate tapestry of color and texture."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":94,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":96,"x":540,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["Closely packed houses line the street, jammed one against another like children struggling for street space at a parade.  The wide mix of architecture indicates the area grew by slow accumulation, rather than careful planning by the Shard city magistrates."],"exits":[{"to":97,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":95,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":97,"x":550,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["Heavy, green moss grows on the fieldstones that compose the wall encircling the local well.  A few granite benches nearby provide a place to rest and chat with neighbors before carrying the heavy buckets back home."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":96,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":98,"x":560,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["Closely grouped houses line the street, their colorful window boxes filled with fragrant flowers.  The smell of roasting meat or a freshly baked pie ocassionally tickles the air, carried by a mild, intermittent breeze."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":97,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":99,"x":570,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Pearl Street","descriptions":["A peach tree spreads its twisted limbs over a green area at the end of the cul-de-sac.  White wooden benches painted with images of flowers and birds stand along the edge of the grass, providing a comfortable place for local residents to gather."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":100,"x":380,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["Linden trees shade the path as it wends its way between the homes which line the tranquil street.  Patches of green grass and white fences separate the houses from each other.  The arched doorways are painted in cheerful colors to match the tile roofs."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":101,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Lapis Lazuli Road"]},
  {"id":101,"x":370,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["Intricate patterns of twining vines and flowers decorate the arched doorways of the local homes.  In one yard, a flowering cherry tree extends its gnarled branches over a cast iron bench, the fragrant blossoms falling like snow to lie scattered across the grass."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":102,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":574,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered shop"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":102,"x":360,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["A tub filled with willow withies soaking in water sits beside a bench near the door of one home.  Atop the bench, a half-finished basket displays a two-tone interlocking diamond pattern typical of the area.  Linden trees shade the bench, making it a comfortable place to work even during the heat of the day."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":103,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":103,"x":350,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["Footsteps clatter against cobblestones along the street as you make your way down the shady tree-lined lane.  Colorful homes painted with twining vines and flowers line the street, their arched doors and windows half-open to allow a breeze to cool the interior.  Children's toys lie scattered in one yard, awaiting the return of their owners."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":104,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":104,"x":340,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["Green and white picket fences separate the houses, providing support to colorful morning glories which twine along their length.  A gate swings in the breeze with a harsh squeal of rusty hinges which grates upon the ears.  Nearby, a cherry tree spreads its white-blossomed limbs over the fence which separates the yard in which it grows from the cobblestoned street."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":105,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":105,"x":330,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Lapis Lazuli Road","descriptions":["The homes at the end of the cul-de-sac are laid out in a graceful arch, their doors painted in all the colors of the rainbow.  A fountain stands in the middle of a cobblestone circle, a fanciful creation of white marble with a statue of a woman surrounded by leaping dolphins and merfolk."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":106,"x":800,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Street of the Four Moons","descriptions":["An herb garden grows beside the door to a whitewashed wooden home, displaying a neatly tended collection of kitchen herbs.  Close at hand for watering the plants, a dipper sits in a wooden bucket upon the stoop.  Old-fashioned stained glass panels top the windows, forming colorful designs of flowers and leaves."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":107,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Four Moons"]},
  {"id":107,"x":790,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Street of the Four Moons","descriptions":["Elderly homes made of brick and wood line the street.  Typical of older Elothean homes, the arched entries are inlaid with fan-shaped panes of golden glass.  Slight variations in the color of the brick and paint mark repairs to the homes which, while old, are lovingly maintained by their owners."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":108,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":108,"x":780,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Street of the Four Moons","descriptions":["Elven ivy clings to the mortar of a low brick wall which runs along the street.  The thin green tendrils have pulled loose a few bricks, but new white mortar has been applied to patch the holes.  A white marble capstone turns a rather utilitarian fence into a convenient place to relax while talking to neighbors."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":109,"x":770,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Street of the Four Moons","descriptions":["Bird feeders hang from the branches of a creamy-blossomed lemon tree, attracting a flock of brightly-colored songbirds.  During the day, their cheerful songs fill the quiet side street with music.  Scattered feathers upon the ground indicate the presence of neighborhood cats who regard the tiny creatures as dinner."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":110,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":110,"x":760,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Street of the Four Moons","descriptions":["Vegetables grow in a community garden at the end of the street, providing fresh produce for local residents.  Green beans, t'mat and merziel fruit are just a few of the varieties visible.  A nearby well provides a convenient source of water required to maintain the lush growth."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":111,"x":630,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Neatly manicured lawns of lush green grass border the clean cobblestones of this bright side street.  The nearby homes exhibit signs of recent restoration, several displaying fresh whitewashing and colorfully painted shutters.  No trace of the dilapidation from years past is evident now that the neighborhood's revival has reached fruition."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":112,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Coral Crescent"]},
  {"id":112,"x":600,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Tidy lilac bushes grow beside the road, their deep purple flowers releasing a heady fragrance which fills the air and lifts the spirits.  The shrubs are meticulously well-maintained to match the clean facades and lawns of the nearby homes.  Sounds of the city echo across the clean cobblestone street as subtle reminders of the daily bustle of Shard's residents."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":113,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":113,"x":580,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Birds flit between the saplings planted on either side of the cobblestone street.  Freshly mulched, the young trees display a variety of glossy ribbons tied to their branches for luck, prosperity and other benevolent wishes in acknowledgement of the neighborhood's new beginnings.  The houses' shutters flaunt similar pastel hues, parading a rainbow of carnival colors down the street."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":114,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":114,"x":560,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Vivid yellow and orange blossoms bob amidst the profusion of butterfly vines twining through a whitewashed lattice arching over one home's walkway.  In contrast, a riotous tangle of pink and purple morning glories overflows from a copperwood window box across the way.  The street cobbles remain a plain bleached white to draw attention up from the ground to the other handmade planters and terra-cotta pots brimming with flourishing flowers around the neighborhood."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":113,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":115,"x":560,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Recycled from the slate shingles belonging to the neighborhood's former houses, a modest fountain beautifies this bend of the street.  Agreeable, soothing burbles tumble from the cascade and drift along the cobbles, mingling with the freshly planted saplings and recently trimmed grass.  Local birds and the occasional squirrel venture to the fountain's edge to sip from the cool water or bathe in its shallow depths."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":114,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":116,"x":560,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Coral Crescent","descriptions":["Junegrass and indigo imported from the prairie add a touch of wilderness to the carefully cultivated urban milieu, the ornamental plants rising from the depths of sculpted clay pots and sun-bleached wooden troughs.  Secured amongst the paving stones in the middle of the street, a thick bronze plaque boasts elaborate calligraphy and imagery.  An ironwork bench rests under a tall linden tree for travelers needing respite from their travels about the city."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":115,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":117,"x":380,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Garden Crescent","descriptions":["Dense shrubs create a tall barrier around a narrow metal doorway beyond which little can be seen.  Along the opposite side of the street, a living fence of interwoven willows blocks nearly all views of a monastery set far back from the street, a heavy wooden gate at its pathway.  Crepe myrtles mark where the parkway meets Ruby Street."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":118,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":583,"exit":"go","move":"go dome-shaped building","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":118,"x":370,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Garden Crescent","descriptions":["Tiger lilies poke bright orange petals through the bars surrounding a massive wrought iron gate on the western side of the parkway.  Across the cobblestone street, an austere building of unfinished grey wood with a matching fence has a dove statue at its low gate.  Where the road curves to the north, a limestone building with a bronze gate is flanked by granite lions."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":586,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden building","hidden":true},{"to":594,"exit":"go","move":"go low gate","hidden":true},{"to":768,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":119,"x":370,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Garden Crescent","descriptions":["Snow-white lilies border the edge of a sprawling estate to the east.  Across the street, a shallow moat surrounding an arching building boasts slender kokona reeds that sway in only the stiffest breeze.  Where the road bends to the south, blue and violet lotus blossoms float on small pools glittering with gold and silver pebbles before a stately manor."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":120,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":120,"x":380,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Garden Crescent","descriptions":["Flourishing crepe myrtles with smooth grey branches line the broad cobblestone street.  An immense dark marble manor, its grounds surrounded by a wrought iron fence with a broad gate, occupies the western side of the street.  To the south lies a building beyond a similar fence of gnarled osage trees, a narrow gate before it."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":119,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":151,"exit":"go","move":"go broad gate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":121,"x":40,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["Whitewashed wooden houses with colorfully painted porches line the cobblestone lane.  Copperleaf trees are planted along the side of the road, each centered neatly on the grassy verge before each house.  The precise spacing of houses and trees and the neatly trimmed grass and shrubs give the area an almost military air, as if no imperfection would be tolerated."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Bloodstone Way"]},
  {"id":122,"x":50,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["The oblong cobblestones which pave the street are laid out in a neat chevron pattern, like flights of arrows soaring along the shady lane.  The houses are all constructed to the same design, with whitewashed clapboards and weathered silverwood shingles.  The only distinguishing features to identify one house from the other are the vibrant colors of the shutters and doors."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":121,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":123,"x":60,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["The lane widens into a formal square before continuing on its way.  A wooden pole flies the flag of the Ferdahl's personal guard beside a granite obelisk erected in the center of the square.  Row after row of neatly lettered names are chiseled into the reddish stone surface."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":122,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":124,"x":70,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["Copperleaf trees shade the houses which line the street, keeping them cool on even the hottest days of summer.  A whetstone sits beside a bottle of oil atop a worn wooden bench next to the door of one of the homes.  Old rags are neatly stored in a bucket beneath the bench."],"exits":[{"to":125,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":123,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":125,"x":80,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["A rail fence surrounds a small practice yard sandwiched between two homes.  During the day, children learn their first lessons in swordplay from a veteran guardsman or build their strength swinging wooden blades at the practice pells erected along the north end of the yard."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":124,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":126,"x":90,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Bloodstone Way","descriptions":["The chevron pattern of cobblestones continues at the circular cul-de-sac at the end of the street.  The chevrons radiate from the eight compass points, meeting at a bronze plaque inlaid in the road at the center of the circle.  A ring of copperleaf trees has been planted at regular intervals around the curve, providing shade for residents and travelers to the neighborhood."],"exits":[{"to":125,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":127,"x":40,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Shard, West Battlements","descriptions":["Paved in stone, the walkway extends a short distance to the south, giving a good view of the West Gates below.  Though the battlement's construction feels somewhat hasty, several reinforcements make it able to hold up to strong attacks.  The Great Tower lies directly to the east, the sturdy walls coming to just above the city's rooftops."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":43,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}],"aliases":["W Battlements"]},
  {"id":128,"x":40,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Shard, West Battlements","descriptions":["High above the West Gate, embrasures pierce the stone battlements between the merlons that give cover to the defenders of the walls.  The perch commands the main entrance to the city with a field of fire that covers the West Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":129,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"}]},
  {"id":129,"x":-20,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, West Bridge","descriptions":["Eerie chanting echoes over the bridge, filling the air with an ominous reminder that the World Dragon is still an influential power.  Wyvern Mountain rises up blotting out the western sky.","The walls of Shard gleam with an inner light rivaling the sun for magnificence, the carefully cut crystal reflecting and refracting light in amazing patterns.  Wyvern Mountain rises up in the west, a huge shadow against the daytime sky."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["W Gate","West Gate","wgate"],"linksTo":"Map69_Shard_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":130,"x":800,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Battlements","descriptions":["Paved in stone, the walkway extends a short distance to the north, giving a good view of the East Gates below.  Though the battlement's construction feels somewhat hasty, several reinforcements make it able to hold up to strong attacks.  The Great Tower lies directly to the west, the sturdy walls coming to just above the city's rooftops."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":32,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}],"aliases":["E Battlements"]},
  {"id":131,"x":800,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Battlements","descriptions":["High above the East Gate, embrasures pierce the stone battlements between the merlons that give cover to the defenders of the walls.  The perch commands the main entrance to the city with a field of fire that covers the East Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":132,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":860,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Bridge","descriptions":["The extravagance of the eastern quarter of Shard is evident here milk-white marble railings gleam on the cloudiest days.  The marble and the life-sculpted deobar supports show that no expense was spared in olden times, and the new paving stones that cover the roadway blend unobtrusively with the old construction."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["E Gate","East Gate","EastGate","Premium Portal","Portal","egate"],"linksTo":"Map66_STR3.xml"},
  {"id":133,"x":400,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Battlements","descriptions":["Paved in stone, the walkway extends a short distance to the west, giving a good view of the North Gates below.  Though the battlement's construction feels somewhat hasty, several reinforcements make it able to hold up to strong attacks.  The Great Tower lies directly to the south, the sturdy walls coming to just above the city's rooftops."],"exits":[{"to":134,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":134,"x":380,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Battlements","descriptions":["High above the North Gate, embrasures pierce the stone battlements between the merlons that give cover to the defenders of the walls.  The perch commands the main entrance to the city with a field of fire that covers the North Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":135,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"}],"aliases":["N Battlements"]},
  {"id":135,"x":420,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Bridge","descriptions":["To the north of this opulent bridge, the Dragon Spine Mountains span the horizon and exhale a dense forest known simply as the Dragon's Breath.  The North city gates stand close by, guarded by sharp-eyed soldiers on the city wall."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["N Gate","North Gate","NorthGate","ngate"],"linksTo":"Map66_STR3.xml"},
  {"id":136,"x":740,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Tunnels","descriptions":["Overhead is the loose cover on an abandoned well on the surface, to judge by the muffled footsteps and hoofbeats coming from above.  Directly below the opening, a wooden ladder descends into a shaft in the earth.  A tunnel leads north just under the surface, and another tunnel in the western wall slopes sharply down out of sight."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":137,"x":675,"y":415,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The Carousel","descriptions":["Exotic tapestries of every possible description drape the wall ringing the Carousel's core.  A circular roof supports a vast framework of iron and timbers rising to the building's apex.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights within the structure form the strikingly complex and beautiful mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":803,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":138,"exit":"go","move":"go registration desk"},{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":784,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Carousel","Vault"]},
  {"id":138,"x":665,"y":415,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Carousel Desk","descriptions":["A long wooden desk spans the width of the western wall.  Brass lanterns hang from the ceiling, and the floor behind the desk is covered in spotless red tile."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":782,"exit":"go","move":"go registrar's office"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Lost and Found"]},
  {"id":139,"x":675,"y":405,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Carousel Booth","descriptions":["A polished steel lever protrudes from the eastern wall of the small, ebony-panelled room, flanking a steel door to the north."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":140,"x":675,"y":395,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Carousel Chamber","descriptions":["A sturdy vault, set in the back wall, stands ready for your use.  The floor is covered by a soft thick carpet of deep red, and the walls are paneled in polished golden pine.  Looking at the back wall, you notice a tiny gap between it and the rest of the room."],"exits":[{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":141,"x":620,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Meek's Stitchery","descriptions":["Piles of fabric and cloth lie in cluttered heaps about the room, all but hiding the small store's owner.  Curled like a frightened kitten on a stool and working diligently at her mending, Meek appears to either not notice or not care who enters and who exits.  Shirts, skirts, jackets, and articles of clothing of all types hang behind her on a rack."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Meek's Stitchery","Stitchery"]},
  {"id":142,"x":720,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Avlea's Bows, The Straight and Arrow","descriptions":["A light dusting of wood shavings coats the floor where the Elves who work in this shop have left behind the remnants of their handiwork.  Seated on a stool and bracing a bow against her knees as she carves away at it is Avlea, the bowyer who owns this shop. Various quivers, arrows, crossbows, darts, and bows hang off the walls -- the only fixed objects in the shop that are not covered with some form of dust."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Avlea's Bows","Bows","Fletching"]},
  {"id":143,"x":640,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Greenwalls Tower, Arrow Range","descriptions":["As you look about, you wonder for a moment just what the lunatics out at the far end of the field are doing just standing there while apprentice Rangers shoot arrows at them, until you realize that this is Shard's idea of agility training.  You do note to only minor relief that the bows in use appear to be lightly strung, the arrow tips padded against severe puncture damage."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy path"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Agility"]},
  {"id":144,"x":580,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"MAMAS Company, Shard Branch","descriptions":["Shard's assay shop is filled with the smell of new wood and plaster.  Builders move in and out, hurrying to get the place finished, while the assay clerk stands behind a counter in the midst of the clutter and confusion, quietly working away."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["MAMAS"]},
  {"id":145,"x":180,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, First Bank of Ilithi","descriptions":["Creamy white walls and floors surmounted by a dome-shaped ceiling forms the bank of Shard.  Streaks of black and silver run through the natural marble used in the structure, and short halls branch off to the north and east."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":146,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":81,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Bank"]},
  {"id":146,"x":190,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"First Bank of Ilithi, Coin Exchange","descriptions":["The walls of this relatively small alcove rise up in a smooth, rounded arch of glossy white marble.  A friendly-looking Elven man stands behind a desk with fifteen small drawers in it, taking coins and exchanging them for the local currency."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Exchange"]},
  {"id":147,"x":180,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"First Bank of Ilithi, Teller's Windows","descriptions":["Polished walnut windows and paneling separate the customers from the tellers and vault against the back of the wall.  Several young and pretty Elothean men and women stand behind bars of an anlora-avtoma and steel alloy to process transactions.  A gleaming brass sign is embedded into the west wall, stating the bank's policies."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Teller"]},
  {"id":148,"x":200,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"First Bank of Ilithi, Exchange Vault","descriptions":["Leather-clad guards stand at attention on each side of the polished blue marble arch which frames the moongate.  Behind them, out of reach of the portal, a slender fair-haired Elothean woman reclines on a comfortable high-backed chair.  Her richly embroidered scarlet silk robes almost conceal the gilded chains which fasten her ankles to iron rings in the floor.  A steady stream of bank employees and favored customers enter and exit the vault all day to process transactions with other banks."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":149,"x":360,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard Tunnels","descriptions":["Brick arches support the foundation of the street overhead, where a barred sewer grate provides easy access to the surface.  Reeking piles of rancid produce have been dumped here by the bazaar vendors above, and the stench discourages any curious surface dwellers from paying this area too close attention.  The sewer tunnel slopes steeply downwards to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":150,"x":280,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Silena's Curio Tent","descriptions":["The clutter that occupies most of this tent would seem to make it impossible for movement, save that it all has a strange, almost catlike quality that causes it to move aside to allow just enough room to navigate through.  The proprietor -- Silena Wilderant -- sits at the back of the tent in a cross-legged meditative position, one eye cracked as she watches her business with a snicker and a grin for baffled newcomers."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Silena's Curio Tent","Curio Tent"]},
  {"id":151,"x":920,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Inside the Gate","descriptions":["Low lanterns flanking a stone walkway illuminate the path from the street to a towering black marble building.  Further around the grounds, the pools of light shift and move around a variety of ornamental foliage.  Perched on the roof high above, the vague outline of twin gargoyles can be seen.","Smooth grey stone forms a walkway from the street to the entrance of a towering black marble building.  Expansive grounds stretch around it, neatly manicured grass bearing a variety of flowering shrubs and graceful trees.  High above, twin faces of snarling gargoyle sculptures glare down from the roof."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":152,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go marble entryway"},{"to":120,"exit":"go","move":"go broad gate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":152,"x":910,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Gardens","descriptions":["Darting around and through the ornamental shrubs which dot the grounds, enchanted orbs of silvery light cause odd, shifting shadows amidst the fyearikil agani trees.  Rising behind them is a tall cut stone wall which stretches out in either direction.","Ornamental shrubs in fanciful shapes dot the manicured landscape within the cut stone walls of the House proper, many representing the constellations of the heavens.  Rumor has it that they shift places as the seasons progress to mimic the skies above, though it is difficult to tell with the transient nature of the leafy fyearikil agani."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":151,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":153,"x":930,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Pond","descriptions":["Glistening in the evening light, a small pond surrounded by green reeds occupies this corner of the House grounds.  Reflected in the sparkling waters of the crystal-clear pond is a majestic willow tree, its fragrant branches dangling low and filling the air with a fresh scent.  Clusters of water lilies float lazily about on the water, always managing to stay just out of reach.","Shining in the sunlight, a small pond surrounded by green reeds occupies this corner of the House grounds.  Reflected in the sparkling waters of the crystal-clear pond is a majestic willow tree, its fragrant branches dangling low and filling the air with a fresh scent.  Clusters of water lilies float lazily about on the water, always managing to stay just out of reach."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":698,"exit":"go","move":"go tree"}]},
  {"id":154,"x":910,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Gardens","descriptions":["White beeswax candles flicker with pale light, encircling a glassy obsidian fountain.  The natural flow and warp of the stone cause odd reflections in the water before it spills into the basin below.  Ringing the crushed marble gravel surrounding the fountain is an abundant moon garden that fills the air with a strong, sweet fragrance.  A window of the building is barely visible in the darkness.","Clear water flows from a glassy obsidian fountain, spilling across its smooth surface and into the wide basin below with muted splashes.  Leafy green plants grow all around the crushed marble gravel surrounding the fountain, leaving barely enough room to see one of the building's windows."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":920,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Entryway","descriptions":["Gilded inlay stretches across the polished black marble floor of the foyer, forming the crest of the House of the Silver Star.  Crystal candelabra light the spacious hall, the acoustics of the vaulted ceiling oddly muffling all sounds coming from the rest of the area.  A gleaming mahogany desk rests just to one side of the doorway, a sign perched on it directing visitors seeking to register with the House to the east."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":156,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":151,"exit":"go","move":"go marble entryway"},{"to":686,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood arch"}],"aliases":["House of the Silver Star","Silver Star"]},
  {"id":156,"x":910,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Gazing down from the walls are portraits of prominent House members past, the glow from the large fireplace reflected on their gilded frames.  Rich red curtains are open to reveal a view of the manicured grounds outside, and plush black velvet furniture is clustered atop a jewel-toned raw silk woven rug."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":157,"x":930,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Scribe Office","descriptions":["Dim light from outside streams in through the glass windows whose thick red brocade curtains hang open to reveal the shadowy visage of a massive willow tree outside.  Lit by floral-themed stained glass lamps, an ironwood-edged mahogany desk covered with official-looking documents and lineage charts dominates the richly appointed room.  A plush blue armchair sits to one side.","Sunlight streams in through the glass windows whose thick red brocade curtains hang open to reveal a view of a massive willow tree outside.  An ironwood-edged mahogany desk covered with official-looking documents and lineage charts dominates the richly appointed room, and a plush blue armchair is pulled away from it for guests."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":158,"x":460,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Aelik's Pawn","descriptions":["The deceiving appearance of this shop's broken down and dreary outside is nothing compared to the clean and carefully organized inside.  While a fine layer of dust does seem to coat some of the older items, there is a feeling of constant change here as things are shuffled about, sold, or moved off to other locations."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":159,"exit":"go","move":"go backroom"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Aelik's Pawn","Pawn"]},
  {"id":159,"x":460,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aelik's Pawn, Backroom","descriptions":["Shelves line the walls, side-by-side with cabinets that hold various oddities and objects that will not fit in the front room being shoved in here instead.  Clutter covers nearly every inch of bare space, piling up to the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":0,"exit":"climb","move":"room look behind cab;look behind cab;climb hidden ladder"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":460,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Secret Nook","descriptions":["This cramped nook forms the base of a narrow shaft leading straight up, with a rickety wooden ladder stretching up to a trapdoor far above.  The nook itself looks to be a dead end, the ladder balanced against a curving wall of sheet rock."],"exits":[{"to":159,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"room sear;go tiny hatch","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":161,"x":460,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Ruined Building","descriptions":["Crumbling stone walls sunken into the earth are all that remain to mark this area as the basement of some long abandoned structure.  A skeletal framework rises into the sky above, framing the outline of what used to be the first floor.  The few surviving beams are blackened and charred."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":162,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":162,"x":500,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard Tunnels","descriptions":["A stream of refuse flows through a rough channel cut into the floor, reeking of sewage and things better left unexplored.  A rough-hewn shaft in the ceiling rises toward the surface, spotted with slippery but useable stone handholds.  The tunnel continues into the distance to the northwest and slopes upwards slightly to the south."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":163,"x":540,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Abandoned Building","descriptions":["Once inside, it is obvious that this abandoned carriage barn is not as abandoned as other buildings in the neighborhood.  Although unpainted, the walls are shored up with sound wooden planking, and the flagstone floor is swept clean.  A ladder pokes from an opening in the floor."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":164,"x":460,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Balint's Tiles","descriptions":["Behind a faded and unassuming storefront, the tile business of Balint Firkusny appears to be booming.  Every inch of wall space is covered with tiles in a variety of colors, sizes and textures.  The Elven merchant himself scurries about, pointing to one area, highlighting the details of another under a small oil lamp, and in general making a nuisance of himself to his quiet, dedicated staff."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Balint's Tiles"]},
  {"id":165,"x":400,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Stableyard","descriptions":["The sweet, musty smell of hay links with the aroma of cooking food that comes from the adjacent inn.  Grey stones line the little cobblestone court, their surface gleaming despite the darkness, leading up with a gentle twist to the darkness-painted wooden structure of the inn's stable.","The sweet, musty smell of hay mingles with the less appealing ones of sweat and manure to form a complex aroma that is further compounded by the faint scent of cooking food that comes from the adjacent inn.  Grey stones line the little cobblestone court, their surfaces slick from a recent scrubbing, leading up with a gentle twist to the red-painted wooden structure of the inn's stable."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":614,"exit":"go","move":"go stables"}]},
  {"id":166,"x":380,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Front Desk","descriptions":["Shadows drift in lazy patterns over the gleaming dark wood that compose the floor and walls, digging into the carvings of roses that gracefully climb in vines over the satiny planks.  A black desk serviced by a young man curves out of the east wall.  Stairs lead up, a pattern of black roses woven into the blue carpeting that covers them.","Gleaming dark wood compose the floor and walls here, and tiny roses have been carved into the satiny, varnished planks.  Warm sunlight streams through the open doorway, alive with the dance of motes of dust.  A black desk serviced by a young woman curves out of the east wall.  Stairs lead up, a pattern of black roses woven into the blue carpeting that covers them."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":19,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":168,"exit":"climb","move":"climb flight steps"},{"to":171,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":167,"x":370,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Tavern","descriptions":["Roomy and rectangular, the tavern for Milene's Rose is always busy, but strangely never so full that it becomes unbearably crowded.  A booth in the corner allows for privacy, and a bar offers service for the thirsty and the hungry.  There is little sign of disarray anywhere."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":732,"exit":"go","move":"go private booth"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Milene's Rose"]},
  {"id":168,"x":370,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Back Hallway","descriptions":["Miniature roses grow in ceramic pots within a shallow bay window at the end of the hallway.  The tiny blooms come in all colors, from pale ivories and pinks to deep corals and crimsons.  A window bench makes this a cozy corner for friends to sit and chat while enjoying the flowers and relaxing after the rigors of the day."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":166,"exit":"climb","move":"climb flight steps"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":169,"x":380,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Back Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway is redolent of lemons and beeswax, rubbed in and buffed to bring out a soft golden sheen in the rosewood paneling.  A large brass pot hangs beneath a half-open skylight, cradling within its confines a s'vraela vine imported from the island of M'Riss.  Beads of dew form on the metal surface of the pot, causing it to shimmer slightly with each movement."],"exits":[{"to":170,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":168,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":170,"x":390,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Back Hallway","descriptions":["Quieter than the front hall or rest of the inn, the rooms in this part of the wide corridor are occupied by permanent guests who choose to reside at the Rose.  Polished marble-topped mahogany tables hold crystal vases filled with fragrant flowers, and a deep blue carpet runs the length of the hall."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":171,"x":380,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Upstairs Landing","descriptions":["This short hallway leads to the rooms of the Rose.  A strip of blue carpeting runs down the floor, looking fresh and clean.  A door of rosewood and a door of silverwillow face each other to the north and south, offering privacy for those who seek it.  Stairs lead down to the light and clamor of the tavern proper."],"exits":[{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"},{"to":173,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"},{"to":166,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":172,"x":370,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Rose Room","descriptions":["Black roses edged in silver have been traced over the watered silk used to cover the walls, the faded rose hue of the fabric adding warm color to this spacious room.  A window in the south wall is framed by thick silk curtains, and a four-poster rosewood bed framed with bedcurtains of white gossamer is positioned in the center of the room.  The sweet scent of the inn's hallmark symbol rests lightly in the air, wafting from a sachet on the bed.  A gleaming rosewood door leads back outside."],"exits":[{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"}]},
  {"id":173,"x":390,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Silver Room","descriptions":["Roses are traced in black over the thin silver leaf paper that has been applied to the walls of this spacious room.  Windows framed by long curtains of white gauze allow for all the kinds of light to slip through -- softly.  A four-poster bed made from a frame of lovingly polished beech wood lies pushed up against the wall, its covers turned down.  A hearth framed by grey bricks allows for coziness in the wintertime.  Through the silverwillow door in the south wall lies the distant world left behind."],"exits":[{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"}]},
  {"id":174,"x":440,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Rotunda","descriptions":["The museum entrance is strangely hushed and peaceful after the day's echoing bustle has ended.  The massive fossilized skeleton of a war mammoth looms ominously on a low marble pedestal in the center of the room.  Shadows cluster in the recesses, while the pale marble of the interior gleams softly in the variable light filtering through the curved crystal panes of the high domed ceiling.","Airy and echoing, the entrance to the Museum is an open and welcoming space ringed with tall gilded columns soaring up to the high domed ceiling.  Atop a low marble pedestal, the massive fossilized skeleton of a war mammoth dominates the room.  Tall palm trees in carved stone planters raise their fringed leaves, vivid against the pale stone, as light spills in through curving crystal panes to splash across the softly gleaming marble of the walls and other surfaces."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":18,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":176,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany archway"},{"to":177,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}]},
  {"id":175,"x":450,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Salon","descriptions":["Polished to a warm glow, mahogany paneling and plush floor rugs lend this room an intimate, hushed atmosphere.  Oversized armchairs provide a comfortable place to sit and chat, or to attend to visiting lecturers.  A carved stone fireplace with a wide mahogany mantel sits opposite floor to ceiling windows that afford a fine view of the tower at the heart of the city.  Spaced about the edges of the room are display pedestals and plinths bearing examples of some of the museum's rare and exotic finds.","Opulent red velvet curtains, which can be drawn to preserve the warmth on cold winter nights, reveal through the tall windows an inspiring view of the Great Tower glittering in the reflected light of the stars and moons.  Lit tapers in branched candlesticks and a crackling fire in the carved stone fireplace lend a cheering warmth and glow to the salon, as well as the pleasant scent of burning apple wood.  Some of the museum's rare and exotic finds are displayed on pedestals around the room."],"exits":[{"to":174,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":179,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-inlaid door"},{"to":180,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":176,"x":440,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Gift Shop","descriptions":["Long and narrow, this room is paneled in rich, dark mahogany.  Plush, patterned rugs cover the cream-and-russet marble floor, and ornate brass lamps support softly glowing gaethzen spheres which shed a warm light on the polished counter."],"exits":[{"to":174,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Scholars' Museum"]},
  {"id":177,"x":440,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Conservatory","descriptions":["In the darkness the glass walls and arched roof fade into invisibility, leaving the impression of a dim, rustling forest open to the aromatic night air.  Drooping leaves dance restlessly, causing shadows to waver in the umbrous light.","Warm and fresh smelling, the conservatory is a mass of thriving foliage.  Among the many trees collected here are shining copperleaf, languid birch and graceful rowan, their branches arching overhead to shade the gravel walkway while brilliant firethorn bush and lush stands of enormous fern grow nearer to the ground.  Exotic flowering plants flourish next to hardier native species in a harmonious whole, their scents mingling in an exhilarating blend of spice, sweet and astringently herbal aromas."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":174,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}]},
  {"id":178,"x":450,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Water Garden","descriptions":["Hushed and silent save for the constant music of trickling water, the stillness of the night wraps this garden in peace.  Faint starlight through the glass reflects in the dark waters of the pool, lending a silvery sheen to the quivering surface and gleaming on the closed buds of the water lilies.  The trailing branches of the willows rustle softly, sheltering the iris and golden flag beneath its leaves.","Serene and refreshing, this room is a refuge for those seeking a calm retreat.  The melodic trickle of water over stone provides a soothing background music broken by an occasional splash as one of the goldfish in the shallow pool leaps in a shining arc.  Deep blue iris, tall rushes, narcissus and golden flag are reflected in the shifting waters, and starry white water lilies cover the surface.  Slender willows bend to trail long branches in the pool and over the mossy rock."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":179,"x":450,"y":570,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Archives","descriptions":["From floor to ceiling this small, windowless room is lined with sturdy oak bookcases, all of them full and some so crammed that the glass doors cannot be closed.  More piles of books and stacked papers cover every surface, tottering in mounds on the seats of chairs, on small side tables and benches, and heaped in unstable pyramids on the flagstone floor itself.  The only partially clear space is the surface of the desk in the center of the room and the heavy oak armchair drawn up behind it."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-inlaid door"}]},
  {"id":180,"x":460,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Scholars' Museum, Gallery","descriptions":["The glow of gaethzen lamps blocks all view of the night outside, giving the gallery the air of a well-lit stage awaiting the opening curtain.  High arched windows reflect the interior like black mirrors, creating a double image which reinforces the sense of unreality.  In the soft light, images in the tapestries and paintings lining the walls flicker, and dim shadows cluster about the display cases and pedestals.","Paintings and tapestries line the walls of this spacious room, interspersed with bronze gaethzen wall lamps.  Spaced along the lengthy tessellated corridor are display cases and pedestals holding more of the museum's treasures and oddities.  High arched windows between columns of creamy veined marble allow light to stream in from the opposite wall while offering a good view of the streetscape outside."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany archway"}]},
  {"id":181,"x":400,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Mirrors by Noelle","descriptions":["White drapes balloon from the roof, giving this store the feeling of a tent established by some temporary merchant.  Occasionally brushing back the colored drop beads that dangle from her veil, Noelle d'Lorchesse smiles quietly as she displays her mirrored wares to discerning customers.  Her visitors are a varied lot, from all across Elanthia, testifying to the Elven glazier's talent and notoriety even at her young age."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mirrors by Noelle","Noelle"]},
  {"id":182,"x":480,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Genevive's Sweet Tooth","descriptions":["The heavenly scent of baking sweets floats through the air on a gentle breeze coming from the oven in the store's backroom.  Metal trays stacked on shelves along the walls hold a wide assortment of finished edibles waiting to be purchased.  Genevive, the woman who single-handedly runs the bakery, runs back and forth from the kitchen to the front room, bringing forth the latest delight."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Genevive's Sweet Tooth"]},
  {"id":183,"x":560,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Vestibule","descriptions":["True to the tavern's name, a noose of thick knotted rope dangles from a wooden beam just above the doorway.  Drunken patrons stagger out the door and into the street, sounds of merriment and music drifting from the common room to the north."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":62,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":184,"x":560,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Common Room","descriptions":["Crackling torches light this musty room, the air filled with the smells of smoke, roasted meat and strong ale.  Tables have been pushed away from the center of the floor to form a makeshift stage for a small band, playing raucous and bawdy shanties on battered instruments.  A long bar lines one wall to the west, and a broad table is pushed against the opposite corner."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":183,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":185,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":188,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}],"aliases":["Hangman's Noose","Noose","PHA"]},
  {"id":185,"x":550,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Main Bar","descriptions":["Crossed headsman's axes hang on the fieldstone wall behind the bar, the blades inlaid with carnelian to resemble spatters of blood.  To the south, burly patrons cluster about a private table, while the noise from the east makes it easy to identify the location of the common room.  A stairway leads up to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":187,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":186,"x":570,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Private Table","descriptions":["Big enough to seat ten or more, this wide round table offers a view of the tavern and its rowdy patrons.  Antique instruments of torture have been mounted on the walls in this corner, part of the owner's grisly collection."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":187,"x":550,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Private Table","descriptions":["Most of the patrons hesitate to approach this shadowy table, its surface pitted and scarred with axe marks.  Rough-looking warriors jostle and laugh with one another here, the crude local argot as thick as the steel weapons that flash at a moment's provocation."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":188,"x":560,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Hangman's Noose, Backroom","descriptions":["Several sweating laborers haul a seemingly endless quantity of casks across the floor from a loading dock.  They curse and strain as they hoist each one up onto one of many shelves already filled with dozens of casks, each painted a dull black.  A massive Gor'Tog overseer flicks a short-handled whip to remind shirkers of their job."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Strength"]},
  {"id":189,"x":680,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Foyer","descriptions":["Flecked granite floors partially obscured by faded tapestry rugs have been polished to a high sheen reflecting with a mirror-like quality.  High above, four colorful banners dangle from the ceiling, the gentle currents of air sending wave like ripples cascading across their silky surfaces.  Several young Elothean scribes dressed in brightly colored robes dash up and down an elaborate stairway, arms tightly wrapped around various parchments, scrolls, and documents."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":192,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":191,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":65,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"},{"to":674,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}],"aliases":["Houses Consulate"]},
  {"id":190,"x":680,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Steel Dove","descriptions":["Simple grey woven mats cover the cool stone floor, the hues echoed in the armor neatly arranged on a nearby rack.  A long counter runs along one wall, piled high with salvaged swords and shields.","Simple grey woven mats cover the cool stone floor, the hues echoed in the armor neatly arranged on a nearby rack.  A long counter runs along one wall, piled high with salvaged swords and shields.  Broad-shouldered Elotheans perched on stools gradually scrub them free of rust, smiles on their young faces despite their scars."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":191,"x":670,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Verdant Lily","descriptions":["Bottles, jars, and assorted vials are scattered along painted white shelves that line the room.  Gleaming trays of silver surgical instruments and bundles of herbs have been carefully arranged on four oak tables that are pushed together and covered in unbleached linen cloths."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Verdant Lily"]},
  {"id":192,"x":690,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Silver Star","descriptions":["Reddish-brown bookshelves line the walls of this expansive room, from which the robust smell of moldy parchment is carried on the gentle currents of air meandering though the area.  Quiet scribes sit at elaborately carved desks piled high with dusty tomes, taking note of damaged portions of text."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":193,"x":420,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The New South Bridge","descriptions":["Only the patrons of an inn or a tavern wander the bridge.  Some of the habitually nocturnal use the lampposts along the street for support as well as illumination, but unlike the old bridge, here they are in no danger of falling through a hole in the planks and drowning.","There always seems to be a crowd at the city end of the bridge: travelers find it natural to inspect their equipment before braving the wild or tidy their appearance before entering the city.  So common is the instinct to pause that if you see someone who doesn't stop, you can bet it's a shopper headed for the stores on the bridge."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":205,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":194,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go south square"}]},
  {"id":194,"x":380,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dusk Arcade","descriptions":["The architecture of a brick building to the west -- Coin of the Realm, to judge by the brass plaque beside its entrance -- suggests security rather than style.  The small windows on each side of the door are protected with stout iron grilles, and the door, while avoiding a fortress appearance, still looks like it could withstand a very determined attempt to force it."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":195,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go brick building"}]},
  {"id":195,"x":380,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dusk Arcade","descriptions":["Exposed black beams contrast boldly with the white plaster walls of a shop to the west.  Above the shop's entrance are painted the words Tokens of Affection and a picture of an armored knight kneeling at the feet of a noble lady.  Below it, small paned windows to the left and right display ladies' adornments and decorations."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":205,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":196,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":212,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":196,"x":380,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dusk Arcade","descriptions":["The half-timbered building to the west shows a large sign across its facade, a sign that says simply Little Frills.  Beneath it is a shop window full of brightly dressed dolls of every race."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":206,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":197,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":216,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"},{"to":217,"exit":"go","move":"go handsome door"}]},
  {"id":197,"x":380,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dusk Arcade","descriptions":["The building to the west is almost a twin to its neighbor to the south: fantastic beasts and the bright tints of heraldry decorate its front, but unlike the painted shields of the other shop, this one displays a lavish array of province, city and guild flags.  A painted canvas above the entrance proclaims Blazons and Banners."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":207,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":198,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":220,"exit":"go","move":"go building"},{"to":222,"exit":"go","move":"go unobtrusive door"}]},
  {"id":198,"x":380,"y":1100,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dusk Arcade","descriptions":["A building with an unusual facade stands to the west: its front is covered with shields brightly painted with a host of heraldic blazons.  All the beasts one might conceive of -- from drakes to dragons, lions to leopards, and greyhounds to gryphons -- gambol across the front of the shop."],"exits":[{"to":197,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":199,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":221,"exit":"go","move":"go building"},{"to":625,"exit":"go","move":"go varnished door"}]},
  {"id":199,"x":420,"y":1100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The New South Bridge","descriptions":["To the south, torches light New Gate, the city's stout bulwark against the wilds across the water.  Towers rise on each side of the main gate, with its heavy and well-oiled iron portcullis.","To the south, torches light New Gate, the city's stout bulwark against the wilds across the water.  The main gate, with its heavy and well-oiled iron portcullis, is flanked by towers, the one to the west part of the granite front of the Theater of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":207,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":200,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":198,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":227,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"},{"to":230,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"},{"to":627,"exit":"go","move":"go theater doors"}],"aliases":["Lyle"]},
  {"id":200,"x":460,"y":1100,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dawn Arcade","descriptions":["A two-story shop combines smooth cream-colored plaster walls on street level with a mellow honey-oak siding above it.  A red tile roof caps the building and provides a home for a brick chimney and what looks like a stork's nest."],"exits":[{"to":201,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":199,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":226,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"},{"to":785,"exit":"go","move":"go workshop"}]},
  {"id":201,"x":460,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dawn Arcade","descriptions":["Across the front of the shop to the east runs a frieze of odd-looking animals: round-bodied birds with long beaks, long skinny necks and legs, and little flapping wings.  The creatures are painted a rainbow of bright hues, and six objects shaped and colored just like the pictures are spaced along the gutter under the eaves, perhaps serving as rainspouts of some kind."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":200,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":207,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":202,"x":460,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dawn Arcade","descriptions":["The shop here presents a gigantic jolly face to the street: a wide red tongue of a threshhold, an oval mouth now closed by a door painted like a toothy grin, and round windows of eyes whose shades are drawn in slumber.","The shop here presents a gigantic jolly face to the street it has a wide red tongue of a threshhold, an oval door open like a laughing mouth under a nose-like red gable, and even round windows on each side for eyes.  With an appearance like this, the sound of a tin horn, a music box or a toy drum would hardly seem amiss."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":201,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":206,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":219,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":203,"x":460,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dawn Arcade","descriptions":["A red-and-white-striped pole advertises Budd's Barber Shop, a modest half-timbered house with a steeply peaked roof.  The shop's entrance has gleaming brass hinges and a wide lintel carved with alchemical symbols.  Many odors waft from the shop, but the strongest is bay rum."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":202,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":205,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":213,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":215,"exit":"go","move":"go barber shop"}]},
  {"id":204,"x":460,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge, The Dawn Arcade","descriptions":["A two-story building with a shingled front bears a sign reading Curious Cabinetry in bold red letters.  The entrance is surrounded by intricately carved doorposts and lintel.  A wooden gargoyle leans from a corner of the roof directly above a rain barrel."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":193,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":209,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"},{"to":211,"exit":"go","move":"go two-story building"}]},
  {"id":205,"x":420,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The New South Bridge","descriptions":["Few roam the city's streets at night, and given the custom of its merchants to close at sundown, it's not hard to see why.  Much of the time, the only voice heard is the cry of the city watch announcing the hour.","A horse's iron-shod hooves ring on the cobblestones, the wooden wheels of a farmer's wagon squeak as they turn, peddlers cry out their wares and children shout at play.  And the scene is as varied as the sound: it may be a prince, it may be a beggar, it may be a sentinel, it may be a thief, but there's always an interesting sight on the South Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":203,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":206,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":195,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":206,"x":420,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The New South Bridge","descriptions":["Under the light from the lampposts, wagons come and go, usually arriving loaded and leaving empty.  Many a merchant schedules shipments to arrive at night, when the traffic is light, interruptions are few, and the authorities will not mind if the bridge is blocked for a few minutes.","Street sweepers and pigeons continue their never-ending labor of keeping the street free from rubbish.  They're aided by canny merchants who know that a clear walkway and a clean street are good for business."],"exits":[{"to":205,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":202,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":207,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":196,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["New South Bridge","South Bridge"]},
  {"id":207,"x":420,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Shard, The New South Bridge","descriptions":["Although many city streets are frighteningly narrow, this grand bridge concourse is broad enough for the heaviest wagons to pass side-by-side.  But the bridge can boast of more than its size: with a system of drains and gutters, both the street itself and the houses along it enjoy the most modern sanitation Elanthia can offer.","Although many city streets are so narrow the sunlight never penetrates to the ground, this grand bridge concourse is broad enough for the most gala processions, parades, or pageants to march along with ease.  But the bridge can boast of more than its size: with a system of drains and gutters, both the street itself and the houses along it enjoy the most modern sanitation Elanthia can offer."],"exits":[{"to":206,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":201,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":199,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":197,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":208,"x":340,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Coin of the Realm","descriptions":["A brass chandelier and matching wall sconces illuminate walls of white plaster and pale oak wainscot in this small, handsome shop.  A note and a brace of candles rest on a simple table next to some chairs for customers."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Coin of the Realm","Mithlin","Dira"]},
  {"id":209,"x":480,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge Flats, The Vestibule","descriptions":["A small vestibule lit by a pewter lamp occupies the space between an ascending flight of stairs and the street door.  A thick green carpet on the stairs cushions and quiets the footsteps."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":204,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}]},
  {"id":210,"x":500,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"The Second-Floor Hallway","descriptions":["The upstairs hall is quiet, with a deep-piled carpet underfoot.  The dim light of an oil lamp at the head of the stairs shows half-timber and plaster walls with a window at the street end of the room.","The upstairs hall is quiet, carpeted with the same green rug as the stairs.  The walls are half-timbered with mellow oak paneling below cream-colored plaster.  The narrow room is lit by a securely fastened window at the street end."],"exits":[{"to":209,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":211,"x":500,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Curious Cabinetry","descriptions":["From somewhere nearby come the sounds of adze, plane and hammer and the smells of fine wood and glue but in this room, polished floors and paneled walls are the setting for the cabinetmaker's art.  The light from a few candles reflects in the varnished surfaces of skillfully made doors."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"go","move":"go exit"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Curious Cabinetry"]},
  {"id":212,"x":340,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Tokens of Affection","descriptions":["Set high in the walls are roundels of colored glass that shed patches of light in rose, light blue, ochre, and apple-green over the counters.  As the sun moves, the rainbow of circles shifts, casting new shades and highlights on the wares displayed on crystal, platinum, gold, and silver trays."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tokens of Affection"]},
  {"id":213,"x":480,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge Flats, The Vestibule","descriptions":["A small vestibule lit by a pewter lamp occupies the space between an ascending flight of stairs and the street door.  A trim canvas strip on the stairs quiets the footsteps but shows what look like chemical stains."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":203,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}]},
  {"id":214,"x":500,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"The Second-Floor Hallway","descriptions":["The upstairs hall is quiet now that night has come and no patrons visit the shop downstairs.  An oil lamp at the head of the stairs lights the dove-grey walls and reflects in the panes of a window at the street end of the room.","At rare intervals, a muffled thud is heard from the barber shop downstairs, as if something heavy had been dropped or something had exploded.  It can't be denied that these noises are often accompanied by an odd odor, but the location of these apartments is prime, and the tenants seem to take such events in stride.  The hall is at least well lit, with a large window at the street end."],"exits":[{"to":213,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":215,"x":500,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Budd's Barber Shop","descriptions":["The room looks like Budd is more interested in keeping shop than in chopping locks.  It's filled with odds and ends of merchandise: a crate of tincture jars sits next to a box of candle molds beside a wicker case of clippers and crocks.  And that's not counting the stuff on the counter or in the cabinet behind it.  At least it has the traditional mirror and barber chair."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Budd's Barber Shop","Barber Shop"]},
  {"id":216,"x":340,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Little Frills","descriptions":["At the center of the showroom is a miniature festival wagon, its big wheels and high-backed seats gilded and brightly painted.  On it sit dolls of the eleven races for sale in the shop.  The dolls' clothes and accessories surround the display on a rainbow of colorful counters -- violet, blue, green, yellow, orange, and red."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Little Frills"]},
  {"id":217,"x":360,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge Flats, The Vestibule","descriptions":["A small vestibule lit by a pewter lamp occupies the space between an ascending flight of stairs and the street door.  A soft, deep purple carpet with gold edges covers the stairs."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}]},
  {"id":218,"x":340,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"The Second-Floor Hallway","descriptions":["The walls of the upstairs hall are covered with cream paper hand-painted in tones of green and gold with scenes of woodland and meadow.  Two bronze lamps light the hall, and a big window graces the street end.","The walls of the upstairs hall are covered with cream paper hand-painted in tones of green and gold with scenes of woodland and meadow.  A big window overlooks the street and lights the room, and two bronze lamps come in handy on cloudy days."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":219,"x":500,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"The Toy Box","descriptions":["No merry-go-round at a circus could be cheerier than the decor of this shop: bright calliope music plays from somewhere behind gilded and painted screens.  In place of counters, the merchandise rests on the tray-like backs of carousel animals suspended on shining brass poles: a snarling lion, a black stallion, a polar bear, and a woolly ram parade their wares.  A carriage drawn by unicorns is provided for patrons who need a rest from their shopping."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Toy Box"]},
  {"id":220,"x":340,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Blazons and Banners","descriptions":["The shop is crowded with bales of fabric in every color, cutting tables, tailor's dummies, and all the tools for fine needlework.  Cases hold tabards and flags in abundance, and near the street door, the seamstress Zezinka sits behind a wooden counter with a catalog listing the shop's stock in trade."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":197,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Blazons and Banners"]},
  {"id":221,"x":340,"y":1100,"z":0,"title":"The Heraldry Shop","descriptions":["A palette of smells greets patrons of the Heraldry Shop as mineral spirits, turpentine, and linseed oil compete for olfactory attention.  But Bonime, the artist, allows no visual clutter: rows of paints and solvents, pots of brushes, and sketches on scraps of paper all occupy orderly places on walls and workbenches.  A leather-bound catalog rests on a plain plank counter at the front of the shop."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Heraldry Shop","Bonime"]},
  {"id":222,"x":360,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge Flats, The Vestibule","descriptions":["A small vestibule lit by a pewter lamp occupies the space between an ascending flight of stairs and the street door.  A rag rug at the bottom of the stairs has been provided for visitors to wipe their feet on."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":197,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}]},
  {"id":223,"x":340,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"The Second-Floor Hallway","descriptions":["The upstairs hall has a pleasingly fresh scent of wax and soap and polish.  A lamp shaped like a shield lights the room, and its rays are reflected in the window at the street end.","The upstairs hall is scrubbed and dusted, the hardwood floor is recently waxed and freshly swept, and the window at the end of the room is sparkling clean.  A polished oil lamp shaped like a shield lights the stairs."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":224,"x":500,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Bettin' Birdies, The Anteroom","descriptions":["An ornate red, black and yellow carpet graces the entrance to Ashoo's Casino, where hopeful (and dismayed) gamblers pass in and out, blessing their joys or cursing their woes.  Occasional cheers or moans escape from the top of a sweeping staircase that leads to the betting room."],"exits":[{"to":201,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"},{"to":225,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":225,"x":510,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Bettin' Birdies, The Casino","descriptions":["A perch-like metal rod extends completely across a room hung with yellow drapes.  On the perch stand three contraptions of wood and metal that resemble huge (if skinny) canaries.  In their metal feet they grip the rod, which serves as the axle around which they rotate, spinning and flapping their mechanical wings."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Bettin' Birdies","Casino"]},
  {"id":226,"x":500,"y":1100,"z":0,"title":"Elanthian Travel Tours, Gift Shop","descriptions":["A crystal chandelier, hanging in the center of the room, tinkles softly in the breeze from the open door.  Built to scale, a panorama of the city of Shard is encased in a glass display in the center of the room.  Trinkets are strategically located to show them at their best on each tower.  A heavily burdened table and stand huddle in opposite corners of the room."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Elanthian Travel Tours","Gift Shop"]},
  {"id":227,"x":380,"y":1140,"z":0,"title":"The New Bridge, West Tower","descriptions":["A stone-paved walkway extends above the South Gate to the east and to the roof of the theater to the west.  The tower commands a wide and far-reaching view down the road and beyond to the dark sweep of the Whistling Wood."],"exits":[{"to":228,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":229,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":199,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}],"aliases":["W Tower"]},
  {"id":228,"x":400,"y":1140,"z":0,"title":"The New Bridge, East Tower","descriptions":["High above the South Gate, embrasures pierce the stone battlements between the merlons that give cover to the defenders of the walls.  The perch commands the main entrance to the city with a field of fire that covers the approaches to the New South Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":230,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"}],"aliases":["E Tower"]},
  {"id":229,"x":360,"y":1140,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Outdoor Seating","descriptions":["Numerous rows of seats wait here for use during theatrical performances on the outdoor stage.  The wall's stonework extends upwards far enough to keep unattentive patrons from falling over the edge to a rather uncomfortable demise."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Shoan a Sidelkuloa","Stage"]},
  {"id":230,"x":420,"y":1140,"z":0,"title":"Old Ilithi Trade Route, Journey's Rest","descriptions":["Like a bulwark against chaos, the gatehouse wall of Shard rises to the north.  Its granite blocks enclose the New South Gate that guards the bridge leading to the city.  The Old Ilithi Trade Route wends southward, a road haunted by the nightmare memory of the Dark Hand."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["S Gate","South Gate","sgate"],"linksTo":"Map68_Shard_South_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":231,"x":220,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Entryway","descriptions":["The broad, half-moon shaped entryway to the Paladin's Guild of Shard is made of the same creamy white marble substance that composes its exterior.  Veins of silver flash along the floor and sides, gliding around the doorway like fixed streaks of power.  Stairs carved out of the west wall ascend to the next brightly lit level.  To the north and through an arch cut in the wall that divides the entryway from the second half of the tower's base, is the office for the Shard guildleader."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":234,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":243,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"}],"aliases":["Tower of Honor","Paladin"]},
  {"id":232,"x":220,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Forge Tunnel","descriptions":["Sitting at the bottom of the long stone stairway that leads up to the Tower of Honor, this narrow hall holds no adornment.  The surrounding rock of the walls and ceiling has been expertly excavated, its surface smooth to the touch.  Well-placed torches generate some light, enough to see the way by."],"exits":[{"to":233,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":231,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stairway"}]},
  {"id":233,"x":230,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Forge Tunnel","descriptions":["Sitting at the bottom of the long stone stairway that leads up to the forge, this narrow hall holds no adornment.  The surrounding rock of the walls and ceiling has been expertly excavated, its surface smooth to the touch.  Well-placed torches generate some light, enough to see the way by."],"exits":[{"to":232,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go stairway"}]},
  {"id":234,"x":220,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Library Level","descriptions":["This room is but a small, semi-circular alcove with a doorway in the east side leading into the library of the paladins.  A set of stairs -- chiseled out of the white stone of the tower -- are located directly across from the doorway, climbing up one way, down the other."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":231,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":241,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":235,"x":220,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Squire's Level","descriptions":["A doorway in the east side of this crescent-shaped alcove grants access to the barracks of the younger members of the Paladin's guild, also called the Squire's Quarters.  A guard by the oaken door entryway monitors those who arrive and exit, and stairs on the wall across from her lead up toward the senior Paladins' quarters and training floor, and down toward the library and the entry level."],"exits":[{"to":236,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":234,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Squire's Level"]},
  {"id":236,"x":220,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Knight's Level","descriptions":["The ends of this small alcove have been hung with banners dyed in the gold and blue colors of the Paladins of Shard.  A door of good steel in the east wall is watched over by a guard and a flight of stairs on the wall across from him lead up to the Justiciars' quarters and the training floor, and down toward still more quarters and the entry level."],"exits":[{"to":237,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":235,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Knight's Level"]},
  {"id":237,"x":220,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Justiciar's Level","descriptions":["Bas-relief murals of blue lapis and goldstone have been set at either ends of this alcove in honor of those who have reached this level of excellence in the guild.  A door made of the same creamy white marble that composes the rest of the tower leads into the finest of the barracks, flanked at all times by two Paladins dressed in shining silvery plate.  Stairs lead up to the training floor, and back down to the lower quarters and the entryway."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":236,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":239,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble stairs"}],"aliases":["Justiciar's Level"]},
  {"id":238,"x":230,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Justiciar's Study","descriptions":["The office of the Justiciar is plain, balancing on the knife edge between spartan and severe.  Nothing but a clean whitewash adorns the walls, except for the east one which has a single red dot painted on it, oddly enough.  A simple desk of uncarved wood is pushed up against the back, the papers on its surface in neat, regimented order."],"exits":[{"to":237,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Discipline","Justiciar's Study"]},
  {"id":239,"x":210,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Training Room","descriptions":["Racks of weaponry line all four walls, an impressive array gleaming from the shelves.  Everything from wooden practice staves to polished steel broadswords are available for use.  Padded mats on the floor help to prevent injury if students become over-eager. "],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"},{"to":237,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble stairs"}],"aliases":["Training Room"]},
  {"id":240,"x":200,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Chapel","descriptions":["An exquisitely carved ivory statue is the centerpiece of this small chapel.  Representing Chadatru, the traditionally honored god of Paladins, the statue dominates the area with its presence.  Brilliantly colored stained glass windows cast multihued shadows over the wooden pews radiating outward from Chadatru's icon."],"exits":[{"to":239,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Chapel"]},
  {"id":241,"x":230,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Library","descriptions":["The soft scent of sandalwood fills the air from the aromatic woods that have been used to make the shelves in the guild's library.  Not a speck of dust can be detected anywhere in the room, possibly due to the fact that the cleaning of this place is a primary chore of the younger initiates of the guild.  Curtains of heavy blue velvet gathered by gold cord frame stained glass windows that have been set in the four cardinal points of the circular walls."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":242,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"}]},
  {"id":242,"x":240,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Orb Room","descriptions":["Cold stone walls crowd close in this cramped chamber.  The room is barren save for a beautifully crafted soulstone orb mounted on a brass tripod, standing directly in the center of the alcove."],"exits":[{"to":241,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Orb Room"]},
  {"id":243,"x":230,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Honor, Guildleader's Office","descriptions":["Flanked by long tapestries of gold and blue, the guildleader's office is at once magnificent and sparse.  Illumination from crystal globes throws off a cool, silvery radiance, their placement and subsequent lighting automatically draws attention toward the polished white ironwood desk at the far back and center of the chamber.  A sense of pride and accomplishment infuses itself into the very air.  This is, indeed, the heart of the protectors of Ilithi."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Paladin","Snow","RS Paladin"]},
  {"id":244,"x":240,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Miglo's Forge, Supplies","descriptions":["The temperature in this deceptively small building is quite warm, and a faint metallic odor hangs in the air.  A frazzled Dwarven attendant busily dusts every surface he can reach, including a heavy leather flap that is designed to muffle clangs of metal from below.  Within a darkened arch on the west wall, a glimpse of stairs leading down into blackness can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Miglo's Forge","Forge Supplies"]},
  {"id":245,"x":180,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Entrance","descriptions":["The sound of laughter and gossip fills the air, mingling with the scent of pipe smoke and baking tarts.  A warm golden glow fills the room, coming from the north and the famous tavern of Liani's Heaven.  Pegs line the walls as places to hang cloaks and hats."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":246,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":76,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Liani's Heaven"]},
  {"id":246,"x":170,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Taproom","descriptions":["The golden glow of the polished walls is brightened by the fire of a hearth in the north wall.  Slow eddies of curling smoke twist into convoluted shapes as Elven elders and Halfling greybeards alike sit and smoke pipes, discussing the parts of life that yet remain a mystery, with tankards of ale before them to help make things more profound."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":245,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":249,"exit":"go","move":"go private table"},{"to":250,"exit":"go","move":"go bustling area"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":247,"x":190,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Taproom","descriptions":["Light shimmers off the honey-colored wood that composes the low-roofed but expansive taproom of Liani's Heaven.  A bar curves from one end of the tavern to the other, its surface polished to a high gleam by tankards and plates slung down its surface by the Halflings behind the bar."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":246,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":248,"exit":"go","move":"go secluded booth"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":248,"x":200,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Quiet Booth","descriptions":["A dark amber tabletop with heavy nicks and scoring occupies most of the booth.  A single lantern hangs overhead, throwing a pool of illumination over the padded benches provided for the comfort of the patrons who want a little peace and quiet to discuss business affairs best left to private places."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":249,"x":170,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Private Table","descriptions":["A holdover from a time when wearing the symbol of the Bard's Guild was a death sentence and secrecy was necessary, this private table has now become a permanent fixture of the tavern as a reminder of those times.  Scrolls are laid out on the table, the elegant mark of a skilled calligrapher across their surface."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Bard","Macfrae","RS Bard"]},
  {"id":250,"x":180,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Barman's Area","descriptions":["The service area of the bar is a hive of Halfling activity.  Dishwashers, ragmen, sweepers, and servers stream in and out of the bar's pass-through, all under the watchful eyes of the tavern bouncers."],"exits":[{"to":251,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":246,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Barman's Area"]},
  {"id":251,"x":180,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Small Room","descriptions":["Several musical instruments are carefully laid out on a low, felt-covered table.  An ancient grandmotherly Halfling woman glances up whenever anyone enters, and her gnarled fingers lovingly grasp a carved ivory flute."],"exits":[{"to":250,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Reflex"]},
  {"id":252,"x":1260,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Squatters' Hovel","descriptions":["This rounded chamber, low-ceilinged and dank, has been converted into a crude home for several families of destitute squatters.  All around you are the faces of the poor and hungry, who have found no shelter on Shard's golden streets.  The walls are oddly disjointed in places, the sheets of solid rock irregularly placed."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"room sear;go tiny hatch","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":253,"x":1240,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Gallery Fall","descriptions":["The gallery ends here, at a catastrophic cave-in where a wall of giant boulders and hard-packed earth has closed off the southern vaults forever.  A few humanoids dart in and out of a tiny archway to the east, but beyond that, this end of the warrens is unusually quiet."],"exits":[{"to":254,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":252,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":254,"x":1240,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Gallery","descriptions":["Shadowy denizens of the Undershard dart from archway to archway, making their way up and down this long gallery hall.  The corridor has become a boulevard of sorts, the main artery of this city-beneath-a-city, and you see merchants and thieves alike travelling the twilit road."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":253,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":255,"x":1240,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Gallery","descriptions":["This broad gallery is a boulevard of sorts, stretching from the northern to the southern ends of Undershard.  The stone walls have crumbled and fallen in spots, revealing packed earth and glimpses of natural caverns just beyond, while archways open up onto vaults once used for storing supplies."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":254,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":281,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":256,"x":1240,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Gallery","descriptions":["Grooves are worn into the flagstone floor of this vast gallery hall, where wagons were used to haul siege supplies from one end of the Undershard to the other.  The gallery runs north and south, beyond the limits of vision."],"exits":[{"to":257,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":255,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":257,"x":1240,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Gallery","descriptions":["The main gallery of the Undershard splits off here, with another broad corridor running east down a slight incline.  Most of the wagon tracks seem to roll in that direction, towards what might have once been the main storage vaults.  This great hall continues to the north and south."],"exits":[{"to":275,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":258,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":256,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":258,"x":1300,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Low Gallery","descriptions":["The ceiling of this broad gallery dips low as it intersects with a great boulevard to the west, rotting timbers propping up the dangerously weakened stone walls on either side. The gallery runs eastward, the ground underfoot furrowed with old wagon tracks."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":259,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":257,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":259,"x":1320,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Low Gallery","descriptions":["Ensconced torches light the way down this long gallery as it runs from east to west, the tunnel serving as a makeshift street for citizens of the Undershard.  Many of the small vaults leading off to the north and south have been converted to black market shops or squatters' homes, a crude parody of the city streets just overhead."],"exits":[{"to":263,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":258,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":260,"x":1320,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Derleth's Teahouse","descriptions":["Brick walls painted a glistening black, this sedate teahouse seems oddly at home in the warrens of the Undershard.  The patrons, a mixed lot, share a common bond of silence:  there seems to be an unwritten law against speaking over a whisper in the sparse, dimly-lit chamber."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":261,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":261,"x":1340,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Teahouse Corridor","descriptions":["This small corridor has almost completely caved in, forcing you to squeeze around fallen timbers and debris.  None of the patrons seem to venture down this corridor, to the darkened room on the eastern end."],"exits":[{"to":262,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":262,"x":1360,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Teahouse Storage","descriptions":["This cramped room is piled high with wooden boxes and crates, storage supplies for the teahouse.  Judging from the official Shard government seals on most of the boxes, it doesn't seem as though the teahouse is supplied by a very reputable source.  A small corridor leads west, back to the main room."],"exits":[{"to":261,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":263,"x":1340,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Caved-In Junction","descriptions":["Numerous wagon tracks turn to the north, rolling up a vast corridor that intersects with this one.  However, a cave-in has destroyed the junction, the northern way blocked off by a wall of solid rock.  Whatever was once there is forever lost, and the locals pay the rubble no attention."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":259,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":264,"x":1360,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Low Gallery","descriptions":["The low gallery ends here at a sheer stone wall, once ceiling.  Their import has been lost, buried beneath countless defacements and lines of obscene graffitti.  The gallery runs westward, past archways leading to smaller side vaults."],"exits":[{"to":265,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":263,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":265,"x":1360,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Temple Foyer","descriptions":["This short corridor has been converted into the foyer of a temple, the air scented with incense and the walls painted with images of Hodierna.  Not a speck of graffitti mars the spotless adornments.  Southward, this corridor opens onto a large vaulted chamber."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":264,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":266,"x":1360,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Temple of Hodierna","descriptions":["This abandoned storage chamber has been refurnished as a temple, the rough stone walls painstakingly painted with beautiful, elaborate murals.  An altar of rosewood stands at the center of the room, lit with beeswax candles and surrounded by small piles of crude offerings from passers-by."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":265,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Hodierna","shrine"]},
  {"id":267,"x":1380,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Priest's Bedroom","descriptions":["This humble chamber, furnished only with a threadbare cot, is the bedroom of this temple's resident cleric.  A single candle of pure white wax lights the room, casting a warm glow over the dusty brick walls and keeping back the shadows."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":268,"x":1300,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Wayfarer","descriptions":["The Wayfarer looks like a bawdy-house in a Dwarven mine, sashes of garish red velvet put up to mask crumbling brick walls.  The local clientele is from Undershard's rougher side -- scavengers, mercenaries and thieves -- and they ignore the squalor of their surroundings with help from the local brew.  A narrow hallway runs off to the north, and a wide table commands a good view of the room."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":258,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":269,"x":1300,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Wayfarer Hallway","descriptions":["The Wayfarer offers a small number of private rooms for entertaining, a black lacquered door and a yellow door flanking either side of this narrow hallway.  To the south, the hallway opens up onto the back of the tavern, and ends a short distance to the north."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":268,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go yellow door"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}]},
  {"id":270,"x":1300,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Wayfarer Hallway","descriptions":["The short hallway comes to a dead end here, flanked on the east and the west by a green door and a red door.  The paint is peeling from the walls in chunks, and the rancid stench of unwashed flesh fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":271,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"},{"to":272,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}]},
  {"id":271,"x":1280,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Green Room","descriptions":["Barely bigger than a closet, this destitute nook has been made up as a makeshift bedroom with a filthy, flea-infested mattress.  The walls are festooned with putrid green paint, splotched with mildew and decay.  A green door leads out to the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":272,"x":1320,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Red Room","descriptions":["Barely bigger than a closet, this destitute nook has been made up as a makeshift bedroom with a filthy, flea-infested mattress.  The walls are festooned with putrid red paint, splotched with mildew and decay.  A red door leads out to the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}]},
  {"id":273,"x":1280,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Yellow Room","descriptions":["Barely bigger than a closet, this destitute nook has been made up as a makeshift bedroom with a filthy, flea-infested mattress.  The walls are festooned with putrid yellow paint, splotched with mildew and decay.  A yellow door leads out to the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go yellow door"}]},
  {"id":274,"x":1320,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Black Room","descriptions":["Barely bigger than a closet, this destitute nook has been made up as a makeshift bedroom with a filthy, flea-infested mattress.  The walls are festooned with putrid black paint, splotched with mildew and decay.  A black door leads out to the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}]},
  {"id":275,"x":1240,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Gallery","descriptions":["Arched timbers support the vaulted ceiling some fifteen feet above, where moisture leaks from the crumbling roof and drips into muddy puddles on the dank stone floor.  This great gallery continues to the south, and to the north it opens onto a large room, not far up the passage from here."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":257,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":276,"x":1240,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, South of Well","descriptions":["A great well dominates the center of this vast natural cavern, the rough stone walls reinforced with brick and wooden beams.  A passage leads south, to a warren of smaller vaults, and the rubble-strewn ground winds around the well on either side.  Further to the north, across the chamber, sounds of shouting can be heard."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":275,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":275,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":279,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":277,"x":1260,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, East of Well","descriptions":["A plank runs from east to west across the yawning maw of a wide, open well.  Occasionally, a pair of locals will meet on the plank itself and engage in a ritual combat of sorts, leaping about and performing feats of acrobatics until one falls over the edge and into the pit below.  Most of the time, the loser manages to crawl back out again.  The cavern wall curves around here, running southwest to northwest."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":280,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":278,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":278,"x":1240,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, North of Well","descriptions":["A low ring of crumbling stones encircles the lip of a great well just to the south, and a tunnel leads north to connect this open vault with another one up the passage.  Sounds of enthusiastic shouting in many languages drift down the corridor, as if some sort of festival is taking place."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":277,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":279,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":279,"x":1220,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, West of Well","descriptions":["Pitons hold a rotting rope ladder in place, its rungs dangling down into the gaping maw of a dry well.  Beside it, a narrow wooden plank has been laid across the well to touch the eastern rim.  The cavern curves around here, from southeast to northeast, and a side corridor runs off to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":280,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":276,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":316,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":280,"x":1240,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, On the Plank","descriptions":["Only a thin plank of green, worm-eaten wood lies between you and the abyss of the great well, its stone shaft plunging into darkness far below.  A faint rustling sound echoes up from the pit, like leathery wings preparing to take flight, but nothing moves in the shadows.  The plank runs from west to east, touching on either rim of the well."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":279,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":281,"x":1220,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Sewage Grotto","descriptions":["An archway to the east opens onto a rounded plateau overlooking a steady stream of raw sewage, pouring from a drainage tunnel to the south.  The air is thick with the rancid, oppressive stench of humanoid waste as it slides northward into a second tunnel, this one blocked off with a rusted iron grate.  A sign has been hung over the canal, coated with sloppy red paint on a tattered board."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":282,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":282,"x":1220,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Sewage Tunnel","descriptions":["A lazy current pushes a river of waste northward.  This cramped tunnel angles sharply downward and makes it near-impossible to wade against the filth.  Further north, the tunnel opens up into a large area, some sort of underground grotto."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":283,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":283,"x":1220,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Sewage Tunnel","descriptions":["The brick ceiling arches downward as the river of sewage rises, and only a small pocket of rancid air allows survival.  A slow current moves the sludge northward, odd strands of phosphorus goo casting the narrow tunnel in a sickly green glow."],"exits":[{"to":282,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":284,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":284,"x":1220,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Sewage Tunnel","descriptions":["Raw sewage clogs this claustrophobic tunnel, the air choked with nauseating fumes.  Tiny creatures wriggle through the muck, their wormlike bodies writhing just beneath the surface.  The tunnel slopes downward to the north, into utter darkness."],"exits":[{"to":283,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":381,"exit":"go","move":"go raw sewage"}]},
  {"id":285,"x":1240,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Access Corridor","descriptions":["This broad corridor, its stone walls cracked and stained dark with moisture, runs between two large vaulted chambers.  The relatively dark and quiet vault to the south is overcome by sounds of parading and shouting to the north, where some sort of bazaar or festival is being held."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":278,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":286,"x":1240,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Grey Market","descriptions":["Citizens of the Undershard mingle all around, merchants and travelers haggling loudly over cheap wares or vanishing into the seclusion of blanket-draped stalls to negotiate for more private services.  The Market itself is a maze, the crowds making their own paths from vendor to vendor."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":285,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":287,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":287,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":287,"x":1220,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Grey Market","descriptions":["Constantly buffeted by swarms of people, it is hard to get one's bearings or even keep safe footing in this labyrinth of makeshift stalls and grey-blanketed booths.  Openings seem to appear and vanish in the blink of an eye, as the crowds flow like the tides."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":288,"x":1260,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Grey Market","descriptions":["Every sort of intelligent being and every walk of life can be seen in the aisles of the Grey Market, from urchins and cutpurses, to adventurers and lesser nobles, the crowds churning in an elaborate dance that only the locals seem to understand.  The best an outsider can do is try to move with them, and cut your own path without starting a brawl."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":292,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":289,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":286,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":295,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":289,"x":1280,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Grey Market","descriptions":["The chatter of merchants assaults your ears in a plethora of languages and accents, as the local vendors swarm about passers-by like flies on a horse.  This line of tents and shanties runs straight up to a gap in the cavern walls, reinforced with sagging wooden beams. The locals steer a wide path around a gang of young Elothean toughs lounging casually near the entrance."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":290,"exit":"go","move":"go dilapidated shanty"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}]},
  {"id":290,"x":1300,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Grey Market","descriptions":["The shanty is little more than an open roofed partition, constructed of unmatched bits of wood, paper, and metal, with one side butting up against the cavern wall.  Soot stains the walls in one shadowed corner near the back where a ring of stones holds a small fire.  Roughly scrawled graffiti in several languages covers every clean spot on the walls and one symbol in particular, a bloody dagger, seems to predominate.  It probably belongs to the local gang of thugs whose home this seems to be."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go low opening"}]},
  {"id":291,"x":1260,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Grey Market","descriptions":["The open bazaar of the Undershard is a panorama of odd sights and smells, grey-blanketed stalls and rickety carts selling everything under the sun.  The merchants speak in a rapid-fire patois, their catcalls ringing out over the noise of people shouting in seven languages or more."],"exits":[{"to":293,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":292,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":287,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":292,"x":1280,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Grey Market","descriptions":["This corner of the market runs up along one of the cavern's walls, the black stone inscribed with old Imperial records but the glyphs long since obscured by crude graffitti and chiseled obscenities.  A large stall stands nearby, its billowing sheets woven of purple thread instead of grey like all the others, and the locals give it a wide berth."],"exits":[{"to":294,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":291,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":288,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":596,"exit":"go","move":"go natural fissure"}]},
  {"id":293,"x":1260,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Great Stair","descriptions":["A winding stair of polished stone has been cut from the face of the rock, spiraling up some thirty feet to great doors of ornate ironwood and flanked by two broad ramps.  An Elothean inscription chiseled into the stone at the foot of the stair denotes this as 'The Royal Way'.  The stair itself, once an informal gathering-place for the locals, is now blocked off with lengths of rusty chain."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":294,"x":1280,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Pursemaster's Office","descriptions":["Vibrant purple blankets are stretched over a wooden tent-frame, slits cut in the fabric to provide several views of the surrounding marketplace.  This is the office of the bazaar's master and warden, Ani'haan, and judging from the bloodstained axe hanging on a stand behind his desk, the place where rough justice is often dispensed."],"exits":[{"to":292,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":295,"x":1220,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Grey Market Outskirts","descriptions":["The few merchants in this area feature items of a different nature and the tempo is much more subdued.  Workmen move large crates, their contents carefully concealed behind closely spaced wooden slats, over the edge of a dark causeway.  Loosely tied bales surround a rag merchant who sits propped against the wall, his hat covering his face as his assumed pose cries easy mark."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":296,"exit":"go","move":"go causeway"}]},
  {"id":296,"x":1200,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Causeway","descriptions":["Rough brownstone walls are silent sentinels as the causeway passes over a dark ditch used for flushing refuse out of the area.  The loudest shouts from the Grey Market are a tinny echo as they pierce the solitary gloom and bounce off the cobbled floor."],"exits":[{"to":297,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":295,"exit":"go","move":"go causeway"}]},
  {"id":297,"x":1200,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tunnel Passage","descriptions":["Relegated into a corner by passing feet, a smear of matted fur is squabbled over by a swarm of minute insects hovering like a cloud of dust motes.  Nearby, the scratching sound of claw on cobble hints at a speedier companion than the corpse."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":298,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":298,"x":1180,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tunnel Passage","descriptions":["Like a thief slipping unseen past guards, a small chink overhead admits a narrow shaft of light that slithers to the floor, creating a small puddle on the filthy cobbles.  The feeble efforts of what should serve as a ray of brightness fail miserably and serve only to further darken the surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":297,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":299,"x":1180,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tile Tunnel","descriptions":["Seepage from the ceiling runs down the walls in dark rivulets, leaving behind ridged lime deposits that glisten in the half-light.  Green moss draperies spread fuzzy tendrils that further conceal the mosaic tile walls hidden under the grime."],"exits":[{"to":300,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":298,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":300,"x":1200,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tile Tunnel","descriptions":["Changes in the moisture level cause the air here to range between the damp musty scent of the lower tunnels and a dry dust that leaves an itch in the back of the throat.  Glinting in the gloom, tile squares reveal a variety of mosaic eyes in shades from corn yellow to mud brown, erratically spaced high along the sides of the tunnel.  These mosaic eyes seem able to follow movement and occasionally appear to blink in the twilight."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":299,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":1220,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tile Tunnel","descriptions":["Cold white tile, almost antiseptic in its starkness, is broken by mosaics, one set high above its diametrically opposing colleague, as the eye motif develops.  The dark center of one wide-open eye stares down and across the expanse at its half-lidded mate, whose mirrored pupil appears to focus on something in the next room."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":300,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":302,"x":1240,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- purple, white and grey -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":306,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":301,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":303,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":303,"x":1220,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- black, white and purple -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":302,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":304,"x":1240,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Four columns -- black, teal, bronze, and white -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":306,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":303,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":305,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":305,"x":1220,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Two columns -- teal and black -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":306,"x":1260,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Four columns -- white, bronze, red, and grey -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":312,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":302,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":304,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":307,"x":1280,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Four columns -- bronze, pink, yellow, and red -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":311,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":306,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":309,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":308,"x":1300,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- pink, brown, and yellow -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":307,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":309,"x":1260,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- teal, pink, and bronze -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":304,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":310,"x":1320,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Four columns -- yellow, brown, orange, and green -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":313,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":314,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":311,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":308,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":311,"x":1300,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Four columns -- red, yellow, green, and blue -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":315,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":312,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":307,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":312,"x":1280,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- grey, red, and blue -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":306,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":313,"x":1340,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Two columns -- brown and orange -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":314,"x":1340,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- green, orange, and silver -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":310,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":315,"x":1320,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Columns","descriptions":["Thick columns diagonally shadowed by each other make the perception of depth elusive, and the immediate view of this room shrinks to hide far more than it reveals.  Three columns -- blue, green, and silver -- almost obscure the rest of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":311,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":316,"x":1060,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Collapsed Tunnel","descriptions":["Opening onto a large vault to the southeast, this brick tunnel dies out in an abrupt pile of rubble and debris.  The same collapse that blocked the northwestern vaults, however, also opened a natural passageway to the north.  The northern tunnel slopes downward, and looks utterly deserted from here."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":279,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":317,"x":1060,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Edge of the Warrens","descriptions":["A thin ray of pale light streams from a corridor to the south, sloping upward to a tall jumble of rocks.  All around, the shattered remains of brick walls mingle with natural rock to create a maze of passages and warrens, the aftermath of a great tremor that destroyed this quarter of Undershard."],"exits":[{"to":319,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":316,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":318,"x":820,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Stone Ramp","descriptions":["The endless warrens open onto a great cavern here, the core of the labyrinth.  A vast amphitheatre-like pit lies just to the south, reachable by a long stone ramp that slides down to the arena floor.  Torches flanking the ramp crackle and spit, acrid clouds of black smoke obscuring your vision."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":350,"exit":"go","move":"go warrens"}]},
  {"id":319,"x":1060,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Insane, hysterical laughter echoes faintly in the distance, ringing off the moldy bricks that barely support the low earthen roof.  Gouges in the walls open onto several passages, all of them shrouded in darkness."],"exits":[{"to":319,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":319,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":319,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":317,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":319,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":320,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":321,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":320,"x":1020,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["This tunnel bends sharply around, opening up into several more passageways.  The mazelike warrens never end, looping and twisted like a barrel of snakes."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":320,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":319,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":320,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":320,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":320,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":320,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":321,"x":1020,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The brick walls of an old storage chamber still stand here, pushing back the weight of a cave-in on three sides.  Jagged holes in the stone open onto natural tunnels all around."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":321,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":321,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":319,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":320,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":321,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":321,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":321,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":322,"x":980,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["This tunnel junction is marked by a splash of sticky brown wetness across one wall -- it is blood, fairly fresh by the looks of it, and whoever shed it was apparently trying to escape this hellish maze.  A number of corridors intersect here."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":322,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":322,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true},{"to":326,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":980,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The shadows that fill this corridor shift and move as if they were alive.  Twisting passageways, barely visible as maws of darkness against the crumbling stone walls, lead out of this ruined chamber, looping sinuously back upon themselves."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":325,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":323,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":320,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":322,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":323,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":323,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":323,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":324,"x":980,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A small crack in the ceiling has allowed water to leak through and form a stagnant puddle on the packed-earth floor.  The plink of drops of water hitting the pool sends echoes racing through the warrens to confuse the lost and drive the mad even more insane."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":324,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":324,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":324,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":323,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":324,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":324,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":324,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":325,"x":1020,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Half of the tunnel to the northwest has been cut off by a recent, massive cave-in.  The crumbling stonework walls seem frail compared to this evidence of stone's power."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":325,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":325,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":323,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":326,"x":940,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Canal Junction","descriptions":["A long, thin stone tunnel winds from the northeast to the south here, dominated by a deep drainage canal filled with icy water.  The canal has overflowed the narrow stone walkways on either side by about half an inch, the footing slippery and treacherous.  An open archway branches off to the southeast, where it connects to a featureless and near pitch-black corridor."],"exits":[{"to":328,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":322,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":327,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":940,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Drainage Culvert","descriptions":["A narrow walkway surrounds the lip of a great pit, where water from the northwestern canal pours endlessly through a rusted metal grate and down into darkness.  The circular chamber offers no exit but back up the tunnel, and the vast corroded gratework looks like it might cave in at any moment."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":328,"x":960,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Canal Tunnel","descriptions":["Curving northwest to southwest, this dark tunnel is silent save for the sloshing of water in a narrow drainage canal. Stone walkways flank the canal, providing passage for maintenance workers."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":329,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":329,"x":940,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Canal Inlet","descriptions":["A dark brick tunnel slopes down beneath the city here, narrow stone walkway running alongside a deep canal.  The tunnel mouth leads out, back to the city streets, while the stone tube quietly winds to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":328,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":376,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"}]},
  {"id":330,"x":1060,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A coppery, carrion stench fills the tunnel, but its source is nowhere to be seen.  Natural tunnels intersect and loop through this tiny cave, with no rhyme or reason."],"exits":[{"to":333,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":330,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":330,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":325,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":331,"x":1100,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Tunnels zig-zag every which way around you, without concern for logic or order.  Some double back to this very spot, while others run into one another or end in cave-ins and brick walls."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":331,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":332,"x":1140,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["This cramped nook is a junction point for several natural tunnels, twisting and winding in all directions.  Heavy bootsteps mar the soft dirt, the remnants of travellers who came before."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":332,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":332,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":333,"x":1060,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Portions of the haphazardly constructed walls in this section of the warrens have fallen down, cluttering the ground and revealing glimpses of great natural caverns beyond.  A pile of bones lies upon the rubble, vaguely resembling a humanoid shape."],"exits":[{"to":333,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":336,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":334,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":333,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":330,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":333,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":333,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":333,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":334,"x":1100,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The mazelike warrens of Undershard continue to twist and turn, baffling the greatest of trackers.  Ratholes line the walls, filling the dark room with the fetid stench of diseased flesh and rotting bodies."],"exits":[{"to":334,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":334,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":334,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":334,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":334,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":333,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":334,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":335,"x":1100,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Deep gouges have been cut into the rock, carving a strange geometric symbol that might have served as a marker for earlier travelers.  Its meaning, however, has been lost to time, and provides no clue on which way to turn next."],"exits":[{"to":334,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":335,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":335,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":336,"x":1100,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A small line of moss grows upon the northern wall, next to one of the many twisting stone passageways that lead through the warrens.  Lush and healthy at the top, nearly dead at the bottom, the moss follows the path of a small trickle of water leaking through a crack in the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":336,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":336,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":336,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":333,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":336,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":336,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":337,"x":1140,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The ceiling of this chamber is lined with stress fractures and is braced by a rotting wooden beam.  A sturdy wooden frame has been erected around each of the myriad twisting paths leading out, to prevent the roof from collapsing."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":338,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":337,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":337,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":338,"x":1140,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Strange echoes fill the room, echoing off the crumbling walls and down the many switchback tunnels that lead through the warrens.  Many scratches cover the walls, first in orderly rows then haphazardly, as if in desperation."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":338,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":338,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":338,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":338,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":338,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":338,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":339,"x":1140,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Wisps of smoke hover in this cramped tunnel, the apparent remains of a campfire, but only a few shards of burnt kindling litter the earthen floor.  Tunnels branch out in several directions, twisting out of sight."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":331,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":339,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":339,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":340,"x":1060,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Like filaments of an intricate spiderweb, crumbling stone passages lead from the room.  Darkness fills each passageway a few feet from the room, making it impossible to tell whether they are dead ends or more of the infuriating looping tunnels that have driven so many mad."],"exits":[{"to":340,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":325,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":341,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":340,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":341,"x":1020,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The skittering of rat claws upon stone fills this nexus of the twisting stone passageways that wind through the warrens of Undershard.  Darkness so thick it seems no light can penetrate it fills this room, making it nearly impossible to peer down the tunnels to see which lead to freedom, and which to continuing madness."],"exits":[{"to":341,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":341,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":340,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":341,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":341,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":341,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":341,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":342,"x":980,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["One of the walls to the east has collapsed, leading into a huge natural cavern.  Whatever tremor collapsed the one wall also closed off several of the passageways leading from this room."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":343,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":342,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":343,"x":1020,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["This huge cavern is filled with hundreds of stalactites and stalagmites, each as unique as a snowflake.  A breeze winds among them, creating a haunting whistling noise that echoes past the remains of a stonework wall to the west, leading into the tunnels of the warren.  One large stalagmite, its sides filled with crevices, leads up to a large opening in the ceiling of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":342,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":344,"x":980,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Phosphorescent moss grows on the floor, filling the room with a queasy green light that does nothing to illuminate the pathways leading out.  A few insects have made their homes beneath the moss, their shells covered in phosphorescent spores."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":345,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":344,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":344,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":344,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":344,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":345,"x":1020,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The shadows of the room seem to solidify and move as dark-furred rats crawl in and out of the holes upon the wall.  A slight breeze wafts out of one of the myriad tunnels, filling the room with the stench of rotting eggs."],"exits":[{"to":345,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":345,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":346,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":345,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":345,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":344,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":350,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":345,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":346,"x":1060,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A high-pitched giggle fills the room and echoes through the warrens.  Every few seconds, the wraith-like image of a small Elothean girl flickers into existence, her eyes filled with madness and her lips curled back against her teeth in a perpetual howl of loneliness."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":346,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":347,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":346,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":346,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":346,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":345,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":346,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":347,"x":1100,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A yawning chasm splits this great stone cavern in two, just barely narrow enough to leap over.  Noxious fumes billow out of the chasm, filling the room with a miasma of death.  A slight updraft prevents the fumes from leaking into the rest of the warrens."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":347,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":347,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":351,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":347,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":347,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":347,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":348,"x":1140,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The chunks of rock that fill this room bear the reddish patterns common to rock near a vein of iron ore.  It is doubtful the vein is still intact, considering the massive destruction wrought by the cave-in, yet many a prospective miner has begun searching for this instant source of wealth."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":349,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":348,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":348,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":349,"x":1140,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["Filled with jagged rocks and debris, the only way through the large room is a narrow pathway cleared by some unknown traveller long ago.  From the drops of dried blood spattered upon the rocks and floor, whoever cleared the path did so while trying to run from some unnamed terror."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":336,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":350,"x":980,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The stench of rotten eggs fills the room, coming from a bubbling pool in the northeastern corner.  Wafting upon a gentle breeze, the smell is drawn down the myriad tunnels that fill the warrens."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":350,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":345,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":350,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":350,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":350,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":350,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":350,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go stone ramp"}]},
  {"id":351,"x":1100,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["A stone bedframe, lying in pieces upon the floor, is all that remains of what was once a child's bedchamber.  When the cave-in that shattered this portion of Undershard struck, most had enough warning to get out.  Although, judging by the gnawed remains of a finger-bone sticking out from under the rubble, not all did."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":351,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast","hidden":true},{"to":351,"exit":"east","move":"east","hidden":true},{"to":351,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":351,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":352,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":340,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":351,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":352,"x":1060,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Warrens","descriptions":["The soft glow of light fills this room, coming from a small vein of rose quartz that peeks its way out of the stone ceiling.  Stretching all the way to the surface, somehow light refracts down the length of the vein to fill the room with the same glow seen at sunset on a clear day."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"north","move":"north","hidden":true},{"to":351,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":336,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":352,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast","hidden":true},{"to":352,"exit":"south","move":"south","hidden":true},{"to":352,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest","hidden":true},{"to":352,"exit":"west","move":"west","hidden":true},{"to":352,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":353,"x":820,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Arena of Trothfang","descriptions":["The arena floor is a theater of horrors, with the stone washed brown in a river of dried and caked blood.  The stench of charred flesh rises from a roasting pit in the center of the floor, before a crude shrine to Trothfang built with scraps of brick and severed bone.  A metal spike juts up from the center of the pit, the blackened remains of a human skeleton impaled halfway down its length.  Empty wine flasks and gnawed bones litter the floor, the remains of some insane cult's revels."],"exits":[{"to":318,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":354,"exit":"go","move":"go large crack"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":820,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["The ruined street of a once-beautiful city curves away to the east and west.  Looming imposingly over the shattered windows and walls of houses, the slate gray walls of the Arena of Trothfang are split by a large crack to the north."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":355,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":358,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":840,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["A cold silence fills the air, along with the miasma of bodies long dead and rotting.  Trinkets and scraps of cloth litter the ground, along with the gnawed bones that are the only remains of the underground city's inhabitants.  Many of the trinkets are those commonly found at festivals throughout Ilithi, as though the citizens were in the midst of some celebration when the caverns collapsed about them."],"exits":[{"to":356,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":354,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":860,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["A small mountain of stone debris blocks all passage to the south.  Once part of the cavern's roof, the avalanche of stone fell unexpectedly upon the innocent people living below, shattering their homes and their lives.  As though in defiant denial of the ancient destruction, thick green moss coats the stones in testimony to life's triumph over destruction."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":355,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":357,"x":840,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of Kertigen's Gift","descriptions":["A great chasm lies to the west, blocking all travel in that direction.  In the dim light of the caverns, a faint gleam of light can be seen reflecting from the inside of a house split in twain by the chasm.  A small skeleton, that of a child or a Halfling, holds onto a mirror even in death."],"exits":[{"to":356,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":358,"x":800,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["The houses and storefronts lining this stretch of the city street are curiously untouched by the destruction seen elsewhere, almost as if some fickle god had protected them, while leaving their neighbors to die."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":359,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":359,"x":780,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["The bones of a small child hang from an upstairs window like a puppet with its strings cut.  Too high for the scavengers to reach, the skeleton remains in perfect condition, save for the chunk of stone imbedded in its skull."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":360,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":374,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":360,"x":800,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of Kertigen's Gift","descriptions":["A charnel house reek emanates from the crumpled remains of a tavern on the northern side of the street.  Layer upon layer of bodies lie pinned beneath rubble covering the porch, an indication of the mass panic to exit the pub before the end came.  Hanging from a rotting cord, a decrepit sign sways from the remains of the tavern porch."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":359,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":820,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of Kertigen's Gift","descriptions":["Towards the east, a great chasm slices through the street with knife-edge precision.  One house, split in twain by the chasm, perches precariously upon the edge.  Half-rotted furniture and gnawed bones can be seen in the abandoned rooms.  A tall spire of stone rises to the south, looming imposingly over the shattered cavern."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":360,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":362,"x":820,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Spire","descriptions":["Like a giant spear of stone, the Spire rises in overwhelming majesty from the cavern floor.  Faded rags hang from a large sign nailed to the base of a small stand beside the Spire."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":364,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":365,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":363,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Spire"]},
  {"id":363,"x":800,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Cavern of Voices","descriptions":["The huge cavern is filled with the echoes of long-dead voices.  Shouts of laughter and joy vie with screams of pain and terror in the overwhelming cacophony of sound."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":364,"x":840,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Minstrel's Nook","descriptions":["The small side cavern is filled with the sounds of a small stream of water trickling down one wall.  A ledge towards the back is piled high with moldy cushions, the place where Bards once entertained the people of Undershard.  On one wall, a small painting provides a clue why this cavern was untouched by the catastrophe."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":365,"x":820,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of the Shadow's Brother","descriptions":["The houses lining the street, decrepit even before the cave-in, are now so fragile that the slightest breeze would turn them to dust.  The miasma of long-rotted bodies is, if anything, more pronounced in the area once known as the slum of Undershard."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":366,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":375,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":366,"x":840,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of the Shadow's Brother","descriptions":["Several houses have collapsed, their rotting wooden frames destroyed from within by various pests.  Two houses lean together, forming a narrow alley to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":368,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":367,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":365,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":367,"x":820,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Blind Alley","descriptions":["The walls of the alley press close together.  The two collapsed buildings which form this passage rumble and groan as though about to collapse at any second.  A faint skittering sound in the shadows fills the room with a sense of danger."],"exits":[{"to":366,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":368,"x":860,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["A great pile of stone to the north blocks all travel in that direction.  The once-lavish city street curves around to the southwest, lined by broken-down houses and a few signs that the houses are once again occupied."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":366,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":369,"x":840,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["A wall to the southwest has completely collapsed, shattering many decrepit houses with it.  The destruction has revealed several small caverns not seen in centuries, if ever.  The few remaining houses lining the street are a mix of wood and stone that look ready to fall apart at any second."],"exits":[{"to":368,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":370,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":372,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":370,"x":860,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Caverns","descriptions":["Phosphorescent moss grows on the floor, filling the cavern with a queasy green light that does little to illuminate the pathways leading south.  A few insects have made their homes beneath the moss, their shells covered in phosphorescent spores."],"exits":[{"to":371,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":369,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":371,"x":860,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Caverns","descriptions":["A giant stalactite hangs precariously from the cracked ceiling above.  The soft whistling of wind through the cavern fills the air with a sense of suppressed danger."],"exits":[{"to":370,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":372,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":820,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["The cavern's collapse shattered the wall to the south, opening pathways to several new caverns.  Curving to the north, the shattered remains of the street continue their silent journey."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":371,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":373,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":373,"x":800,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["Chips of wood and glass, and large boulders are all that remain of the houses lining this portion of the street.  Under one large boulder, a shattered skeleton still tries vainly to protect another from the sky's falling."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":374,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":780,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Circle of the New Moon Rising","descriptions":["The gates of a great manor lie warped and twisted shut between the crumbled remains of walls once patrolled by vigilant guards.  In the manor's yard, the bones of a small dog can be seen, a steel chain still around its neck leading to a spike in the ground."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":375,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":373,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":375,"x":800,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Path of the Shadow's Brother","descriptions":["In an uneasy juxtaposition, the remains of the slums lean against the crumbled wall of a once-prosperous Merchant's house.  Once filled with the noise and laughter of parties and family, the mansion is now pierced by a great column of stone."],"exits":[{"to":365,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":374,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":920,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Channel Bank","descriptions":["A narrow opening in the bedrock leads into darkness here, the faint scent of sewage rising from it.  Legend has it that during the Dragon Wars and the occupation of Shard, the priests dug underneath the city, creating warrens and passages deep below.  The bubble and splash of the water channel that rushes by to the south tries hard, but cannot drown out the loud creaks and clangs that reverberate out of the opening."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":329,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow opening"}],"aliases":["Ivy"]},
  {"id":377,"x":900,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Channel Bank","descriptions":["The angry sound of the madly rushing inner-city channels fills the air as the chilly waters sweep east to west on their way out of Shard.  A steep bank nearly thirty feet high pushes its way up to the north, the shadows from the Bridge of Sparrows changing the soil and bedrock that forms the wall of earth from russet brown to umbra."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":378,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":900,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Channel Bank","descriptions":["Rich brown soil dotted with patches of emerald green grass forms this bank.  Gradually changing from soft dirt to the hard bedrock of the city's foundations, the slope rolls down to a bank that allows one to skirt the edge of the rushing water channel over which the Bridge of Sparrows, rising to the west approximately fifteen feet away, allows passage."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"up","move":"up","hidden":true},{"to":377,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":379,"x":1280,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["A narrow alleyway stretches from the main plaza of Undershard towards a nondescript wooden door against the far wall.  The alley's walls are covered in layer upon layer of graffiti, new written over old, until no sign of the original walls remains.  A couple of local thugs stand barely visible in the shadows, their alert eyes scanning passers by with a frightening intensity."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"room knock door;'$shard.pw;go door"}]},
  {"id":380,"x":1320,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tunnels","descriptions":["A small bubble in the rock has been enlarged and shaped to provide just enough room to stand in.  Inside the rounded walls, the incessant cries of the grey market merchants are reduced to mere whispers.  A fire outside the entrance lights a long cramped corridor cut through the rock to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":290,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":381,"x":1220,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The overwhelming stench of raw sewage and rotting vegetable matter creates a miasma that causes the air to shimmer and waver.  Water rushes by thickly to the south, vanishing into pitch darkness."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"linksTo":"Map68_shard_south_gate.xml"},
  {"id":382,"x":220,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Malik the True Bard, Instruments and Picks","descriptions":["Less a shop and more an extension of Malik's living room, several tasteful couches and lounges have been arranged in aesthetically pleasing positions about the room, the better to allow the true musicians who visit this shop to test the owner's handiwork.  A fine array of instruments and their complimenting tools lay behind a display and hang from the walls, looking more than just pretty."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":383,"exit":"none","move":"script shardlocksmith"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Malik the True Bard","Bard Shop","Music Shop","Instruments"]},
  {"id":383,"x":220,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Kilam's Locks","descriptions":["Hidden away in the basement beneath Malik's Musical Instruments lies the shop of his brother Kilam, Shard's specialist in locks and picks.  The shop's walls and floor are bare unfinished stone, while heavy pine beams support the building above.  Subdued street noises filter through a narrow barred window near the ceiling, and occasional muffled footsteps echo through the quiet store as booted feet walk overhead."],"exits":[{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Locksmith","Kilam"]},
  {"id":384,"x":320,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Sierack's Reagents, Showroom","descriptions":["Bones hang from the ceiling by lengths of twine, clicking against one another as the taller customers make their way through the aisles.  Bottles, jars, and beakers filled with strange and undefinable objects have been piled precariously on the shelves beside grimoires, talismans, cambrinth balls, and other magical devices.  Amidst the cluttered showroom sits the eccentric Sierack, surveying his shop with a narrowed and territorial expression on his face."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Sierack's Reagents","magic","artificer"]},
  {"id":385,"x":380,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard's Osut'vie","descriptions":["Indefinable odors waft from various mortars, pots and cauldrons on tables and shelves throughout the shop.  Herbs, carefully dried and cured, hang in bunches from a drying rack suspended from the ceiling.  Everything the serious alchemist could possibly want or need can be found in here.  A section of shelving separates a tall ironbound door from a smaller wood door on the opposite wall."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":386,"exit":"go","move":"go wood door"},{"to":387,"exit":"go","move":"go ironbound door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Shard's Osut'vie","Alchemy","Zieq"]},
  {"id":386,"x":370,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Zieq's Office","descriptions":["A small battered desk crouches in the corner opposite the door.  Floor to ceiling shelves, crammed with books and alchemy tools, stand against all four walls.  Strange substances bubble and splutter in glass jars."],"exits":[{"to":385,"exit":"go","move":"go wood door"}]},
  {"id":387,"x":380,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Osut'vie Stillroom","descriptions":["Rows of shelves, crammed with books on alchemy, tools of the trade, and a hodgepodge of herbs and components, line the room.  High on one wall, the lone window is covered over with heavy fabric, keeping the room in perpetual twilight to protect sensitive components.  The herbalist Idizieq stands behind the counter, happily working on his experiments at a low table in between helping customers."],"exits":[{"to":385,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Herbs"]},
  {"id":388,"x":920,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Foyer","descriptions":["Strands of silver shoot through the black marble laid into the floor of the temple, spinning out across the glossy floor like the webs of some elaborate and unseen spider.  Shadows fall like curtains from the walls, concealing alcoves and small niches where statues of gods take residence.  Further down the hall to the north the darkness deepens as it allows access to the main hall of the temple."],"exits":[{"to":389,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":85,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":395,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}],"aliases":["Dark Temple"]},
  {"id":389,"x":920,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall","descriptions":["The ceiling of the main hall climbs up in a steep curve of black marble.  Light from an unseen source shoots up out of ledges on the long sides of the hall, glancing off the facets of small diamonds that have been embedded in the vaulted roof.  The distant echo of someone crying softly carries through the narrow hall, coming from deeper in the darkness that lies to the north."],"exits":[{"to":392,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":391,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":388,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":390,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":390,"x":900,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Gela Erorien","descriptions":["On the wall opposite the doorway, a panoramic mural shows a red sun setting behind distant mountains to the west of Shard.  Painted clouds on the wall and ceiling shade from cream to rose as the sky around them blends imperceptibly from crimson to the indigo overhead to the velvet black of the eastern wall."],"exits":[{"to":389,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":391,"x":940,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Gela Wepaten","descriptions":["At first glance, the room seems an open space beneath a starry sky: the dim light and the dull black of the walls merge into a dimensionless space in the center of which candles glow on a black altar.  Their light reflects from hundreds of tiny silvered points on the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":389,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":392,"x":920,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall","descriptions":["A ring of white marble sits in the dead center of the main hall.  Blindingly white, the ring seems almost to be there to bind the darkness that permeates the whole of this holy place.  Corridors to the east and west lead off into separate wings, their exact terminus lost in the darkness that cloaks the expanse of the temple.  The flickering of candles illuminate the way to the north and south, teasing the eye with the promise of more light."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":394,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":389,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":393,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":393,"x":900,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Western Alcove","descriptions":["A stone carving rises up out of the smooth face of the wall at the end of this alcove like some strange wave breaking the surface of a frozen obsidian waterfall.  The only illumination is the light coming from the main hall to the east, which is itself only fitful at best."],"exits":[{"to":392,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":394,"x":940,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Eastern Alcove","descriptions":["A dark portal has forced itself upon the wall at the end of this alcove, the edges pulling at the black marble and drawing it close in a swirling embrace of greys and obsidians.  To the west, fleeting, sickly illumination attempts to break through the eternal night of the temple."],"exits":[{"to":392,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go dark portal","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":395,"x":940,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Glassus' Shop","descriptions":["The walls and floor of this sparsely furnished but clean room are of gold-veined white marble.  A series of immaculate countertops displays a variety of god-related artwork.  The proprietor of the shop, a smiling grey-cloaked monk by the name of Glassus, can often be found at his desk casually plucking the feathers from a dead and bloody pigeon."],"exits":[{"to":388,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Glassus' Shop"]},
  {"id":396,"x":920,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Grand Chamber","descriptions":["Corridors shoot out in all directions, a spider's maze of passages.  Wax splotches the floor in the center of the hall where the candles fixed in a wooden chandelier overhead have dripped down and frozen on the chilly marble.  Mixed sounds of chanting and weeping echo through the hall, a cacophony of cruelty multiplied tenfold by whatever dark architect designed the chamber to echo the world's sorrows with such crystal-clear clarity."],"exits":[{"to":397,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":402,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":410,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":392,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":406,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":398,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Temple of Darkness"]},
  {"id":397,"x":920,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Botolf's Alcove","descriptions":["The quality of light is dim and fuzzy here, as if some sort of thick miasma obfuscates your vision no matter which way you turn your gaze.  A figure in shining armor stands at the back of the alcove, a mighty two-handed weapon clasped point-down against its chest."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Botolf"]},
  {"id":398,"x":900,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall of Agony","descriptions":["Cries of pain echo through the hall, rising from soft to loud before crashing back down to a whimper.  Engravings of various scenes of torture from the past of Ilithi twist their way out of the wall, evoking a macabre sense of fascination to the casual eye.  The lighting is brighter here, intentionally harsh to cause a strain on the eyes and a nagging headache on the brain."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":396,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":401,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":400,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Hall of Agony"]},
  {"id":399,"x":900,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Asketi's Alcove","descriptions":["A hearth is sunk into the floor in the center of this dim and chilly alcove, ashes from a long-dead fire spreading across the bottom.  A draft as chill as the north wind Asketi rides swirls through the air, rustling the various withered flowers and decomposing apples that are offered here in hopes of appeasing the cruel goddess."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Asketi"]},
  {"id":400,"x":880,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Dergati's Alcove","descriptions":["No permanent light fixtures have been set up anywhere in honor of the goddess of true darkness.  Despite this, there is a definite air of tidiness -- someone has been polishing the floors and walls, and making sure that not a speck of dust mars the alabaster statue of Dergati that rests to the rear of the small shrine."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Dergati"]},
  {"id":401,"x":900,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Aldauth's Alcove","descriptions":["Larger than the other alcoves in deference to the god of dark endings, most of the space is wasted since the only permanent fixture is a small black altar in the center of the rectangular room.  The air is neither hot nor cold, and there is no discernable fragrance.  Stripped down to the bare black marble floor, walls and altar, this is a quiet statement of just what we take with us when Aldauth pays his final visit."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Aldauth"]},
  {"id":402,"x":940,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall of Vengeance","descriptions":["Crossed broken swords ornament the walls, side-by-side with the rent and rusted armor of those who have taken the oath of blood in the name of justice.  Torches flicker in sconces, casting shifting, churning light over everything but never quite reaching the ceiling.  There is a musty scent here, like that of stagnation."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":404,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":405,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":396,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Hall of Vengeance"]},
  {"id":403,"x":940,"y":900,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Trothfang's Alcove","descriptions":["This shrine is completely bare of any form of ornament or decoration.  Not even a statue graces the alcove, the only permanent fixture being a brass brazier on a tripod in the center.  The scent of burning flesh and the faint tang of copper hangs in the air, the subtle taste of the god of pain."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Trothfang"]},
  {"id":404,"x":960,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Drogor's Alcove","descriptions":["The tang of salt hangs in the air, coming from the saltwater-filled fountain in the center of the alcove.  A glowering statue of Drogor as his Gor'Tog self stands in the center of the fountain, up to his mid-calves in water.  A small shark swims through the water, preying on the tiny gobbets of flesh that are dropped in by the local priests."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Drogor"]},
  {"id":405,"x":960,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Be'ort's Alcove","descriptions":["Unnerving silence fills this small and mostly unextraordinary alcove.  The only point of interest here is the statue of Be'ort that huddles in the back."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Be'ort"]},
  {"id":406,"x":880,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall of Death","descriptions":["A lingering chill slips from between the seams of the walls and the glossy black floor, calling up the memory of aching bones in winter time.  The faint scent of burning blood and the taste of salt and copper hang in the air, tickling the senses like a finger applied to the back of the throat."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":409,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":408,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":407,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Hall of Death"]},
  {"id":407,"x":860,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Harawep's Alcove","descriptions":["This alcove is almost completely entombed with strands of sticky white cobwebs.  A draft ruffles some of the webbing, which all but covers the statue of Harawep huddled in the back of the tiny room.  Peering out from behind a veil of spidersilk, the hunched goddess glares and clutches a set of knitting needles.  The uncomfortable presence of shadowy movement near the back reveals a nest of black widow spiders who keep the walls and ceiling well-shrouded."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Harawep"]},
  {"id":408,"x":860,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Kerenhappuch's Alcove","descriptions":["An ivory statue of Kerenhappuch in full skirt and low-cut blouse is located at the end of this alcove, the lighting at her feet and casting interesting shadows, especially around her chiseled eyes, which dance in the wicked light.  Gold leaf has been applied to her hair, and cinnamon incense cones lie burning at her feet, filling the air with a heady, spicy odor."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Kerenhappuch"]},
  {"id":409,"x":880,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Zachriedek's Alcove","descriptions":["The sour smell of vinegar and the musty odor of molding bread fill the air of this small and stuffy alcove.  A glowering, hunched-over relief of Zachriedek pops out of the wall furthest from the hall, his features rough from an unkind artist's chisel.  Fine cracks seam his face and body, as if it were about to crumble."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Zachriedek"]},
  {"id":410,"x":960,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Hall of Madness","descriptions":["Faint giggling and the definite scent of overly powerful incense floats in through a set of appallingly gawdy draperies over an alcove to the north.  The acoustics of this part of the temple are good -- almost painfully so as they amplify the sound of desperate laughter in a steady flurry that borders on cacophony."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":412,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":396,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":413,"exit":"go","move":"go gawdy draperies"}],"aliases":["Hall of Madness"]},
  {"id":411,"x":980,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Ushnish's Alcove","descriptions":["Carnelian bands of gypsum twist like snakes in the floor here, writhing as they move up to the statue of Ushnish at the back of the room.  The granite statue of the god of treacherous rage is uncharacteristically calm in this carving, his serpentine eyes gazing quietly down and his hands folded in front of him as he clasps his famous iron-shod staff.  There is a deep sense of solitude here, as if the alcove were located miles below the earth."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Ushnish"]},
  {"id":412,"x":960,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Huldah's Alcove","descriptions":["The air is filled with a static feel, like a thunderstorm waiting to burst.  Veins of dark blue lapis shoot through the floor and walls, flashing like streaks of lightning.  The statue of Huldah that stands here is shaped from solid iron and plated in copper that is gradually growing greenish with age."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Huldah"]},
  {"id":413,"x":980,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Darkness, Idon's Alcove","descriptions":["Garish pillows and blankets are spread out along the floor of this small shrine.  Curtains in appalling colors and of various incredibly expensive fabrics hang from the walls, draping the statue of Idon who stands smirking toward the back.  The strong scent of burning, spicy incense permeates the air."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy draperies"}],"aliases":["Idon"]},
  {"id":414,"x":1220,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Temple of Light","descriptions":["Gold-veined white marble columns set upon square gilt bases support an arching roof with a fresco depicting the final battle between the Immortals and the World Dragon.  Hushed voices echoing from hidden alcoves soothe all who enter with melodious chants.  Candles burning in niches lining the walls between the pillars provide soft illumination.  A pair of embossed silver doors leading out onto the street stand wide open.","Light from candles set in wall niches reflects off gold-veined white marble columns to relieve the night's shadows.  Hushed voices chanting an eternal lullaby filter from unseen alcoves.  A pair of embossed silver doors stands open just wide enough for a soul to slip through to the street."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":416,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":415,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":417,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"},{"to":86,"exit":"go","move":"go doors","hidden":true}],"aliases":["Light Temple"]},
  {"id":415,"x":1200,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Gela Ortegunen","descriptions":["The four walls of the room to north, east, west, and south are painted with the vistas seen from the highest tower of the city.  The views recede from the foreground of the roofs of Shard at the bottom of the walls and lead the eye upward to a distant horizon in every direction.  The ceiling directly above a wooden altar shows a golden sun."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":1240,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Gela Arenen","descriptions":["The first sight on entering the room is the eastern wall, covered with a vast painting of the lands stretching to the east of Shard.  The other walls of the square room continue the panorama of views to the north, west, and south.  Above the horizon on the east wall, the rosy fingers of dawn reach toward the ceiling, across which the colors darken to a deep, velvety purple above the dim mountains on the western horizon."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":417,"x":1240,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Dim Alcove","descriptions":["A single candle burns steadily on a long wooden table here.  The stone bench pushed up against it looks hard and cold, but a beautiful illuminated book lies open on the table's surface, beckoning those who seek the wisdom of the gods to sit and study."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Wisdom"]},
  {"id":418,"x":1220,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Grand Hall","descriptions":["An alabaster dome, inset with crystal prisms and held aloft by vaulted arches, soars above the polished tile floor.  Light filtering through the prisms creates a dancing multi-hued aurora high above the fountain.  Centered beneath the dome is a fountain bubbling with water stained by the colorful reflected light.  A series of detailed mosaic animal images symbolizing the deities paves the path between the fountain and surrounding arches.","An alabaster dome, inset with crystal prisms and held aloft by vaulted arches, soars above the polished tile floor.  Dim light from the stars and city is diffused through the prisms to wash the dome in pale hues.  Centered beneath the dome is a fountain bubbling with clear water.  A series of detailed mosaic animal images symbolizing the deities paves the path between the fountain and surrounding arches."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":414,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":420,"exit":"go","move":"go fountain"},{"to":434,"exit":"go","move":"go alamhif arch"},{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go albreda arch"},{"to":431,"exit":"go","move":"go berengaria arch"},{"to":427,"exit":"go","move":"go divyaush arch"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go eylhaar arch"},{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go firulf arch"},{"to":432,"exit":"go","move":"go kuniyo arch"},{"to":424,"exit":"go","move":"go lemicus arch"},{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go murrula arch"},{"to":430,"exit":"go","move":"go peri'el arch"},{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go phelim arch"},{"to":425,"exit":"go","move":"go rutilor arch"},{"to":423,"exit":"go","move":"go smaragda arch"},{"to":551,"exit":"go","move":"go silver portal"}],"aliases":["Temple of Light"]},
  {"id":419,"x":1220,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Terrace","descriptions":["A curved slate-paved terrace running the length of the temple stretches outwards from the building.  The terrace area is enclosed by a marble railing.  Wrought iron tables and chairs dot the terrace for those who wish to enjoy the view of the gardens below."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":421,"exit":"go","move":"go marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":420,"x":1200,"y":1060,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Fountain of One","descriptions":["Elegant and austere, the Fountain of One is a circular pool sculpted from gold-veined marble.  Within the pool, partially submerged visages of the Immortals exhale plumes of water which meld to form a single spray rising to touch the aurora above."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go grand hall"}],"aliases":["water","holy water"]},
  {"id":421,"x":1220,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Garden Archway","descriptions":["A gravel path lined with green ferns leads from the bottom of the steps to the garden entrance.  Creeping vines covered with delicate violet blooms cling to the archway and small urns with potted flowers line the sides of the path."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"go","move":"go marble staircase"},{"to":422,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":1220,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Contemplation Garden","descriptions":["The gravel path winds from the archway to create a perfect circle.  Various medicinal herbs line the sides of the path, creating an aromatic border.  Inside the circle a low cut hedge, barely knee-high, forms an intricate maze ending at a sundial set in a tiny inner circle."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}],"aliases":["Contemplation Garden"]},
  {"id":423,"x":1260,"y":920,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Smaragdaus","descriptions":["More like a tap-room than a chapel, tarts and juice offered on long banquet tables tempt worshippers.  Cheerful tapestries of people dancing, couples courting and families enjoying life together adorn the walls.  On the domed ceiling, a painting of a laughing man, mug in hand, watches over all who come to visit.  Soft cushions are tossed around the room for people to rest comfortably."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go yellow arch"}],"aliases":["Smaragdaus","Saemaus","almsbox","tithe"]},
  {"id":424,"x":1260,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Lemicus","descriptions":["A gigantic mosaic of the sun rising over the ocean fills one entire wall of the chapel.  An equally large mosaic of a woman bidding her husband farewell before he sails covers the opposite wall.  A table pushed against the third wall holds a brazier filled with the ashes of burned prayer scrolls.  Two plain wooden benches sit back-to-back in the middle of the room."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Lemicus"]},
  {"id":425,"x":1260,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Rutilor","descriptions":["An effigy of a warrior in full plate lies upon a raised stone dais carved with the images of baying hounds.  One wall is inscribed with the Paladin's Code, the other walls are adorned with rich tapestries illustrating legendary enchanted weaponry.  Hard stone benches line the walls for repenting pilgrims."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Rutilor"]},
  {"id":426,"x":1260,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Eylhaar","descriptions":["Dark grey walls enclose a somber chamber dominated by an ebony dais in the center of the room.  Censers in the four corners fill the air with the aroma of sandalwood.  Worshippers repeat hushed prayers of peace for departed friends and relatives as others sit in silence, remembering the dead.  Ebony pews with kneeler boards are set before the altar."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#400040","aliases":["Eylhaar","Depart","shrine"]},
  {"id":427,"x":1260,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Divyaush","descriptions":["Modest by a wealthy trader's terms, the chapel has an intricately carved altar surrounded by glass cases in which each craftsman's art is represented.  Tools made from precious metals and set with gems decorate the chapel's walls along with a sumptuous tapestry depicting Divyaush appraising an Elven longsword.  Over in one corner is a stack of thick prayer mats to soften the hard floor for praying knees."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go welkin arch"},{"to":436,"exit":"go","move":"go recessed doorway"}],"aliases":["Divyaush"]},
  {"id":428,"x":1260,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Phelim","descriptions":["Heavy black velvet drapery covers the walls, muffling sound and light.  Blue, red and black models of Elanthia's moons hang from the ceiling, glowing gently from some internal illumination.  In the black ceiling above, twinkling white crystals form the constellations of the thirteen light aspects of the Immortals.  A small onyx-topped altar rests in the center of the room, and padded pews set at a deep angle allow comfortable contemplation."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Phelim"]},
  {"id":429,"x":1260,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Murrula","descriptions":["A statue of a woman playing a flute stands in this acoustically perfect chapel.  Her eyes gaze over the room as if judging the voices of the bards that gather around her.  The wall behind the statue is decorated with images of musical instruments, and the wall across from it has a small stage built against it.  Cushions are stacked near the stage, ready to be used during impromptu concerts."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Murrula"]},
  {"id":430,"x":1180,"y":940,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Peri'el","descriptions":["A marble statue of a S'kra woman, graceful arm bent to her harp as she sits before a recumbent dragon, fills the center of the chamber.  Lame and half-blind, she seems oddly peaceful as she sings her eternal song, pausing only to sprinkle sand on the sleeping dragon.  A niche in one of the walls holds several conch shells.  Marble benches line the smooth marble walls, giving people a place to sit while admiring the statue."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Peri'el"]},
  {"id":431,"x":1180,"y":960,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Berengaria","descriptions":["Two tinted glass walls and a skylight illuminate the worshippers in a garden-like sanctuary.  Vines curl from niches in the other walls.  At the center of the room, surrounded by wrought iron benches and raised beds of herbs is a statue of Berengaria in a circle of violets and bellflowers.  At the statue's feet are baskets of grain offered by those seeking her blessing."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Berengaria"]},
  {"id":432,"x":1180,"y":980,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Kuniyo","descriptions":["Tapestries on the chapel walls show lush jungles filled with stalking beasts.  From brass planters near the ceiling, vines cascade to the floor, where rough rush mats and potted palms surround a bamboo altar.  Several small rattan stools dot the room for those who wish to remain to commune with their god."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Kuniyo"]},
  {"id":433,"x":1180,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Albreda","descriptions":["The floor is inlaid with a massive seven-pointed star.  At each point, there is a small stone table with a statuette representing one of the seven races.  In the middle of the inlaid star there is a large sculpture representing all races, their hands reaching towards the heavens.  From the ceiling, a painting of Albreda smiles down at the figures.  Padded benches line the walls for those who wish to rest here."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Albreda"]},
  {"id":434,"x":1180,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Alamhif","descriptions":["Colorful frescos of happy children bolster the cheerful tone of this alcove.  Laughing and shrieking joyfully, children of all races are pictured running and playing.  Overlooking their antics is an old man with a kind face holding an injured magpie gently in his hands.  A low table holding a bowl filled with peppermints and taffy rests against one wall and brightly-colored cushions are provided for sitting upon."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Alamhif"]},
  {"id":435,"x":1180,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Temple of Light, Alcove of Firulf","descriptions":["The air in the room seems to crackle with elemental energy as an unwavering light shines through a wall-sized stained-glass picture of Firulf watching mages in battle.  The colored radiance from the glass falls on the altar in the center of the chamber.  The other walls are polished bare grey granite.  Scarlet velvet floor pillows trimmed with gold braid provide seating for those who choose to meditate here."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Firulf"]},
  {"id":436,"x":1280,"y":1000,"z":0,"title":"Sister Imadrail's Emporium","descriptions":["A soft light illuminates this small shop, lending a gentle glow to the matronly Sister Imadrail who quietly walks about tending to the inventory or customers.  Despite its marble floor the room is surprisingly silent, all sound muffled before the array of the holy instruments of the gods.  The air is rich with the scent of sandalwood incense."],"exits":[{"to":427,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cleric Shop","Sister Imadrail's Emporium"]},
  {"id":437,"x":560,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Fiona's Fine Swords and Shields, Front Room","descriptions":["The sharp smell of burning pine and a touch of heat on the skin marks the presence of the forge in the back of this mostly stone-crafted building.  Swords hanging from the seamlessly fitted granite walls glow in the light, gleaming with the polish and care that has been lavished on them.  Fiona Lightwielder, the owner of the shop, watches her inventory and clientele from where she sits before a table of knife pieces, fitting them together methodically."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Fiona's Fine Swords and Shields","Weapons"]},
  {"id":438,"x":460,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Foyer","descriptions":["Pale silk curtains frame frosted glass windows that are set into the walls of the spacious foyer.  A registration desk stands in the center, wealthy traders and distinguished dilletantes passing by.  Elegant glass vases and lifesculpted plants add an elegant air to this place."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":3,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Silver Eye"]},
  {"id":439,"x":460,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Hall of Heroes","descriptions":["Portraits of ancient heroes line the walls.  A bust of the Ferdahl Kukalakai rests on a marble pedestal in the center of the room.  A wool carpet covers the cold stone floor."],"exits":[{"to":440,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":438,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":440,"x":470,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Hallway","descriptions":["A plush golden wool runner trails from one end of the hallway to a large winding oak stair.  Gilded sculptures line the walls, ornate carvings of wood poised in elegant embraces.  A potted t'gora plant perfumes the air with a thick, heady scent as its snow-white blossoms open wide in the dim lighting of the room."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":439,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":443,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak stair"}]},
  {"id":441,"x":480,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Tavern Room","descriptions":["A warm fire throws mottled shadows over the dark corners.  People sit chatting in quiet voices, toasting with mulled ale and fine spring wines.  The scent of roasted meat drifts through the air."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":440,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":442,"x":480,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Bar","descriptions":["A tall Elothean stands behind a slender obsidian bar serving drinks and food.  Pale silk cloths cover round wooden tables.  The thick scent of elven wine permeates the air.  Flickering candle lights hover softly, their soft illuminations casting shadows around the room."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":443,"x":470,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Corridor","descriptions":["A golden oak stair winds down the wall, descending to the bottom level of the inn.  Ceramic vases filled to the brim with delicate white and silver roses line the walls.  An ornate wooden sculpture stands near the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":444,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":450,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":451,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"},{"to":440,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak stair"}]},
  {"id":444,"x":470,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Corridor","descriptions":["Soft pastel silk panels line the hallway, draping gently over closed windows made from fine frosted glass.  The wooden walls beneath are carved with elaborate etchings of fluid dragons and elegant, regal birds."],"exits":[{"to":443,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":445,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":448,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"},{"to":449,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"}]},
  {"id":445,"x":490,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Residential Corridor","descriptions":["A gracefully curving golden oak staircase sweeps down to the second floor at the southern end of the hallway.  Private apartments line the corridor, occupied by guests who value the convenience and efficient service offered by the inn."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":444,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":446,"x":490,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Residential Corridor","descriptions":["A plush ivory wool carpet woven with a pale blue lattice and edged with golden roses runs the length of the corridor.  Fluted alabaster pedestals stand beside each doorway, bearing porcelain jars filled with fragrant k'dira leaves and dried lemon blossoms."],"exits":[{"to":447,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":445,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":447,"x":490,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Residential Corridor","descriptions":["Away from the bustle of transient guests, the residential quarters of the Silver Eye display the same quiet elegance that marks the rest of the inn.  Silken hangings in pale shades of blue and gold cover the walls, providing a backdrop for still life paintings that line the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":448,"x":460,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Room of Silver Stars","descriptions":["Small silver stars are painted on the night-blue ceilings and walls.  Fine crystalline threads beaded with flecks of obsidian and onyx drift and shimmer in a slight breeze.  A large bed stands beneath a large round window.  Dark indigo silk is draped over the soft pillows, brushing gently against the ebonwood floor."],"exits":[{"to":444,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"}]},
  {"id":449,"x":470,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Room of Lilies","descriptions":["Hundreds of silk lilies are stitched into the ivory lace curtains of the room, the satin patina blanket elegantly draped over the bed, and the plush chenille hanging that lies against the wall.  White blossoms with seemingly impossibly soft petals shimmer with moisture as if freshly picked, their scent light and refreshing."],"exits":[{"to":444,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"}]},
  {"id":450,"x":480,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Sable and Wine Suite","descriptions":["A large circular feather bed stands in the center of the room.  Elegant silver sconces cusp fine ivory candles in their grasp.  Delicate crystal roses rest in bejewelled arrangements, neatly placed in porcelain vases."],"exits":[{"to":443,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}]},
  {"id":451,"x":460,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Silver Eye, Winter Suite","descriptions":["Thick white velvet blankets cover a large pile of pillows in the center of the room.  Elegant etchings of translucent ice fairies whirl in a frenzied dance around the stark walls of the room.  Delicate crystal snowflakes hang suspended from the ceiling on delicate silver chains.","Thick white velvet blankets cover a large pile of pillows in the center of the room.  Elegant etchings of translucent ice fairies whirl in a frenzied dance around the stark walls of the room. Delicate crystal snowflakes hang suspended from the ceiling on delicate silver chains."],"exits":[{"to":443,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}],"aliases":["Winter Suite"]},
  {"id":452,"x":460,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Zerek's General Store","descriptions":["Freshly varnished wooden walls and impeccably swept floors attest to a measure of careful observance to the custom of tidiness by Zerek and his staff.  Shelves on the walls hold various sundries necessary for the survival of travellers and city-dwellers alike, and the open windows supply plenty of light to see by."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Zerek's General Store","General"]},
  {"id":453,"x":460,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Meiria's Gems and Jewelry, Fatimi the Dealer's Backroom","descriptions":["Sparsely furnitured by two chairs in which Fatimi's son Veilex the gemcutter entertains those who come selling gems, there is a sense of opulent antiquity here.  Sipping tea and looking a little ghostly in the oil lamp light, Veilex smiles with suave assurance at the local gold-diggers and adventurers who arrive to haggle with him.  A door in the west wall leads into the jewelry store proper, now closed for the evening.","Sparsely furnitured by two chairs in which Meiria's partner, the Elven gemcutter Fatimi, entertains those who would sell her gems, there is a sense of opulent antiquity here.  The tireless Lady Fatimi waits from her seat as the local gold-diggers and adventurers arrive with their finds to sell.  A painted white door in the west wall leads into the jewelry store proper."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Fatimi the Dealer's Backroom","Meiria's Gems and Jewelry","Veilex","gems"]},
  {"id":454,"x":480,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Quentin's Healerium","descriptions":["Loose boards of white-washed wood and a collection of dingy tapestries that reek of dust and mold compose this small, windowless hovel.  Oddly, there is little detectable tell-tale scent of blood, although the walls are splashed liberally with bright red splotches.  A single oil lamp hangs overhead, and the only other light source is the open door leading out."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Healer","Quentin"]},
  {"id":455,"x":380,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Salon, Entryway","descriptions":["Thick blue carpet covers the floor of the entryway, a strip of rich purple down the center to accent it.  Painted murals cover the walls, alive with vibrant hues that pull at the eyes.  The faint sound of talking and laughter echoes down the corridor that leads into the parlor, where the upper class of Shard gather to chat and dine."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":456,"exit":"go","move":"go long corridor"}],"aliases":["Lady Atladene's Salon"]},
  {"id":456,"x":380,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Salon, Parlor","descriptions":["Paintings of famous heroes hang upon the walls of the salon's expansive parlor.  Young Elven men and women move silently amongst the patrons, replenishing glasses and taking orders.  Crystal and gold lamps filled with azure oil offer illumination, and a wide hearth provides warmth in the bitterest of weather.  Music floats in from behind a rosewood screen in the northeast corner, and a private booth off to one side allows for more intimate discussion."],"exits":[{"to":457,"exit":"go","move":"go garden door"},{"to":461,"exit":"go","move":"go booth"},{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go corridor"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":457,"x":380,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Garden, Roses","descriptions":["Rose bushes seem to be the Lady's favorite choice, judging by their prominence in the garden.  Blooms of all colors -- from the brilliant white, to the blushing pink and violet, to the rare black -- flourish in neatly manicured rows.  A soft carpet of grass rolls over the ground, clipped to a seemly inch and a half.  A small path meanders off to a flowery glade, and a stone-inlaid walkway leads to the Salon's pool.  A beveled glass door allows entry back into the house.","The scents of the roses of the daytime have been replaced by that of the night-blooming jasmine and midnight glories.  A faint trace of dew sparkles in the grass like a Fae's strewn diamonds, the delicately crafted jewels dissolving at the merest touch of mortal hands.  A small path meanders off to a flowery glade, and a stone-inlaid walkway leads to the Salon's pool.  A beveled glass door allows entry back into the house."],"exits":[{"to":458,"exit":"go","move":"go small path"},{"to":459,"exit":"go","move":"go stone walkway"},{"to":456,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"aliases":["Roses"]},
  {"id":458,"x":370,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Garden, Healer's Glade","descriptions":["Ringed by succulent bushes dotted with flowers kept blooming by the gentle ministrations of skilled lifesculptors, the personal glade of Lady Atladene is canopied by twining ivy and interwoven leaves of the tall birch and willow trees that grow here.  The Lady herself sits at the center of the glade, waiting for the wounded with the patience of Death.","Ringed by succulent bushes dotted with flowers kept blooming by the gentle ministrations of skilled lifesculptors, the personal glade of Lady Atladene is canopied by twining ivy and interwoven leaves of the tall birch and willow trees that grow here.  The Lady herself sits at the center of the glade, waiting for the wounded with tireless patience."],"exits":[{"to":457,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Premium Healer","Atladene's Garden"]},
  {"id":459,"x":390,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Garden, Poolside","descriptions":["Green grass grows at the edge of the natural pool that lies on the west side of Lady Atladene's home.  Ripples disturb the surface as hummingbirds and larks skim the surface, sipping up the cool liquid to quench throats dry from singing.  The laughter of swimmers and the splash of water flashes through the air, the reportedly therapeutic spring warm throughout all seasons.","The scents of the roses of the daytime have been replaced by that of the night-blooming jasmine and midnight glories.  A faint trace of dew sparkles in the grass like a Fae's strewn diamonds, the delicately crafted jewels dissolving at the merest touch of mortal hands.  A small path meanders off to a flowery glade, and a stone-inlaid walkway leads to the Salon's pool.  A beveled glass door allows entry back into the house.","Green grass grows at the edge of the natural pool that lies on the west side of Lady Atladene's home.  Ripples disturb the surface as nightingales skim the surface, sipping up the cool liquid to quench throats dry from singing.  Glowing starflowers bob upon the water's surface, offering up warm golden, pink, and blue light for those whose swimming preference tends toward the nocturnal."],"exits":[{"to":460,"exit":"go","move":"go pool"},{"to":457,"exit":"go","move":"go stone walkway"}]},
  {"id":460,"x":400,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Garden, Pool","descriptions":["A wellspring of warm water ripples up from the center of the pool, lacing the air with just the faintest hint of sulfur.  Soft golden sand covers the bottom, paintings of shells and seahorses decorating the sides.  A shelf runs the rim of the pool, for those who wish to sit and relax in the therapeutic waters."],"exits":[{"to":459,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Pool"]},
  {"id":461,"x":390,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Lady Atladene's Salon, Private Booth","descriptions":["Secluded and just slightly gloomy, the booth is lit by a single lamp that sits in the center of the table.  The sweet scent of honeysuckle is complimented by the sharper aroma of sandalwood to wreathe the air with the memory of pressed flowers and woods.  The padded backs and seats of the benches offer respite for those who have found the journey of life a wearying one."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":462,"x":280,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Front Desk","descriptions":["Two brass lamps topped with stained glass shades rest on a carved rosewood check-in desk where a supercilious-looking clerk watches the lobby.  The walls are covered with gold damask, tasseled silk cords hold velvet drapes away from leaded windows and wing chairs upholstered with figured satin sit around a low carved table.  A plaster molding relief of intertwined flowers and leaves decorates the ceiling and wool runner carpets protect the polished wood floor.  A heavy oak door leads out to the street.","Candlelight filtering through stained glass lampshades washes the ceiling's plaster molding with soft hues.  The desk clerk stands behind a carved rosewood check-in desk, watching the activity in the lobby with a haughty gaze.  The walls are covered with gold damask, tasseled silk cords pull heavy velvet drapes away from the windows, and figured satin wing chairs sit around a low table.  Woven wool runner carpets protect the polished wood floor.  A heavy oak door leads out to the street."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood archway"},{"to":84,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}],"aliases":["Golden Phoenix"]},
  {"id":463,"x":280,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Tavern Room","descriptions":["The sharp scent of spices overlays the yeast of baking bread and the savor of roasting meats.  Sunlight sparkles off cut-glass decanters and gleaming china on immaculate linen tablecloths. Pale yellow rosebuds in crystal vases are placed on each table along with a leather-bound menu, and gold flatware place settings are meticulously laid out, ready for the guest's dining pleasure.  Booths nestled against the walls allow for privacy, or guests can choose to sit at a table.","The sharp scent of spices overlays the yeast of baking bread and the savor of roasting meats.  Candlelight sparkles off cut-glass decanters and gleaming china on immaculate linen tablecloths.  Pale yellow rosebuds in crystal vases are placed on each table along with a leather-bound menu, gold flatware place settings are meticulously laid out, ready for the guest's dining pleasure.  Booths nestled against the walls allow for privacy, or guests can choose to sit at a table."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":465,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":462,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood archway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":464,"x":280,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Bar","descriptions":["A massive rosewood bar runs the length of one wall, its surface polished to a high gloss.  Behind the bar are rows of glasses, bottles and decanters stacked on shelves within easy reach of the bartender.  Tables dot the room, ample space is left between them to allow for privacy.  A young couple dances as a bard sitting on a small platform plucks a spritely tune from his mandolin.","Faint whispers and the sound of clinking glasses circulate through the room.  The bartender gazes impassively at each person entering, allowing a slight smile for repeat customers and a nod for new faces.  The dim candlelight from the center of each table casts a soft glow, making this a favorite place for couples looking for a romantic spot for a nightcap before retiring for the evening.  A bard sits on a small platform coaxing a slow, sultry melody from his lute."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":465,"x":290,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Corridor","descriptions":["Delphiniums mixed with green fern fill a glazed blue urn sitting upon a metal stand, and the walls are covered with azure and gold striped paper topped with gilded moulding.  Brass rods hold the runner carpet covering the stairs in place and the aroma of lemony beeswax polish lingers about the rosewood bannister."],"exits":[{"to":466,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":463,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":467,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":466,"x":300,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Trophy Room","descriptions":["Brass candle sconces vie for space with dozens of antlers, some still attached to the hunted's head, on the paneled walls.  Centered between the two largest trophies is a portrait of an Elothean man, while the opposite wall is decorated with a tapestry depicting a boar hunt.  Two overstuffed sofas face each other across a low table set with a decanter and brandy snifters, ready for afterdinner conversation."],"exits":[{"to":465,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":669,"exit":"go","move":"go panel door"}],"aliases":["Trophy Room"]},
  {"id":467,"x":300,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Hallway","descriptions":["The upper hallway is decorated with the same azure and gold striped paper and gilded moulding as in the lower corridor.  A glass frame holding a colorful pressed flower arrangement hangs opposite a marble statue atop a metal stand."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":471,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"},{"to":472,"exit":"go","move":"go marquetry door"},{"to":465,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":465,"exit":"go","move":"go bannister"}]},
  {"id":468,"x":300,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Hallway","descriptions":["The azure and gold striped paper and gilded moulding continues throughout the hallway.  A mirror held by a gilded metal frame embellished with sculpted roses hangs on the wall at the end of the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":467,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":469,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"},{"to":470,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}]},
  {"id":469,"x":290,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Phoenix Suite","descriptions":["A mosaic of a phoenix above the mantle gives an illusion of the creature rising from the flames of the fireplace.  Tapestries hang on the dark wood paneled walls, scarlet satin clothes the bed and pillows, and heavy ecru lace curtains adorn the windows.  A chess table, its figures carved of red and black marble, sits on a black laquered table."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"}],"aliases":["Phoenix Suite"]},
  {"id":470,"x":310,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Gryphon Suite","descriptions":["A colorful hand-painted silk screen depicting battling gryphons stands to one side of a dark green lacquered wardrobe.  An inlaid writing desk holding a white quill pen and sheets of parchment neatly stacked on the blotter sits near the window.  A pale green bolster within a crocheted case rests on the polished cotton comforter covering the bed, and a lace dust ruffle cascades from under the bedclothes to brush the floor."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}],"aliases":["Gryphon Suite"]},
  {"id":471,"x":290,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Pegasus Suite","descriptions":["White silk curtains held apart by gold cord hang at the windows and the pure white fur of some polar animal carpets the floor in front of the fireplace.  The walls are covered in pale blue silk, a mural depicting a winged horse charging through the clouds is painted on the ceiling.  A large brass-posted bed topped by a canopy of sheer white fabric dominates the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":467,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}],"aliases":["Pegasus Suite"]},
  {"id":472,"x":310,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Roc Suite","descriptions":["Deep blues pervade the room, casting shadows even in daylight.  Several ancient leather-bound volumes sit in a tall, glass-doored bookcase resting against one wall.  A large statue of a roc fills one corner of the room, a low bed shaped like a sleigh occupies the corner opposite the sculpture."],"exits":[{"to":467,"exit":"go","move":"go marquetry door"}],"aliases":["Roc Suite"]},
  {"id":473,"x":140,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Lobby","descriptions":["The ceiling here is raised three stories high with a bronzed statue of an Elothean female in the center of the room.  As they move across the rust-colored tiles, the visitors' footfalls and voices echo sharply off the elaborate cornices.  A listings board on the far wall has an ornate gilded frame."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":474,"exit":"go","move":"go solid door"},{"to":80,"exit":"go","move":"go marble entrance"},{"to":809,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}],"aliases":["Crystal Plaza","Plaza","Market","listings board","board"]},
  {"id":474,"x":130,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Office","descriptions":["Gleaming brass stanchions with velvet-lined ropes stretch across the carpeted room inside the doorway.  Traders and vendors wait quietly in line to be called to the long counter with four clerks waiting behind it.  Occasionally, an awaiting party is directed behind to one of the desks where they sit to discuss more intensive business."],"exits":[{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go solid door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Office","Bounty","Assassins"]},
  {"id":475,"x":140,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Rotunda","descriptions":["This imposing circular room is the hub of the Crystal Plaza.  Arches in all directions stand between fluted pilasters on curved sandstone walls.  A sculpted relief of the province of Ilithi spans the dome of brass.  The golden marble floor gleams and is free of any furniture or carpet to distract from the room's beauty."],"exits":[{"to":479,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":480,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":481,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":482,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":473,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":476,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":477,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":478,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Rotunda"]},
  {"id":476,"x":130,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Storage","descriptions":["Though piled high from floor to ceiling against each wall, boxes are stored in a neat fashion.  Large stenciled numbers and letters on each give a sense of organization even if the meaning of each is not evident.  A push cart with chains sits waiting in the middle of the room, probably used in the transfer of the stored wares."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Storage"]},
  {"id":477,"x":130,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Food Court","descriptions":["Three low walls around each table and chairs provide the semblance of privacy.  Shoppers and tradesmen carry on conversations and business deals while partaking of the food and drink set out on the carts along the wall.  A solemn Elothean man keeps a careful eye on the staff that moves quietly around the room, preventing any from sneaking into the nearby shops."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Food Court"]},
  {"id":478,"x":130,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, The Sea","descriptions":["A mural spans the room on all four walls.  Starting from the northern vantage point, a bustling seaport on a bright sunny day leads to a starlit night and a solitary frigate with billowing white sails.  Turning from east to south, a stylized cloud angrily blows, causing swells and massive waves curling around a clipper ship.  On the western wall, a tropical beach, resplendent with palms and bright pink crabs, is deserted but for a single slanted piece of mast stuck in the sand with a tattered black flag."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Sea"]},
  {"id":479,"x":140,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Play Yard","descriptions":["Brightly painted plaster mushrooms and toadstools provide wide stepping stones around the room.  Straw piled high around the odd playthings creates a safe place to fall if any adventurous child loses his or her step.  Small animals and fanciful fae are the perfect handholds for vaulting onto the fungi.  A path of pink and blue bricks meanders through, with smaller routes leading to the entrances of the shops."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Play Yard"]},
  {"id":480,"x":150,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Prism Room","descriptions":["Crystals of varied shapes and sizes hang from the ceiling on silver wires cut to different lengths.  A light draft from channels cut at the top of the walls makes the prisms slowly twist and turn to spray the walls with color.  Runners branching off a center aisle lead to the entrances of each shop."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Prism Room"]},
  {"id":481,"x":150,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Oak Room","descriptions":["Potted palms and ferns in terracotta urns have been arranged in circle around a towering oak that rises through the ceiling in the center of the room.  Curved marble benches ring the flora, providing a place for harried husbands or tired shoppers to rest.  The seating also secures a vantage point for watching who is going in and out of the entries to the various shops."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Oak Room"]},
  {"id":482,"x":150,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Luminous Room","descriptions":["Exquisite crystal glasses and bowls are showcased in niches along both long walls of the room.  A central chandelier provides light that reflects off the glistening decorations.  Shoppers travel leisurely in and out of the entrances to the privately-owned shops."],"exits":[{"to":475,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Luminous Room"]},
  {"id":483,"x":100,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Seats of Plenty","descriptions":["Petriciu's shop is an odd affair.  The walls, floor and ceiling are fashioned from thick slabs of opaque rock crystal which glow with a faint luminosity, reflecting brisk darts of light off the various enormous chairs he offers for sale.  He seems to work almost exclusively in precious materials, and his handiwork is arranged around the room almost as museum pieces, such is the pride he takes in his craft."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Seats of Plenty","Petriciu"]},
  {"id":484,"x":100,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Trader's Mercantile","descriptions":["Wall-length mirrors form an open, triangular trade hall, creating the illusion that the area is twice the size that it actually is.  Light from the heavy brass chandelier hanging in the center of the painted ceiling illuminates a collection of fabric-covered tables provided for traders to display their wares.  An ornate doorway leads back out to Moonstone Street, open regardless of the time of day."],"exits":[{"to":485,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":486,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":79,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mercantile","Tables"]},
  {"id":485,"x":110,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Trader's Mercantile","descriptions":["Wall-length mirrors form an open, triangular trade hall, creating the illusion that the area is twice the size that it actually is.  Light from the heavy brass chandelier hanging in the center of the painted ceiling illuminates a collection of fabric-covered tables provided for traders to display their wares."],"exits":[{"to":484,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":486,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":486,"x":90,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Trader's Mercantile","descriptions":["Wall-length mirrors form an open, triangular trade hall, creating the illusion that the area is twice the size that it actually is.  Light from the heavy brass chandelier hanging in the center of the painted ceiling illuminates a collection of fabric-covered tables provided for traders to display their wares."],"exits":[{"to":485,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":484,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":487,"x":60,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"A Grand Entrance","descriptions":["Samples of beautifully-constructed doors in the most fashionable and costly styles stand in neat rows around the walls of this smart shop, each flawless piece a worthy tribute to its maker's skill.  A haughty salesman wanders around the store, pausing occasionally to run a manicured hand over the gleaming entrances on display."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":573,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Grand Entrance"]},
  {"id":488,"x":120,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["The entrance hall of Stormwill, unlike most other towers in Shard, is very plain and unassuming, function being more important than form to the two Guilds based here.  Twin arches, on opposite sides of the hall, lead east to the Empath's Guild and west to the Infirmary.  A dark stone staircase curves sinuously into the darkness overhead, leading to the areas of the Tower devoted to the Warrior Mage Guild."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":489,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":46,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":494,"exit":"go","move":"go granite steps"},{"to":555,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone stair"}],"aliases":["Stormwill Tower"]},
  {"id":489,"x":110,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Infirmary","descriptions":["The Infirmary has been set up by the Empath's Guild as a courtesy to the citizens of Shard too poor to afford the services of the Hospital attendants.  Staffed by some of the Guild's most gifted members, the room is filled with cabinets and drawers holding items most necessary to tending the wounded.  A large plaque is set over the archway leading to the entrance hall, its bright gold sheen the most noticeable spot of color in the otherwise drab room."],"exits":[{"to":488,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":615,"exit":"go","move":"go modwir door"}],"aliases":["Infirmary"]},
  {"id":490,"x":130,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Empath Guild","descriptions":["The Guildmaster's office is decorated in soothing greens and blues, with splashes of gold here and there to add color.  A lush white rug covers the stone floor to muffle the echoes caused by the stream of Empaths rushing in to speak with their leader, who sits behind a large mahogany desk covered in ledgers and invoices.  Hung on a rod near the stone fireplace is a kettle of lemonroot tea, the Guildmaster's favorite drink."],"exits":[{"to":491,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":492,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":488,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Empath","K'miriel Lystrandoniel","RS Empath"]},
  {"id":491,"x":140,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Empath Guild, Library","descriptions":["Unlike most other libraries, this room contains much more than simple books and scrolls, although those can also be found on the shelf on the northern wall.  Charts and diagrams hang from every inch of the wall, and lie strewn upon the tables as well, detailing the skeletal and muscular systems of the various Elanthian races.  A large glass display case bears a to-scale replica of the S'Kra pelvis and tail bones, to help illustrate their fragility."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":492,"x":140,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Empath's Guild, Waiting Room","descriptions":["Chairs line the perimeter of the room, but there is nothing to do here but wait and endure."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":493,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"aliases":["Waiting Room"]},
  {"id":493,"x":150,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Empath's Guild, Examining Room","descriptions":["This room is one of the many set aside for triage and severe trauma arrivals.  In a corner, a Paladin is gallantly trying not to cry as she keeps her arm attached to her shoulder with the help of a comrade's steady hand, and the soft crying of a father holding the battered body of his moaning son plays grim music in the background.  Healers rush about anxiously, sorting out the critical from the mortally wounded, and hastily pulling sheets over those who only Urrem'tier's hand could cure."],"exits":[{"to":492,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Stamina"]},
  {"id":494,"x":120,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Basement Tunnel","descriptions":["Sputtering torches set in tarnished copper sconces produce the stale smoke that fills this dank tunnel with a bluish haze.  The walls to either side, smeared a light shade of grey where an unfortunate apprentice has spent many an hour scrubbing, are stained a dark, smokey black across the bulk of their surfaces.  Some worn granite steps lead up to the Guild proper."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":488,"exit":"go","move":"go granite steps"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":495,"x":110,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Basement Tunnel","descriptions":["The tunnel walls, cleaner here than the smoke-stained granite to the east, are carved with runes representing the various elemental forces controlled by members of the Warrior Mage profession.  Small metal doors, each the entrance to a mage's cell, line the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":494,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":496,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":496,"x":100,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Basement Tunnel","descriptions":["The basement tunnel ends here at the base of an ornate, wrought-iron staircase which lead upward into a second, narrower tower hidden behind the Warrior Mage guildhall.  The stairs fade from view as they spiral into the heights above."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":497,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ornate staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":497,"x":90,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Shadows, Earthen Gallery","descriptions":["The walls of this room are constructed of packed earth.  Evenly-spaced doors, each the living quarters of one of the Guild's members, stare unblinkingly at the staircase that spirals down into the floor."],"exits":[{"to":498,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":496,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ornate staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Earthen Gallery"]},
  {"id":498,"x":90,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Shadows, Water Gallery","descriptions":["Stone fountains shrouded in mist burble merrily in this cool, damp gallery.  The roiling mists dance off the nearby cell doors, casting rainbow patterns across their bare, spartan surfaces."],"exits":[{"to":499,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":497,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Water Gallery"]},
  {"id":499,"x":80,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Shadows, Aether Gallery","descriptions":["The walls and floor of this dark, circular room seem almost insubstantial, their shadowy forms wavering from view and then reappearing in a slow, rhythmic swirl.  Even the doors set into the walls sometimes shimmer and nearly disappear before coalescing again."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":498,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Aether Gallery"]},
  {"id":500,"x":80,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Shadows, Fire Gallery","descriptions":["Walls of illusory flame encircle the gallery with a nearly blinding light.  Images dance among the flickering tongues of fire in kaleidoscopic patterns, their flames a riot of color but emitting no heat."],"exits":[{"to":501,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":499,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Fire Gallery"]},
  {"id":501,"x":70,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Shadows, Air Gallery","descriptions":["An open arch looks onto the roiling storm above Stormwill Tower.  A skylight of etched crystal provides wan light in counterpoint to the darkness of the tempest outside.  Flashes of lightning and gusts of wind batter the tower as if to hurl it from the skies."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Air Gallery"]},
  {"id":502,"x":720,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Courtyard","descriptions":["The gleaming white stone walls that surround Brickwell Tower rise high around the cobblestoned courtyard, blocking out all sounds of the city beyond save those that filter through the wrought-iron portcullis.  The Tower itself is dominated by two massive white ironwood doors that stand slightly ajar.  The cobblestones of the courtyard are scrubbed clean every day by a horde of servants employed for that purpose alone."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":503,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"},{"to":504,"exit":"go","move":"go inlaid arch"}]},
  {"id":503,"x":710,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Dispatch","descriptions":["The vast dispatch chamber is filled with frantic activity as caravan after caravan is quickly assembled and led out a pair of massive white ironwood doors, accompanied by the howls and complaints of those who feel they should have been first.  A shipping clerk is huddled at a desk piled with a mountain of invoices, trying to keep warm as all the heat from the room is sucked out of the opening between the doors."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":502,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"}],"aliases":["Shipment Clerk"]},
  {"id":504,"x":720,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["The grand entrance hall of the Trader's Guild is tastefully decorated in silk rugs and tapestries created by the finest Elven weavers in the province.  Twin columns, carved with images of sailing ships riding the crest of a wave, rise from the marble tiled floor.  A white marble staircase which leads to the upper levels of the tower is hung with the standards of trading companies based in the city of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":509,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":505,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":503,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":502,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":506,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"},{"to":507,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":508,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"},{"to":510,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}],"aliases":["Brickwell Tower","Trader"]},
  {"id":505,"x":730,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, The Pit","descriptions":["The chamber devoted to commodities trading is a hornet's nest of activity.  Expensive tapestries and marble balustrades go completely unnoticed by those intent on wringing the greatest profit from their ventures.  A long bench is set against the back wall for those Traders too aged to stand for great lengths of time."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":506,"x":710,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Provincial Broker","descriptions":["A no-nonsense businesswoman, the Provincial Broker's office is severely plain, its walls unadorned and its stone floor uncovered.  In fact, the only item in the room, other than the broker herself, is a large white ironwood desk."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Broker"]},
  {"id":507,"x":730,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Trade Minister","descriptions":["The trade minister's room, from the thick wall hangings to the elaborately carved desk, is decorated in shades of night.  Even the stone floors have been darkened to a nearly black color, although it is impossible to tell if that was intentional, or merely the result of hundreds of Traders tramping through the door to receive their latest contract."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Trade Minister"]},
  {"id":508,"x":730,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Guildmaster's Office","descriptions":["Rich forest-green velvet draperies are pulled back to frame a woven tapestry on the teak paneled wall.  Etched-glass lanterns hang from wrought iron hooks in each corner of the room.  A large teak desk dominates the chamber, with a matching high-back chair the only seating provided.  A battered hunter's bow hanging from a small shelf on the far wall is the only incongruous note in the decor."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Trader","Cialen","RS Trader"]},
  {"id":509,"x":720,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Sales Returns","descriptions":["This small, cramped room is warm all season round due to the press of bodies that fill it.  A few traders in the back handle the complaints that enter here in a neverending stream, their weary faces fixed with happy smiles.  You can feel a twinge of sympathy for the poor souls who handle all that the unhappy world of customer service has to dish out, and marvel at the patience with which the clerks handle their situation."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Charisma"]},
  {"id":510,"x":710,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Stairwell, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["The landing is carpeted in deep royal blue rugs.  A small silverwood stand rests in the middle of the landing, bearing a china vase filled with Kertigen's Treasure roses.  To the west, a row of ebonwood doors provide private chambers for those Traders who cannot afford the prices of staying at an inn.  Light from the open door of the Crystal Sparrow fills the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":511,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"},{"to":515,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":733,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal sparrow"}],"aliases":["Warrior Mage"]},
  {"id":511,"x":710,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Stairwell, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["The third floor landing is decorated in tasteful shades of green, from the forest carpeting to the sea-foam paneling on the walls.  A small white oak stand, inlaid with gold seashells, bears a crystal vase filled with Eluned's Tears."],"exits":[{"to":512,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":510,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":513,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"},{"to":514,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":512,"x":720,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Lounge","descriptions":["The guild lounge, the walls paneled in cherrywood and the floors covered by a thick red carpet, is a place for guildmembers to relax and talk away from the driving concerns of profit.  Dominated by a huge oak bookcase, the room is filled with an air of calm relaxation, reinforced by the flickering light from the marble fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":513,"x":700,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Watersong Suite","descriptions":["A cunning network of pipes runs along the ceiling of the room, carefully hidden behind the same blue silk draping that covers the walls and the surface of the large four-poster bed in the center of the room.  As water runs through the pipes, they vibrate with a low hum.  Each pipe has a different tone, creating a virtual symphony of glorious song."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"}]},
  {"id":514,"x":710,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Stargazer's Loft","descriptions":["A large glass dome surrounds the top of Brickwell tower, providing privacy for those who wish to be alone to gaze at the glory of the heavens above.  A large black stone fireplace rests at one end of the loft, filling the room with warmth.  Covered in black silk sheets sprinkled with bits of silver, a large bed rests near the fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":515,"x":700,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, Rosemist Suite","descriptions":["Covered in thick silver-grey carpet, the floor of the Rosemist Suite feels like the fantasy of walking on a cloud.  Vases filled with the rare variety of Watermist roses, those that grow only at the base of waterfalls, are scattered about the room, filling the suite with their gentle fragrance.  A large bed covered in grey silk sheets rests in the center of the room, its surface strewn with blushing pink rose petals."],"exits":[{"to":510,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}]},
  {"id":516,"x":1000,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Courtyard North","descriptions":["A softly glowing light filters in from the east, while deep shadows blot out the view to the west.  The delicately sweet perfume of night-blooming flowers and the gentle splash of fountains weaves its way through the air, harmonious and soothing.  A set of crystal globes filled with a luminescent mist illuminates the sweeping marble archway to the north leading back to Diamond Street.  The base of the Great Tower dominates the view to the south, its main entrance eternally open.","The musical splash of a fountain echoes through the courtyard from the east and west, while the perfume of constantly upkept plants and flowering vines floating with the sound through the air.  A sweeping marble archway to the north leads back to Diamond Street.  The base of the Great Tower dominates the view to the south, its main entrance eternally open."],"exits":[{"to":523,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":517,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":524,"exit":"go","move":"go main entrance"},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":"go marble archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":517,"x":980,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Garden of Shadows","descriptions":["Thorny black rose bushes and flowering purple lilacs decorate this dense and shadowy garden.  Only a good set of hedge clippers and a careful gardener have kept the path from becoming overgrown.  The only brightness in the dark foliage is the single cherry tree, dropping white petals like snowflakes."],"exits":[{"to":516,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":518,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Garden of Shadows"]},
  {"id":518,"x":940,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Courtyard West","descriptions":["Small blue pebbles have been embedded in the path that leads north and south around the Great Tower and west through a glittering crystal archway leading to Moonstone Street.  Closer examination reveals that tiny black moon-shaped carvings have been captured in the glass of the stones, floating amidst a sea of hard sapphire."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":519,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":519,"x":980,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Garden of Serenity","descriptions":["Several feet of ground have been cordoned off and covered with carefully raked sand in this part of the courtyard.  Torches on wrought iron poles light the rocks that have apparently been placed randomly on the sand.  Stone benches around the arrangement allow it to be viewed from a variety of angles.  A guard stands watch over the garden.","Several feet of ground have been cordoned off and covered with carefully raked sand in this part of the courtyard.  Rocks have apparently been placed randomly on the sand, and benches have been set about the area.  A guard stands watch over the garden, assuring that no one tampers with its arrangement."],"exits":[{"to":520,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":518,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Garden of Serenity"]},
  {"id":520,"x":1000,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Courtyard South","descriptions":["The softly gleaming silver Great Tower eats up most of the ground of this darkened cobbled courtyard.  Twin globes of crystal illuminate the south entrance to the Great Tower, catching on the armor of the tower's guards.  A thicket of trees can be glimpsed to the east, and a curious rock formation silhouette catches the eye to the west.","The gleaming silver Great Tower eats up most of the ground of this small, cobbled courtyard.  Guards flank the south entrance to the Great Tower, their plate gleaming and their shields at the ready.  A thicket of trees can be glimpsed to the east, and a curious formation of rocks catches the eye to the west."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":519,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":524,"exit":"go","move":"go south entrance"},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":"go granite archway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":521,"x":1020,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Kukalakai's Grove","descriptions":["Shadows have dimmed the silvery beauty of the precious ban-minahle trees that grow here, softening the metallic sheen on the leaves to a moonlit glow.  Tiny lights flicker through the air, vanishing and reappearing as they dart beneath the leaves, just barely illuminating the presence of a narrow tunnel leading through the trees to a dim glade.","A thicket of precious ban-minahle trees grow in a small and well-groomed clump here, their silvery, lirum coin-sized leaves shimmering in a lakeside breeze that causes them to make a soft fluttering sound reminescent to chimes.  A rich carpet of emerald green grass pads the ground, and a narrow tunnel leads through the trees into a dim glade."],"exits":[{"to":522,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":520,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":547,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow tunnel"}],"aliases":["Kukalakai's Grove"]},
  {"id":522,"x":1060,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Courtyard East","descriptions":["Squares of limestone the color of pale lapis lazuli split into a path that leads northward toward the sound of a fountain and southward to a stand of dark trees.  A gentle perfumed breeze wafts from north to south, surrounding the graceful ash arch that leads into this section of the courtyard of the Great Tower.","Big, showy white flowers bloom on the dark green camellia bushes at the base of the tower, fronted by a narrow carpet of brightly striped coleus.  A flagstone path through the flower beds leads south to a stand of dark trees and north from where the sound of splashing water can be heard.","Yellow daffodils and purple crocuses bloom in front of dark green camellia bushes at the base of the tower.  A flagstone path through the flower beds leads south to a stand of dark trees and north from where the sound of splashing water can be heard."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":523,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":57,"exit":"go","move":"go ash arch","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":523,"x":1020,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Garden of Lights","descriptions":["Rings of vibrant colors glow from the bottom of the water-filled pool that lies just off the path winding through this sedate garden.  The light illuminates the trunks and boughs of the half-circle of weeping silverwillows that rings the pool and glances off the thick, glossy leaves of the ivy that climbs over the walls and grounds.","A circular pool ringed partially with weeping silverwillows lies just off the path that winds through this sedate garden of honeysuckle, succulent ivy, and morning glories.  Water shoots up out of the center of the pool, falling down in a fan of droplets that sparkle in the light.  The lights for which this garden was named do not actually become apparent until after dark."],"exits":[{"to":522,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":516,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"go gazebo"}],"aliases":["Garden of Lights"]},
  {"id":524,"x":1000,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Entryway","descriptions":["Walls of gleaming white marble sweep like seagull's wings in a wide, massive circle.  A tile mosaic of dark material is embedded in the floor, the type of substance that releases a most satisfying *click* when walked across wearing metal-shod boots.  A short passage leads east, and there is a narrow corridor northwest.  Gleaming mahogany doors lead west, and a spiral stairway allows access to other levels."],"exits":[{"to":516,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":520,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":525,"exit":"go","move":"go short passage"},{"to":526,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany doors"},{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go corridor"},{"to":529,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down"},{"to":531,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up"},{"to":548,"exit":"go","move":"go office entrance"}],"aliases":["Great Tower"]},
  {"id":525,"x":1010,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Debt Collector's Office","descriptions":["Dimly lit by a tiny crystal globe on a polished oak desk, this office is neat and tidy by nature of necessity -- the necessity in this case being the room's small size.  A locked box has been bolted into the ground next to the desk, an effort to keep the honest workers here honest.  Though no vents or open windows can be detected in any of the convex walls, there is a fresh breeze drifting through the air, flushing out the stale scent of money."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Debt"]},
  {"id":526,"x":990,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Chamber of Voices","descriptions":["This room is a touch chilly despite the red carpet that has been laid down on the floor.  Aisles of polished wooden benches allow for around seventy Human adults to sit in comfortably.  A raised dais occupies the rear of the room, an ornate podium rising up in front of it."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":527,"x":1010,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Sentinel's Office","descriptions":["Three gleaming desks create an open-ended rectangle here, one for each of the patrol leaders of Shard.  A glass display case holds the names of the criminals foolish enough to have attracted the attention of the elite watchmen of the city.  A painting of the Ferdahl hangs over the doorway, some words written in gold ink beneath her face on the frame."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go short hallway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Sentinel's Office","Justice Office"]},
  {"id":528,"x":1010,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Chamber of Justice","descriptions":["Banners representing every Elothean house hang from the ceiling, and one massive one of the House of the Steel Dove serve as the backdrop for the justiciar's dais at the far back of the room.  No forms of seating can be seen in all the chamber, a gesture that implies one should not loiter here long."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go short hallway"}],"aliases":["Chamber of Justice"]},
  {"id":529,"x":990,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Stairwell","descriptions":["Cool and quiet, the walls of this small stairwell encourage silence and decorum.  A short passage to the south leads to the central library of Shard, the largest repository of books, scrolls and manuscripts in Ilithi."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":530,"exit":"go","move":"go short passage"}]},
  {"id":530,"x":990,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Library Cellar","descriptions":["Crystal globes have been imbedded in the ceiling, and cast a steady light for the readers who use Shard for their research.  Shelves of gleaming rosewood hold the treasures of scholars, and a lack of windows imparts the sense of timelessness that any good library conveys."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":531,"x":1060,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Stairwell","descriptions":["Cool and quiet, the walls of this small stairwell close in tightly -- a claustrophobic's nightmare.  Steps lead up to the next level and down to the main entrance.  A door on the south wall allows entry to the rest of this part of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":532,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":524,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":532,"x":1060,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Stairwell","descriptions":["Cool and quiet, the walls of this small stairwell close in tightly -- a claustrophobic's nightmare.  Steps lead up to the next level and down to the museum level.  A door on the south wall allows entry to the rest of this part of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":533,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":531,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":533,"x":1060,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Stairwell","descriptions":["Cool and quiet, the walls of this small stairwell close in tightly -- a claustrophobic's nightmare.  Steps lead up to the next level and down to the Corridor of Power.  A door on the south wall allows entry to the rest of this part of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":534,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":532,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":601,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":534,"x":1060,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Stairwell","descriptions":["Cool and quiet, the walls of this small stairwell close in tightly -- a claustrophobic's nightmare.  Steps lead up to the next level and down to the chambers of the Ferdahl."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":533,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":535,"x":1060,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Aviary Stair","descriptions":["An ivory-banistered staircase, the steps paved with black-veined marble, opens up here onto the floor of a vast aviary.  The Elanthian sky is visible through an atrium ceiling far overhead, the roof of the Great Tower set with panes of nearly invisible crystal.  Ringed by somber pillars, a wide marble walkway circumnavigates the aviary and opens up onto a number of side passages.  A golden plaque is set into the floor."],"exits":[{"to":537,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":538,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":536,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":544,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal arch"},{"to":534,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory staircase"}]},
  {"id":536,"x":1050,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Western Walkway","descriptions":["A marble walk encircles the open aviary to the east, the sounds of fluttering wings and musical bird-calls warbling through the humid air.  A tall archway opens to the northwest, and beyond it can be seen tall ironwood shelves lined with books."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":537,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":535,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":543,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":537,"x":1060,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Aviary","descriptions":["Rare and exotic plants and trees stretch up from the soft loam of the aviary, nesting-places for tropical birds imported to the guild from many lands.  They soar from tree to tree and wheel through the air beneath the crystal skylights above, their bodies hued in every color of the rainbow."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":538,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":535,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":536,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Moon Mage"]},
  {"id":538,"x":1070,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Eastern Walkway","descriptions":["This marble walkway encircles the open aviary to the west, the occasional student or elder mage quietly walking through.  An archway opens onto a short hallway to the southeast, and this walk curves around to the southwest and northwest."],"exits":[{"to":539,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":535,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":537,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":542,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":539,"x":1080,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Short Hallway","descriptions":["Barely ten feet long, this brief walk connects to the vast open chamber to the northwest, and opens onto smaller rooms to the northeast and southwest.  It ends in a sheer crystal wall, looking out over the city of Shard far below."],"exits":[{"to":541,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":540,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":538,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":540,"x":1070,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Funeral Chamber","descriptions":["Set in the center of this rounded chamber, a sarcophagus of glistening limestone has been set out beneath the skylights far above.  Its lid is made of fine crystal so its occupant can, in some fashion, continue to watch the stars.  A golden plaque is set into the floor at the sarcophagus' base."],"exits":[{"to":539,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Funeral Chamber"]},
  {"id":541,"x":1090,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Atrium","descriptions":["The skylights curve down like a canopy over this small chamber, enclosing the northeastern hemisphere in a bubble of translucent, glittering crystal.  A polished bronze telescope is here for students of the stars, but most visitors come just for the breathtaking view.  From here, one can see for miles past the towers and streets of Shard, all the way to the walls of Leth Deriel in the far distance."],"exits":[{"to":539,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Marendin","Grazhir","Ways","Astral Plane"]},
  {"id":542,"x":1060,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Northern Walkway","descriptions":["This marble walkway encircles the open aviary to the south, running around to the southwest and southeast.  To the far south you can see the staircase leading down into the Great Tower, and an open archway leads north."],"exits":[{"to":545,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":538,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":537,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":536,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":543,"x":1040,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Library","descriptions":["To protect the rare books here from the rays of the sun, a smooth marble canopy stretches over this clammy chamber.  Dark ironwood shelves stretch from floor to ceiling, their contents illuminated by softly glowing magical sconces on the walls.  Finely-carved tables and desks are scattered through the room, where scholars work dilligently at all hours."],"exits":[{"to":536,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":799,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":544,"x":1050,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Maze Entrance","descriptions":["An odd mist swirls an inch above the ground of this small, dimly lit room.  Above, an unseen lightsource creates more shadows than it illuminates, painting the room hundreds of varying shades of grey.  A dark portal, guarded by a young woman in the white robes of Meraud, is cut into the north wall and leads into the maze."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Intelligence","Maze Entrance"]},
  {"id":545,"x":1060,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Guildmaster's Chamber","descriptions":["Tropical birds nest in marble creches flanking this wide hall, sometimes fluttering through the air beneath the crystal skylights far above.  Soft harp music can faintly be heard in the air, and a gentle breeze carries the scent of pears and pineapples.  A silver dais sits at the head of the hall, a throne for the city's Moon Mage guildleader."],"exits":[{"to":542,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Moon Mage","Mortom","RS Moon Mage"]},
  {"id":546,"x":1040,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Garden of Lights, Gazebo","descriptions":["Deep shadows wrap this hexagonal-shaped gazebo, draping down from the roof in the form of bougainvillea vines.  Padded benches and a living curtain of thickly growing honeysuckle ivy that weaves a latticework of privacy completes the sense of removal from the weary world.  Soft light blooms up from time to time from the garden beyond, warm and gentle.","Light pink bougainvillea flowers wrap around this hexagonal-shaped gazebo, draping down from the roof to drop soft, papery petals to the wooden floor.  Padded benches and a living curtain of thickly growing honeysuckle ivy that weaves in with the bougainvillea vines complete the total sense of removal from the world that lies beyond this small, dim enclosure."],"exits":[{"to":523,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":547,"x":1040,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Kukalakai's Grove, Dim Glade","descriptions":["Secluded and shaded by a circle of ban-minahle trees, this is the perfect place for contemplating deep thoughts -- which may be why it was the Lady Kukalakai's favorite place to do exactly that.  Thick grass grows up around a ring of benches in the center of the glade, and the vaguest hint of honeysuckle drifts through the air.  The quiet twittering of wrens completes the sense of relaxation.  Here even the over-agitated can be content to simply be."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dim Glade"]},
  {"id":548,"x":990,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Province of Ilithi, Citizenship Office","descriptions":["Marble flooring, dark wood paneling, silk drapery and leather chairs give the office a veneer of elegance.  A cut-crystal chandelier protruding from the center of the ceiling shimmers with dangling faceted drops.  Beneath it, there is an ornately carved desk which is home to the sole visible personal item: a handsome wooden frame."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Citizenship"]},
  {"id":549,"x":1340,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Thieves' Guild","descriptions":["The sound of rough laughter and boisterous conversation echoes through a broad stone archway leading into the main guild sitting room.  Opposite the arch stands the door out into the street, flanked by a pair of bright torches.  A bored looking guard sits in a chair by the door, fiddling with his knife."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":550,"x":120,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Demiciil's Armory","descriptions":["A showcase of wood and glass runs the length of this room around the east, west, and north walls.  Gleaming helms and pieces of armor hang from the wall, rest behind the glass of the showcase, or off of hangers that are arranged all about the store.  The powerful figure of Demiciil, the shop's owner, dominates the back where he stands with arms folded across his chest, watching everyone carefully."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Demiciil's Armory","Armor"]},
  {"id":551,"x":1060,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Cleric's Guild","descriptions":["The traceried black stone floor here is inlaid with silver in the form of words.  Wooden pegs line the walls where various cloaks and clerical vestments hang in safety.  Faint incense wafts about, tickling your nose with soft fragrances.  The silver and the dark portals set into the south wall shimmer and pulsate, each giving off an odd glow."],"exits":[{"to":552,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go silver portal","hidden":true},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go dark portal","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Cleric","Sothavi","RS Cleric"]},
  {"id":552,"x":1080,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Hall of Enlightenment","descriptions":["This hall is wide, plastered stone, and roofed by an arched ceiling.  Heavy wooden beams form arches every few feet.  Clerics can be seen walking the hall, stopping every few feet to recite prayers, before moving on."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":551,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":553,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Hall of Enlightenment"]},
  {"id":553,"x":1060,"y":1020,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Library of Light and Dark","descriptions":["Books, codices and scrolls litter the dusty shelves lining the walls.  Benches and soft chairs along with stools of all heights provide engrossed readers with resting areas as they peruse their texts.  Acolytes and clerics can be seen, reading the ancient books on lore and religion."],"exits":[{"to":552,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Library of Light and Dark"]},
  {"id":554,"x":1080,"y":1040,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Hall of Solace","descriptions":["The stillness of this chamber settles like heavy fog clutching the ground.  There are no furnishings here.  The wooden floor is carved and painted with simple geometric designs.  Long narrow windows pierce the southern wall.  Near each window rests a tallow candle in a wall sconce."],"exits":[{"to":552,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":555,"x":120,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Stairwell, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["The dark stone staircase briefly halts its upward journey here at a small landing.  A brilliantly-colored green and gold patterned rug covers the stone floor of the landing, its surface slightly marred by the muddy tracks of a large cat.  A large tapestry hangs upon the wall, its surface depicting the aspects of Meraud."],"exits":[{"to":560,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":556,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":488,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":556,"x":120,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Stairwell, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["The third floor landing is devoted to the Warrior Mage's eternal companion:  his familiar.  Statues and tapestries depict the countless varieties of familiars, from lizard to dolphin and beyond.  An arch to the east leads to the familiar infirmary, where Mages can tend their companions if they become wounded in battle."],"exits":[{"to":559,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":557,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":555,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":557,"x":120,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Stairwell, Fourth Floor Landing","descriptions":["The portion of the winding staircase that led up to the rooftop has been shattered beyond repair.  All that remains are a few fragments of stone that lie scattered about the landing.  A large glass window which once filled the room with light, is now obscured by a fog or mist outside the tower."],"exits":[{"to":558,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":556,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":558,"x":110,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Barracks","descriptions":["The Guild barracks is dimly lit, the only source of light being what can filter through a large casement window on the western wall, and the mist beyond.  Rows of thinly padded cots and small chests fill the room, provided for the use of junior members of the Guild, or those too poor or avoidable to have a place of their own to stay."],"exits":[{"to":557,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":561,"exit":"go","move":"go casement window"}]},
  {"id":559,"x":130,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Infirmary","descriptions":["Since most familiars are too sensible to allow their Mage to perform major surgery on them, the small room set off the third floor landing only contains the bare necessities to prevent bleeding.  Cabinets filled with medical bandages and flat wooden boards for splints line the walls.  A large stone table, its surface lightly stained with blood, rests in the center of the room for those familiars small enough to fit upon it."],"exits":[{"to":556,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":560,"x":130,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Hall of Knowledge","descriptions":["Shaped like a hexagon, the Warrior Mage Guild's library is devoted to instructing members on the history of the Guild, as well as the arcane uses of their power.  Each of the six walls is covered in a mural inspired by one of the elements.  A stand of dark ebonwood holds many volumes of written lore, a treasure for all Mages."],"exits":[{"to":555,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Hall of Knowledge","Warrior Mage library"]},
  {"id":561,"x":110,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Cloudwalk West","descriptions":["A portion of the cloud which surrounds Stormwill has solidified into a narrow walkway that circles the tower.  The mist looks as fragile as the rest of the cloud, yet seems sturdy enough to support a Gor'Tog in full plate armor.  Leading back into the tower is a small casement window, the only way to access the cloudwalk."],"exits":[{"to":564,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":562,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":558,"exit":"go","move":"go casement window"}]},
  {"id":562,"x":120,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Cloudwalk South","descriptions":["Where the other areas of the cloudwalk are sturdy as the ground itself, portions here have begun to weaken and dissipate.  The rest of the cloud is thicker than ever, its dark mass churning and rumbling as air currents sweep through it."],"exits":[{"to":563,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":561,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":563,"x":130,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Cloudwalk East","descriptions":["The mist ledge broadens dramatically at the eastern side of the tower.  A small flight of stairs, each step made of the same mist as the ledge, leads up to the top of the tower.  The stormcloud rumbles and crackles threateningly above."],"exits":[{"to":562,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":564,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":565,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mist-woven stairs"}]},
  {"id":564,"x":120,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Stormwill Tower, Cloudwalk North","descriptions":["The narrow ledge of mist continues wrapping around the tower, barely wide enough to sidle along.  A small gap in the mist provides a bird's-eye view of the city far, far below."],"exits":[{"to":563,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":561,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":565,"x":120,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"Eye of the Storm","descriptions":["The top of Stormwill Tower, as well as its highest floor, is completely enshrouded in a massive stormcloud which never dissipates or moves from its position.  Created years ago by a half-mad mage drunk with power, the storm is now a permanent fixture of the Tower.  Each Guildmaster devotes every waking moment to keeping the storm in check, preventing it from growing large enough to destroy the city.  A small flight of stairs, shaped from the very substance of the storm, leads down to the cloudwalk."],"exits":[{"to":563,"exit":"climb","move":"climb mist-woven stairs"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Warrior Mage","Melear"]},
  {"id":566,"x":340,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Smuggler's Bridge","descriptions":["Calls from the guards above echo down to a narrow strip of sand beneath the soaring walls of Shard.  The river laps quietly at this beach, marked heavily by footprints leading right into the water.  The prints head toward a sandbar rising barely above the surface about fifty feet out."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go sandbank"}],"aliases":["Smuggler's Bridge"],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":567,"x":560,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Spires of Glory, Salesroom","descriptions":["All around are the trappings of opulence, from the crystal chandelier overhead to the plush black carpet that softens the floor.  The proprietor of this shop seems to be most interested in providing comfort for the clientele, while at the same time displaying the wares for sale in a most pleasant surrounding.  Resting in a semi-circle around the room are several divans, waiting to offer relaxation to weary shoppers."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Spires of Glory"]},
  {"id":568,"x":600,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Vaalrin House, Grand Foyer","descriptions":["Sunlight spills down into the room from the domed skylight far overhead, bathing the impressive collection of rare blooms that occupy the periphery of the foyer.  The vines of climbing plants have been allowed to entwine the elegant columns that buttress the high roof, lifting the greenery high above the marble floors.  A small artful waterfall and pond fills the space between a split marble staircase leading to the balcony above."],"exits":[{"to":569,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":570,"exit":"climb","move":"climb split stair"},{"to":52,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood doors"}],"aliases":["Vaalrin House"]},
  {"id":569,"x":610,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Vaalrin House, Duph's Taproom","descriptions":["The taproom is smoky, dimly lit by lanterns hung upon the walls, and the heavy beams that support the floor above are low enough to make a Gor'Tog duck when entering.  Still, the room is kept clean, right down to the scarred but patiently cared for hardwood floor.  Opposite the bar, a cozy fire crackles merrily in the soapstone fireplace beneath an old oil painting."],"exits":[{"to":568,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Duph's Taproom"]},
  {"id":570,"x":600,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Vaalrin House, Foyer Balcony","descriptions":["Thick red woolen rugs with interweaving patterns of blue and green cover the marble floor of the balcony all the way from the intricately wrought iron railings to the tapestries that hang against the back wall.  Busts of several notable citizens of years past perch atop alabaster pedestals along the length of the wall, flanking both sides of a wide arch."],"exits":[{"to":571,"exit":"go","move":"go paneled door"},{"to":572,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch"},{"to":568,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand stairway"}]},
  {"id":571,"x":610,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Vaalrin House, Drawing Room","descriptions":["Dominating the room is a heavy mahogany table surrounded by several high-backed chairs, placed here for smaller semi-formal gatherings.  Panels of dark wood cover the walls on one side of the room while a set of leaded glass windows framed by heavy draperies fronts the street on the other.  A large rough-cut granite fireplace next to a suit of armor at one end of the room contains a low fire to keep any chills out of the room."],"exits":[{"to":570,"exit":"go","move":"go paneled door"}]},
  {"id":572,"x":600,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Vaalrin House, Spire Ballroom","descriptions":["A gorgeous parquet dance floor stretches the entire width of the building, flanked on either side by tall windows letting in the daylight that gives the wood floor a honey-colored glow.  At the far end of the room, a long buffet table stands ready to refresh the guests of the house beneath a large gold framed painting of the great tower.  Hanging above the dance floor is a crystal and silver chandelier, dazzling the eye even though it remains unlit during the day."],"exits":[{"to":570,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":573,"x":70,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"A Flawless Facade","descriptions":["A stunning mosaic of flagstones in a variety of colors, textures and finishes lines the walls and floor of this enormous showroom.  Standing at regular intervals around the room, abstract arrangements of high-quality building materials contribute an artistic flair to the unusual but appealing decor, transforming the store into a veritable architectural art gallery."],"exits":[{"to":487,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Flawless Facade"]},
  {"id":574,"x":340,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design","descriptions":["Buckets of paint and white canvas dropcloths streaked with colorful spatters lie neatly piled in the corners of the shop, while paint brushes wrapped in paper hang drying upon the walls.  A cast iron tub in the corner is used to mix paint as workmen make ready to start a job.  In the center of the room, a sign welcomes you to Painted Ladies Design."],"exits":[{"to":576,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":577,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":578,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":579,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":580,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":581,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":582,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":575,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":101,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Painted Ladies Design"]},
  {"id":575,"x":330,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Green Room","descriptions":["Deep green ferns dangle from polished brass chains along the green sponge-painted walls.  Ruddy mahogany frames hang at evenly spaced intervals, displaying an assortment of paint styles available for sale.  In one corner, a neatly-dressed young Elven woman stands ready to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Green Room"]},
  {"id":576,"x":340,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Yellow Room","descriptions":["Light streams from ivory sconces hanging at even intervals along the sunny yellow walls.  The dark frames which display samples of the painters' work are a vivid contrast to the pastel toned plaster.  In one corner, a sprightly Elven woman stands ready to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Yellow Room"]},
  {"id":577,"x":350,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Peach Room","descriptions":["A deep green vase filled with vivid orange tropical flowers stands in the center of a polished satinwood table at the far end of the room.  The walls are a pale shade of peach, hung with mahogany frames displaying samples of the shop's work.  A young Elven woman lounges carelessly on a chair in the corner, notepad in hand as she waits to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Peach Room"]},
  {"id":578,"x":350,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Red Room","descriptions":["Soft pink walls surround a dark ebony-trimmed oak floor, giving a flattering glow to the complexion in the candlelight.  Bouquets of roses hang in vases along the wall, between framed samples of the painter's work.  In the corner, a young Elven woman sits behind a counter waiting to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Red Room"]},
  {"id":579,"x":350,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Violet Room","descriptions":["Tiny glazed clay pots filled with moss and deep violet pansies sit in wrought iron hangers.  Draped with silk hangings in shades of purple and ivory, the walls hold silverwillow frames displaying samples of the shop's work for customers to peruse.  Behind a counter, a young Elven woman sits, her hands folded as she waits to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Violet Room"]},
  {"id":580,"x":340,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the White Room","descriptions":["Silvery silk is draped against a flocked white-on-white paper along the walls of the display room.  Dark ebony frames surround samples of the shop's work, and a young Elven woman looks up alertly as you enter, waiting to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["White Room"]},
  {"id":581,"x":330,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Gold Room","descriptions":["Pale ivory walls have been hung with shimmering garlands of sheer golden silk for an ethereal effect.  The soft light of candles standing upon cherrywood tables only heightens the effect.  Display cases mounted along the walls provide samples of the painter's work, and a young Elven woman awaits your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Gold Room"]},
  {"id":582,"x":330,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Painted Ladies Design, the Blue Room","descriptions":["The room is decorated in shades of white, blue and gold, with samples of paint styles and wallpaper framed upon the walls.  A young Elven woman stands behind the counter, ready to take your order."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Blue Room"]},
  {"id":583,"x":1197,"y":759,"z":0,"title":"House of the Waxen Moons, Entrance","descriptions":["This large hallway is slightly curved and has a rather high ceiling, well lit with pale blue oil lanterns mounted on the wall.  A dark red carpet runs down the center of the hallway, covering a rich black marble floor shot through with gold veins.  A small plant in a vase the same color as the carpet has been tucked into the corner, opposite the door leading back to the streets of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":584,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":117,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door","hidden":true}],"aliases":["House of the Waxen Moons","Waxen Moons"]},
  {"id":584,"x":1187,"y":759,"z":0,"title":"House of the Waxen Moons, Foyer","descriptions":["Dark red carpeting runs down the center of the long hallway, covering a polished black marble floor.  Occupying much of the northern half of the room is a large mahogany desk, its clean surface following the wall.  Next to the desk is an arched walnut door leading further into the House.  A small sitting room is visible through a small arch at the northwest end of this hall."],"exits":[{"to":583,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":585,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"}]},
  {"id":585,"x":1187,"y":749,"z":0,"title":"House of the Waxen Moons, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Overstuffed suede couches frame a low table set with a small tray of tea and other refreshments.  Dark purple curtains line each corner of the room, though the off-white walls have no windows at all.  Lit with two small oil lanterns hanging from the low ceiling, the room has a serene feeling, and holds the scent of brewed tea and tobacco."],"exits":[{"to":584,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"}]},
  {"id":586,"x":1104,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Entrance","descriptions":["Split bamboo lined up vertically and bound together by grass cord makes up the walls of this wide hallway.  Clever painting on the ceiling mimics oversized leaves, with several fresh branches tied on the long vertical posts that hold up the ceiling.  A low railing to the north overlooks a slow-moving pool, which fills the air with the gentle sound of flowing water."],"exits":[{"to":589,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":587,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":118,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch","hidden":true}],"aliases":["House of the Floating Reed","Floating Reed"]},
  {"id":587,"x":1094,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Statue","descriptions":["The walkway ends here, with a maple wood balcony overlooking a large body of slow-moving water to the northeast.  A wooden statue stands in the outer corner, depicting a willowy dryad holding a large tray of fruit.  Roughly hewn posts twined with white ivy from floor to ceiling have been set at periodic intervals down the hall's length.  Through a few tall stalks of leafy bamboo, a well-tended garden can be seen to the north."],"exits":[{"to":588,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":586,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":588,"x":1094,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, West Garden","descriptions":["A narrow bed of earth wends its way along the west side of the small indoor garden, its curving edge lined with burnished stones.  Interspersed around the base of a large raspberry bush are sweet-smelling sprigs of white lilac and milady's lace.  Twin jade statues stand on either side of a winding bridge that crosses over the tranquil water to the east, while to the north a set of glass doors leads into a ballroom."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":592,"exit":"go","move":"go winding bridge"}]},
  {"id":589,"x":1114,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Banquet Hall","descriptions":["Square pots have been set at either side of a break in the balcony railing, both carved from a pale jade.  Each is planted with a line of bamboo shoots in standing water, the thin stalks blooming into leaves in various shades of green.  Laid out with a spread of elegant dishes, a carved silverwood table sits opposite a set of narrow steps leading into a wide pool."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":586,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":590,"x":1124,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Balcony","descriptions":["Painted onto the wooden floor of the balcony is the image of a black water serpent, its long body seamlessly merging into a stone statue that coils around one of the balcony's wooden posts.  Set in the corner of the room is a small glass case displayed underneath a small lantern.  The balcony ends here, and to the north is a small, well-tended garden."],"exits":[{"to":591,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":589,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":591,"x":1124,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, East Garden","descriptions":["Along the east side of the garden is a well-mulched bed of earth, edged with carved silverwood.  Planted with dragon's mouth orchids and firefall vines, a heady scent comes from the blooming plants.  Dim twilight filters through a large skylight, and underneath it is a small fountain made of shaped kokona reeds.  Twin jade lions frame a narrow winding bridge to the west, while a bamboo door to the north leads into a small shop.","Along the east side of the room is a wide garden bed, edged with carved silverwood.  Planted with dragon's mouth orchids and firefall vines, a heady scent comes from the blooming plants.  Dim twilight filters through a large skylight, and underneath it is a small fountain made of shaped kokona reeds.  Twin jade lions frame a narrow winding bridge to the west, while a bamboo door to the north leads into a small shop."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":592,"exit":"go","move":"go winding bridge"},{"to":593,"exit":"go","move":"go bamboo door"}]},
  {"id":592,"x":1104,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Winding Bridge","descriptions":["Painted in a pure white, the narrow bridge goes neatly over the large square-shaped pool.  Two sharp bends in the middle of the bridge house a low mistwood bench between them.  Schools of fish swim about lazily in the water below, perhaps waiting for food from overhead.  The air is filled with a rather tranquil mist, dampening the open sky above."],"exits":[{"to":591,"exit":"go","move":"go east garden"},{"to":588,"exit":"go","move":"go west garden"}]},
  {"id":593,"x":1124,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Floating Reed, Shop","descriptions":["Walls of split, polished bamboo enclose the low-ceilinged room, a low shelf hung on the western wall.  Wares for sale are spread out on a long silverwood table, and a wide rack has been hung with an array of brightly colored skirts.  A small sign has been posted on the wall of the shop, and a bamboo door leads back out to the garden."],"exits":[{"to":591,"exit":"go","move":"go bamboo door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":594,"x":1245,"y":757,"z":0,"title":"House of the Steel Dove","descriptions":["Sanded black deobar planks line the floor to form a procession that leads to a single flint slab in the center of the room.  The walls are made from a dark grey wood, the material also used to craft the spare benches set along the sides.  A thick arch leads further into the building."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy doorway","hidden":true}],"aliases":["House of the Steel Dove","Steel Dove"]},
  {"id":595,"x":580,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Basement","descriptions":["This large cellar looks like a storeroom: stacks of crates, some bearing the Traders' Guild emblem, wrapped canvas bundles, and barrels of liquor are arranged in neat piles against the walls.  A dark doorway in the southern wall leads into a narrow tunnel."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go cellar doors"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":596,"x":1320,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, Tunnels","descriptions":["The fissure widens slightly into a narrow passage, one that has obviously been worked, but not by skilled hands.  The walls are rough and badly chipped, and the floor is covered with fragments of stone that make the footing treacherous."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":292,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"linksTo":"Map67a_Shard_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":597,"x":1350,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Thieves' Guild","descriptions":["The main guild hall has more of a tavern atmosphere than anything professional.  Rough wooden tables seat a crowd of rowdy, boisterous guild members, ably served by the innkeeper Talthus.  The walls are hung with costly tapestries and art, obviously spoils donated by the guild members.  A long wooden bar covers the entire eastern wall, and behind it stand shelves stocked with the best of drinks.  A doorway in the southern wall leads further into the guild, opposite the archway back to the street."],"exits":[{"to":598,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"},{"to":599,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"aliases":["Thief"]},
  {"id":598,"x":1350,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Office","descriptions":["The guildmaster's office is garishly decorated with trophies and prizes from a long and successful career.  Expensive tapestries of velvet, silk and cloth of gold hang from the walls, clashing with the thick embroidered rug covering the floor.  A mismatched drink service of silver and gold studded with gems sits atop a carved ebony sideboard against one wall.  The only functional piece in the room is a simple pine desk piled high with papers in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Thief"]},
  {"id":599,"x":1360,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Masters' Lounge","descriptions":["Decorative veils of shimmering gold silk hang from the walls and ceiling, making this lavishly decorated chamber look more like a wealthy trader's caravan tent than an underground room.  Soft velvet pillows sit in piles along the wall, atop a thick velvet carpet sewn with gold thread.  A sweet smelling smoke rises from an incense jar sitting in the center of a low wooden table in the middle of the room."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":600,"exit":"go","move":"go veiled arch"}]},
  {"id":600,"x":1370,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Workshop","descriptions":["Exquisitely crafted maple shelves are set above tall marble topped counters.  A deep marble sink, surmounted by a solid brass water pump, shares one wall with a white porcelain stove.  A stone gargoyle, wings furled and its gaping jaws ready to serve as a waste disposal, sits conveniently near an unlonchai bucket.  The clever use of mirrors brings sunlight to a Wayerd pyramid tucked into a niche in the wall."],"exits":[{"to":599,"exit":"go","move":"go veiled arch"}]},
  {"id":601,"x":1090,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Antechamber","descriptions":["Large cushions of plush, deep purple pile in the corners of this small room, ready to provide seating should the wait for admittance to the Ferdahl's inner chambers be a long one.  Twin gaethzen orbs frame both entrances, the pale, steady light lending a feeling of warmth to the red-violet walls that enclose the chamber.  A small indigo rug sits to the side of the door, hosting an array of soft slippers."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained arch"},{"to":533,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":602,"x":1100,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Narrow Hall","descriptions":["Floors of dark walnut gleam in the light cast by a row of standing lamps.  The plastered walls, painted a bright scarlet, are decorated by tightly spiraled white patterns that maze across their curved surfaces.  The violet furnishings of the antechamber are visible through a curtained arch, while across from it stands a pair of large teak doors."],"exits":[{"to":604,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":603,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":613,"exit":"go","move":"go teak doors"},{"to":601,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained arch"}]},
  {"id":603,"x":1090,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Narrow Hall","descriptions":["A miniature potted cherry tree flourishes here despite the lack of natural light, coating the walnut floor surrounding it with a snowfall of delicate pink blossoms.  Across from it opens an ash archway, its surface carved with a flowered vine motif to match the standing lamps that curve out of sight with the rest of the hall."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":609,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":605,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":604,"x":1110,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Narrow Hall","descriptions":["Off to one side stands a spidery table, its cloth dyed in a rainbow of colors.  A long mural painted on creamy ricepaper stretches above, the black shapes splashed upon it looking alien and vaguely menacing in the muted lamplight.  Closer inspection, however, reveals them to be nothing more intimidating than a highly stylized landscape of the Dragon's Spine."],"exits":[{"to":609,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":602,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":610,"exit":"go","move":"go silver arch"}]},
  {"id":605,"x":1090,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Chambers of the Ferdahl, Antechamber","descriptions":["Pale marble walls carved with a stylized pattern of curled vines and flowers enclose this quiet waiting room.  About the perimeter, cushioned silverwillow benches fashioned in a graceful bentwood style have been placed for the comfort of those arriving early for a private audience.  Underfoot, scattered rugs in muted tones of blue and green soften the bleached limestone floor, and in the western wall, arched windows allow daylight to spill in, dimming the gaethzen lamps that occupy the corners."],"exits":[{"to":606,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-leaf door"},{"to":607,"exit":"go","move":"go gilt-edged door"},{"to":603,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":606,"x":1080,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Chambers of the Ferdahl, Wash Room","descriptions":["Bright blue tiles cover the floor of this small room, ending at the foot of a large bowl-shaped white porcelain basin.  A complicated arrangement of twisted copper pipes snakes beneath it, winding up and around to end in a pair of gleaming taps.  Above, an oval mirror hangs on a wall decorated by stylized cresting waves.  The opposite wall is dominated by an arched window, bordered by light white curtains."],"exits":[{"to":605,"exit":"go","move":"go silver-leaf door"}]},
  {"id":607,"x":1090,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Chambers of the Ferdahl, Meeting Room","descriptions":["Massive windows in the western wall offer a panoramic view of the distant mountains as they allow daylight to flood this airy room.  Dark green damask draperies are drawn back and tied with braided silk cords, and in the center of the room stands a heavy pedestal table surrounded by straight-backed wooden chairs.  A gaethzen lamp in a plain bronze stand sits upon the table, ready for the coming of night."],"exits":[{"to":605,"exit":"go","move":"go gilt-edged door"}]},
  {"id":608,"x":1100,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Chambers of the Ferdahl, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Although windowless, this room is bright with the clear light of gaethzen lamps reflecting off of the white limestone floor and walls.  Set at intervals about the room, panels of glass mosaic like fractured rainbows catch the eye, and in one corner a pierced and hammered censer contains a slow-burning, spicy incense.  Low ottomans and cushioned armchairs provide comfortable seating, while a brightly painted silk screen bars passage elsewhere."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go black curtains"}],"aliases":["Chambers of the Ferdahl","Ferdahl"]},
  {"id":609,"x":1100,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Narrow Hall","descriptions":["The brilliant patterned scarlet of the walls is broken here by a stretch of black silk curtains that veil the outline of an open archway.  Beside them, a bright copperwood stand houses a large book which is laid open to reveal a pair of blank pages.  Long paintings span the hallway, done in stark greys and blacks on creamy white paper."],"exits":[{"to":604,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":603,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":608,"exit":"go","move":"go black curtains"}]},
  {"id":610,"x":1120,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Hall of Feasts","descriptions":["High, curving walls arch upward in the muted light, meeting to form the domed ceiling of this great chamber.  At the apex stretches a chandelier so skillfully spun from gaethzen and glass that it resembles a spider's web, dew-coated and cradling the stars.  Thin marble pillars, also studded with gaethzen, form a wide circle, and between them rest long tables rimmed by benches."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":612,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":604,"exit":"go","move":"go silver arch"}],"aliases":["Hall of Feasts"]},
  {"id":611,"x":1120,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Hall of Dances","descriptions":["A semicircle of tall daylily-shaped lamps wraps around the perimeter of the dance floor, the flickering light lending an almost cozy atmosphere to the area.  Large screens painted with fantastic beasts and impossible landscapes line all but the southernmost wall, which is broken by a large archway leading back to the dining hall's more formal setting."],"exits":[{"to":610,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Hall of Dances"]},
  {"id":612,"x":1120,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"The Great Tower, Hall of Dances","descriptions":["Given a warm orange cast by the natural lamplight, the ebonwood floor gleams underfoot, with a polished surface unblemished by careless bootmarks.  Beyond a sweeping archway cut into the north wall, the great chandelier of the Hall of Feasts can be seen, its glittering expanse partially dimmed by a thin veil of curtains."],"exits":[{"to":610,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":613,"x":1100,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Hall of Audiences, Seating Area","descriptions":["Long benches of white marble gleam in the daylight that streams though the glass panels of the lotus-shaped skylight set in the domed ceiling.  The benches coil most of the way around this large, circular chamber, forming rows that descend gradually, ending a short distance away from the raised dais upon which the Ferdahl holds her audiences.  The soft blue-green color of the chamber lends the area a further feeling of tranquility."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Hall of Audiences"]},
  {"id":614,"x":400,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Stables","descriptions":["The gleaming gold of hay and the soft whuffling of stabled horses and pack animals composes the bulk of the stable.  The floor is strewn with bits of straw, and a pitchfork leans against the wall at the end of the aisle that runs between the stalls."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["stables"]},
  {"id":615,"x":90,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Empath Guild, Whitehall Commons","descriptions":["Dark beige tapestries edged in midnight blue hush the corridor to a thick, soft silence, and plush carpeting with earthy brown tones adds to the air of serenity.  To one side of the hall stands a narrow modwir door, and a simple wooden arch leads northward into a courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden arch"},{"to":489,"exit":"go","move":"go modwir door"}]},
  {"id":616,"x":80,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Herbal Gardens","descriptions":["Long stretches of well-tended plants line the center of the courtyard, and small rose bushes grow in the corners of the garden square.  Framing the area, wide pathways of crushed white marble accommodate several benches for entertaining company or simply for a moment of quiet reflection."],"exits":[{"to":617,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":623,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":615,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Whitehall Commons"]},
  {"id":617,"x":90,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Path of Charity","descriptions":["A large bronze urn sits to one side of the path as it runs between lines of low boxwoods and luxuriant lilacs.  Opposite the urn, an elegant bronze statue stands on a polished linden base, the life-size sculpture depicting an Elven woman in simple, flowing robes."],"exits":[{"to":618,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":616,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":618,"x":90,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Way of Renewal","descriptions":["The crushed white marble pathway curves through a small grove of apple trees, with tiny seedlings scattered among mature trees and aged, twisted patriarchs.  Grass grows lushly between the trees, forming lawns perfect for picnics or simply sinking bare toes into."],"exits":[{"to":617,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":619,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":619,"x":80,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Path of Devotion","descriptions":["A verdigrised copper lattice arches over the pathway bearing vines thick with dangling clusters of modwyn berries.  Their fruity scent joins with the pungent aroma of healing herbs hanging heavy in the air, drifting up from neatly planted gardens outside each home."],"exits":[{"to":618,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":620,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":620,"x":70,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Fountain of Healing","descriptions":["Small dwellings cluster about an ivory fountain topped with a crystal unicorn which rears in a triumphant salute to Hodierna.  The fine spray of the fountain glitters as the waters leap high into the sky, splashing down on the crystal and dispersing a cool mist into the quiet night air.  Tiny fish dart just under the surface of the pool surrounding the fountain.","Small dwellings cluster about an ivory fountain topped with a crystal unicorn which rears in a triumphant salute to Hodierna.  The fine spray of the fountain glitters as the waters leap high into the sky, splashing down on the crystal and shattering the light into thousands of tiny rainbows.  Tiny fish dart just under the surface of the pool surrounding the fountain."],"exits":[{"to":619,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":621,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":621,"x":50,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Path of Life","descriptions":["Majestic oaks stand between the dwellings, their vast boughs spreading above the rooftops like enormous embracing arms.  Shadows dapple the benighted path, and occasional rustlings from the branches overhead reveal the roaming of nocturnal wildlife.","Majestic oaks stand between the dwellings, their vast boughs spreading above the rooftops like enormous embracing arms.  Tiny birds flit from tree to tree, filling the air with their bright song as they tend their nests in the branches high above.  The small grove luxuriates in the sounds of wildlife and a sense of deep calm."],"exits":[{"to":620,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":622,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":624,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak tree"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":622,"x":60,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Way of Peace","descriptions":["The path is edged on both sides with a low fence fashioned from broken weapons of war.  The hafts of shattered swords, dented maces, and snapped staves have been buried in the ground with a thick mahogany rail placed across their tops providing a convenient place to rest.  A carved misty-green ignimbrite sundial in the middle of the pathway waits through the night for the coming of sunlight.","The path is edged on both sides with a low fence fashioned from broken weapons of war.  The hafts of shattered swords, dented maces, and snapped staves have been buried in the ground with a thick mahogany rail placed across their tops providing a convenient place to rest.  A carved misty-green ignimbrite sundial in the middle of the pathway counts through the hours of sunlight."],"exits":[{"to":623,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":621,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":623,"x":70,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Path of Serenity","descriptions":["Small cottages bordered by neat flower gardens line this stretch of the path.  Although the cloud above Stormwill Tower roils in the sky nearby, only a faint, pleasant breeze is present here.  Heady floral perfumes, tinged with a hint of spice, fill the air."],"exits":[{"to":616,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":622,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":624,"x":40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Whitehall Commons, Oak Tree Branch","descriptions":["The branch has been worn flat on top and the bark smoothed by the countless people who have climbed up to this vantage point.  High above, the cloud surrounding Stormwill Tower grumbles and mutters with pent-up lightning, but its violence is overpowered by the certainty of peace in this enclave."],"exits":[{"to":621,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tree trunk"}]},
  {"id":625,"x":360,"y":1120,"z":0,"title":"South Bridge Flats, The Vestibule","descriptions":["A small vestibule lit by a pewter lamp occupies the space between an ascending flight of stairs and the street door.  A wool runner covers the stairs, keeping down both the noise and the dust."],"exits":[{"to":626,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go street door"}],"aliases":["Vestibule"]},
  {"id":626,"x":340,"y":1120,"z":0,"title":"The Second-Floor Hallway","descriptions":["A shield-shaped lamp burning a sweetly scented oil lights the upstairs hallway and the stairs to the street level.  The drapes on the window match the blue-and-green plaid of the runner on the polished floor.","A trim upstairs hallway is carpeted with a wool runner in green and blue, matching the drapes on the window at the street end of the room.  A polished oil lamp shaped like a shield lights the stairs."],"exits":[{"to":625,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":627,"x":610,"y":1160,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Foyer","descriptions":["The crescent-shaped room soars upward the full height of the theater, to an intricately painted ceiling depicting a clear, starry night sky.  Silver gilt molding frames the depiction, matching the columns down the walls and the balusters along the grand staircase.  Raw silk panels in a rich ivory hue line the space between the columns.  On one side of the staircase, two shorter columns flank an archway leading to the floor seating area, while on the opposite side, a matching pair highlights a passageway.","The crescent-shaped room soars upward the full height of the theater, to an intricately painted ceiling depicting a clear, starry night sky.  Silver gilt molding frames the depiction, matching the columns down the walls and the balusters along the grand staircase.  Raw silk panels in a rich ivory hue line the space between the columns.  On one side of the staircase, two shorter columns flank an archway leading to the floor seating area, while on the opposite side, a matching pair highlights a recessed doorway."],"exits":[{"to":629,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":628,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":199,"exit":"go","move":"go paneled doors"},{"to":630,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand staircase"},{"to":634,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":625,"exit":"go","move":"go recessed doorway"}],"aliases":["Shoan a Sidelkuloa","theater"]},
  {"id":628,"x":600,"y":1150,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Lounge","descriptions":["Midnight blue lacquered panels line the walls of the lounge, a polished silverwood bar curving across one corner.  Behind the bar, matching silverwood shelves display several bottles of featured wines, served from a silver tray resting on the bar.  Bright silver sconces hold crystal shades that reflect their light in a rippling underwater effect.  Tables and tall bentwood-backed chairs allow patrons to sit and enjoy their selections before or after performances."],"exits":[{"to":627,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Lounge"]},
  {"id":629,"x":600,"y":1170,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Memories","descriptions":["Ivory-hued lacquered panels line the walls of the shop, and a glass counter stretches along the length of the room.  Silver-gilt racks and silk-lined shelves display collectibles and necessities.  Gaethzen globes draped with strings of crystal beading create a softly flickering light to attractively highlight the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":627,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Memories"]},
  {"id":630,"x":620,"y":1160,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Mezzanine Landing","descriptions":["The staircase broadens here to allow theatergoers to pass through the archway to the mezzanine seating without disrupting the flow of those continuing upward to the balcony.  Highly polished railings protect against falls while allowing a view of the foyer below, and intricately patterned carpets soften the sounds of footsteps."],"exits":[{"to":627,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad steps"},{"to":631,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand staircase"},{"to":633,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":631,"x":630,"y":1160,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Balcony Landing","descriptions":["The staircase broadens here at the top to allow easy passage through the archway to the balcony and box seating.  Highly polished railings protect against falls while allowing a view of the foyer far below, and intricately patterned carpets soften the sounds of footsteps."],"exits":[{"to":632,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":630,"exit":"climb","move":"climb grand staircase"}],"aliases":["Balcony Landing"]},
  {"id":632,"x":630,"y":1150,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Box Seating","descriptions":["Violet silk draperies cover the interior of the box, and cushioned chairs give comfortable seating from which to watch the performances.  Silver sconces shaded with frosted glass give a soft light, and a polished silver gilt railing caps the gently curved front wall."],"exits":[{"to":631,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Box Seating"]},
  {"id":633,"x":620,"y":1150,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Mezzanine Seating","descriptions":["Plush velvet upholstery covers the seats, the top edge of each gilt in silver.  At this height, the stage is easily viewable, as is the chandelier hanging from the ceiling over the orchestra section.  Overhead, the partial ceiling provided by the balcony section is painted a deep ebon hue, and tiny inset crystal stars display constellations."],"exits":[{"to":630,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Mezzanine Seating"]},
  {"id":634,"x":610,"y":1150,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Orchestra Seating","descriptions":["Plush velvet upholstery covers the seats, the top edge of each gilt in silver.  The stage is easily viewable from this gently sloping section, allowing a view over any taller theatergoers in front.  An elaborate chandelier hangs from the ebon-hued ceiling, in which inset crystal stars display constellations in an intricate depiction of the night sky."],"exits":[{"to":627,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Orchestra Seating"]},
  {"id":635,"x":610,"y":1200,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Backstage","descriptions":["The working heart of the theater, this area is alive with activity during performances as actors and staff rush between the men's and women's dressing rooms to the northwest and southwest and the wing to the southeast.  Though sparsely decorated in comparison to the public areas, a few luxuries are available.  A small silk-draped niche in one wall bears a statue, and a cart nearby holds tea and light refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":637,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":636,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":642,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron staircase"},{"to":641,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"},{"to":627,"exit":"go","move":"go glittering door"}],"aliases":["Backstage"]},
  {"id":636,"x":600,"y":1190,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Men's Dressing Room","descriptions":["Dark silk hangings line the walls, a luxury that serves to dampen noise and provide an atmosphere of calm for those preparing here.  Shelves and wardrobes bear costumes for the current production.  Mirrors along one wall allow actors to check their appearance before going to the wings.  A sign in bold but elegant script hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":635,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Men's Dressing Room"]},
  {"id":637,"x":600,"y":1210,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Women's Dressing Room","descriptions":["Rich blue silk hangings line the walls, a luxury that serves to dampen noise and provide an atmosphere of calm for those preparing here.  Shelves and wardrobes bear costumes for the current production.  Mirrors along one wall allow actors to check their appearance before going to the wings.  A sign in bold but elegant script hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":635,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Women's Dressing Room"]},
  {"id":638,"x":620,"y":1210,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Stage Wing","descriptions":["A strange calm hangs over the stage wings even during performances, in stark contrast to the activity just a few paces away backstage.  Performers and stage hands wait here in silence for cues to enter the stage or change scenes."],"exits":[{"to":635,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":639,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":640,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}]},
  {"id":639,"x":620,"y":1220,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Orchestra Pit","descriptions":["Simple chairs, their legs muffled with thick felt, provide seating for musicians.  From here, a conductor can direct both the orchestra and any singers on stage."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":640,"x":630,"y":1200,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Stage","descriptions":["A row of lights illuminates the boards and those who take their place upon them.  Dark curtains block sight of the wings."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}],"aliases":["Stage"]},
  {"id":641,"x":620,"y":1200,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Understage","descriptions":["Here in the underbelly of the theater, items are all but abandoned -- damaged or worn beyond easy repair, awaiting eventual disposal or perhaps salvage and rebirth as pieces for new props or costumes.  A trapdoor leads up to the stage floor for actors entering or exiting through some abyss or Eylhaar's embrace.  A noticeable draft passes between the steps and a large brass grate."],"exits":[{"to":640,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"},{"to":635,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}],"aliases":["Understage"]},
  {"id":642,"x":600,"y":1200,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Upper Landing","descriptions":["Sturdy railings provide safety for those passing from the staircase through the door to the theater roof and the outdoor performance area.  One newel post has been carved in a depiction of a tower."],"exits":[{"to":643,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":635,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron staircase"}]},
  {"id":643,"x":590,"y":1200,"z":0,"title":"Shoan a Sidelkuloa, Outdoor Stage","descriptions":["The simple stage consists of a raised platform of wood planks.  Lanterns provide light for nighttime performances."],"exits":[{"to":642,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":644,"x":340,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Maker's Mark Shop","descriptions":["Damp walls of alternating limestone and dolomite do little to shield this entryway from the pounding deep inside the forge.  A thick oak door leads out onto the streets."],"exits":[{"to":661,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":646,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":645,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging Society","Maker's Mark Shop"]},
  {"id":645,"x":320,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, West Hall","descriptions":["A pair of diamond-shaped windows clouded entirely by soot, face the city streets.  An occasional bang from the crafting rooms sets them rattling in their frames and tosses up small clouds of grey dust."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":649,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":647,"exit":"go","move":"go willow door"}],"aliases":["Forging Prestige"]},
  {"id":646,"x":360,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, East Hall","descriptions":["This long corridor lined with soot-stained carpet reverberates with the whine of grinding steel.  Workers hurry back and forth to resupply at the stand to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":658,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":644,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":659,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":647,"x":300,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["A small chimney high above in the ceiling is unable to remove all the smoke from a large fire burning under a granite crucible here.  The brown haze swirls about as air currents shift, and adds a bitter taste to the air.  A nearby pile of fuel resembles a shadowy beast in the dim torchlight."],"exits":[{"to":648,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":645,"exit":"go","move":"go willow door"}],"aliases":["Foundry1","crucible1"]},
  {"id":648,"x":300,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Thick grooves in the dolomite floor lead over to a steel anvil and sandstone grindstone that must have seen many dragging trips into and out of the room.  A nearby slack tub of discolored water mists into a cloudy haze that further obscures the already smoky air."],"exits":[{"to":647,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Forge1"]},
  {"id":649,"x":300,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Book Stand","descriptions":["From an assortment of manuals and books sold here, instructors walk about tutoring crafters in the way of forging.  An occasional disagreement between smiths over nomenclature and the finer points of metallurgy add to noise from the ever-present beating of the forges."],"exits":[{"to":650,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":645,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Book Stand","Forging Books"]},
  {"id":650,"x":320,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, West Hall","descriptions":["The maple walls in this section of the forge are cleaner than the stone found elsewhere.  A thick coat of fire-resistant lacquer amplifies light cast off by the forge fires in the nearby crafting rooms."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":649,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":651,"exit":"go","move":"go elm door"}],"aliases":["Forging Clerk"]},
  {"id":651,"x":300,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["Billows of smoke rise up from a large fire and are sucked through a brick chimney situated high above the work area.  A granite crucible towers over the glowing coals, its smooth sides marred by driblets of solidified metal.  A wooden slat stacked with a pile of fuel is nearby."],"exits":[{"to":652,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":650,"exit":"go","move":"go elm door"}],"aliases":["Foundry2","crucible2"]},
  {"id":652,"x":300,"y":850,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Sparkles from long-dried metal reflect up from the dolomite floor, illuminated by an octagonal forge in the room's center.  Nearby, a steel anvil and a granite grindstone wait for use with metalwork.  Tendrils of steam rise from the damp floor beneath a briny slack tub used for cooling finished goods."],"exits":[{"to":651,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Forge2"]},
  {"id":653,"x":340,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Tool Stand","descriptions":["A circular counter encompasses a pile of wicker baskets bulging with forging tools.  Attendants tend to the merchandise and help crafters with orders.  The sharp scent of metalworking oil hangs in the air as a contrast to the bitter smoke found elsewhere."],"exits":[{"to":654,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":655,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":650,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tool Stand","Forging Tools"]},
  {"id":654,"x":340,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Office","descriptions":["Matching suits of full plate armor stand on opposite ends of the room with flamberges clenched within their gauntlets.  Overhead, a massive chandelier casts down a dim light that reveals several racks of fine weapons awaiting inspection from the Society Master.  A tidy oak desk trimmed with niello occupies what little space remains, near the back wall."],"exits":[{"to":653,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Forging Office","Forging Charts"]},
  {"id":655,"x":360,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, East Hall","descriptions":["A pair of water barrels awaits use if the forge fires should get out of control.  A thin film of white dust coats the floor and walls, likely caused from the continuous passage of heavy sleds bearing supplies to and from the forges."],"exits":[{"to":658,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":653,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":656,"exit":"go","move":"go hickory door"}]},
  {"id":656,"x":380,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["Crinkled patches of metal stain the dolomite floor.  The splattering becomes more numerous and expands to form concentric circles near the room's center, where a large granite crucible hangs over a large fire."],"exits":[{"to":657,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":655,"exit":"go","move":"go hickory door"}],"aliases":["Foundry3","crucible3"]},
  {"id":657,"x":380,"y":850,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["An octagonal forge situated in the room's center emits a ruddy glow illuminating the basalt blocks framing it.  In the corner, a large grindstone casts a gigantic shadow upon the wall, and wisps of steam rise up from the recently used slack tub and anvil."],"exits":[{"to":656,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Forge3"]},
  {"id":658,"x":380,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Supply Stand","descriptions":["Enormous piles of ore flanked by glistening ingots dwarf the crafters making purchases here.  Rope as thick as a Gor'Tog's waist hang from a trio of massive pulleys used to rearrange crates around the area."],"exits":[{"to":646,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":655,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":800,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Supply Stand","Forging Supplies"]},
  {"id":659,"x":380,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Crucible","descriptions":["A central cavity splits the ceiling and metal tubing funnels smoke away from the glowing fire.  A granite crucible scarred with use rests atop a forked beam next to the fire.  Black scrapes along the ground lead over to a circular pile of fuel in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":660,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":646,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Foundry4","crucible4"]},
  {"id":660,"x":380,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Blocks of carved basalt form an octagonal forge surrounding shallow pits containing piles of fuel.  A steel anvil butts up against, and peeks over the heavily chipped blocks.  An assortment of metal molds and attachments for the anvil hang from the wall."],"exits":[{"to":659,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Forge4"]},
  {"id":661,"x":340,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Depot","descriptions":["Dozens of wooden sleds and carts line the walls next to the supply depot.  Well-muscled men arranged into an assembly line haul goods back and forth, while a steady stream of crafters challenges their ability to keep up."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Depot","Deeds","Serric"]},
  {"id":662,"x":300,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Under the Bridge of Rooks","descriptions":["High in a corner where the support meets the roadway, a large bird's nest dangles bits of straw and string that sway when touched by a breeze.  The deck above casts a dark shadow on the water as it ripples past carrying bits of debris that swirl around the center pilings.  Jutting from the arch's footing is a large pipe installed as an air vent that plunges deep beneath the ground to the span's underpinnings."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bridge"},{"to":663,"exit":"go","move":"go pipe"}]},
  {"id":663,"x":260,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["This enormous oval of forged metal not only descends at a steep incline, but is slippery and noisily amplifies the echoes from any sound.  A small stream of moisture dribbles along in a desultory manner at the base of the curving floor.  Rust patterns on the walls form abstract works of natural art."],"exits":[{"to":664,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":662,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":664,"x":260,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["Sounds from above mingle with those from below, creating a murmuring echo that is indecipherable.  A few stray leaves adhere to the wall where receding water left them plastered.  Underfoot, bits and pieces of debris crumble and mingle with the rivulet in the center, muddying the clarity of the stream."],"exits":[{"to":663,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":665,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":665,"x":260,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["A small stream of moisture dribbles along in a desultory manner at the base of the curving floor.  Rust patterns on the walls form abstract works of natural art.  Branching off of the pipe is a large opening that leads east."],"exits":[{"to":664,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":666,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":745,"exit":"go","move":"go opening","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":666,"x":260,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["The further one descends, the cooler it becomes.  The mix of moisture on the floor with the chilled air creates lace like patterns on the metal walls.  The flow of air vacillates between drifting lazily upward and blowing past as it heads down the vent."],"exits":[{"to":665,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":667,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":667,"x":260,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["It is definitely damper here than the small trickle drizzling along underfoot would indicate.  Peaks and valleys of rust patterns on the walls form abstract mountain ranges some of which soar high overhead.  One side of this pipe appears to have been gouged from behind with enough persistence to open an irregular hole half way up the curve."],"exits":[{"to":666,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":668,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":735,"exit":"go","move":"go hole","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":668,"x":260,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"In the Vent","descriptions":["The pipe ends abruptly, having met the bridge's main support which is encircled by shallow water.  This vent was installed in an attempt to draw excess moisture to the surface, but its success is questionable as rust has leached into the stagnant water and at a minimum discolored the column."],"exits":[{"to":667,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":669,"x":310,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Corridor","descriptions":["A quiet passage lined with plush gold-edged maroon carpeting and polished rosewood paneling runs along the back of the inn.  Trophies from hunting expeditions hang upon the walls -- a snarling snowbeast captured in a lifelike pose, and a buffalo head looming over those who pass through the corridor.  Unlike the upstairs rooms, these apartments are owned by their residents, local citizens who prefer the convenience of life at the inn."],"exits":[{"to":670,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":466,"exit":"go","move":"go panel door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":670,"x":310,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Corridor","descriptions":["Carved mahogany moldings run the length of the hallway, the dark wood contrasting with the polished rosewood paneling on the walls.  The head and claws of a black leucro are mounted upon a wooden shield on the wall, the green glass eyes balefully surveying all who pass beneath its stretch of hall.  On the opposite wall, a hunting scene is mounted in a gilded frame."],"exits":[{"to":671,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":669,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":671,"x":310,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Corridor","descriptions":["The corridor bends to the northeast past the majestic figure of a desumos.  A triumph of the taxidermist's art, the golden mane and tawny pelt maintain their original sheen, while the glittering blue glass eyes and ivory fangs add to the realism.  Residents have donated crested wooden shields which hang upon rich silk banners along the walls."],"exits":[{"to":672,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":670,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":672,"x":320,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Golden Phoenix, Corridor","descriptions":["A golden sunburst is inlaid into the rosewood paneling at the end of the hallway.  Carved within the sunburst is the image of a phoenix rising from the flames, its wings outstretched toward the sky.  The soft gleam of the gold is reflected in the rosewood walls.  In the corner, a brass pot holds an oversized fern.  The feathery fronds tumble over the sides of the pot to gently brush the deep maroon carpet."],"exits":[{"to":671,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":673,"x":400,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"An Enclosed Courtyard","descriptions":["Surrounded by lush ferns, an expansive flagstone patio supports several smokewood benches and a small table of refreshments.  Vibrant crimson blossoms spangle the clematis vines that cover the trunks of a pair of dwarf maple trees standing guard at the courtyard's archway.  Glowing gaethzen orbs are tucked neatly within the fragrant lavender bushes that line the surrounding fence."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":674,"x":660,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Second Floor Foyer","descriptions":["Dominated by a burgundy rug embroidered with a sprawling shesegri design, the room is delicately scented by an array of colorful native flowers in a large clay pot.  A polished ironwood table sits between curving stairways covered with deep red runners.  Several large windows facing the street have been left slightly open, allowing in a tranquil breeze."],"exits":[{"to":675,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":676,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":677,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":678,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"},{"to":189,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":675,"x":660,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Floating Reed","descriptions":["Spread across the room, a fragrant woven reed mat is heaped with odds and ends -- couches, tables piled with books, instruments, a small sink.  A wide variety of people travel in and out of the room, busy at all hours."],"exits":[{"to":674,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":676,"x":670,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Rowan Branch","descriptions":["Plush silk pillows dyed a deep purple sit before a statue of Eluned, a golden shesegri pattern at her feet as an aid in meditation.  The thin fog of incense issuing from several golden censers fills the room with the heavy fragrance of jasmine and nearly obscures the lone scribe working at a desk in the corner, his notes illegible to all but himself."],"exits":[{"to":674,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Rowan Branch"]},
  {"id":677,"x":650,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Silk Strings","descriptions":["Small groups of Elotheans huddle around dark oblong tables, deeply engrossed in the unfurled song scrolls which cover the surfaces.  An assortment of refreshments is on a squat oak table near the entrance of the chamber, very close to a lavishly dressed minstrel strumming her mandolin.  Her songs of war, peace, and heartbreak are improvised into one continuous song, interrupted only when she pauses to write down a word or two that pleases her."],"exits":[{"to":674,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Silk Strings"]},
  {"id":678,"x":700,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Third Floor Foyer","descriptions":["Rich blue rugs have been laid over the cool granite floor, and the foyer's large glass windows reveal a view of the rich countryside south of Shard.  Stoic guards stand near the ascending stairway, weapons discreetly at the ready."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":681,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":680,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":682,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":683,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":684,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"},{"to":674,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":679,"x":700,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Ivory Scroll","descriptions":["Meticulously cataloged scrolls have been stored in several compartmentalized shelving units along the walls of the room, some full of scrolls while others seem to be missing quite a few.  A large table sits in the center of the room, flanked by tall chairs padded with red velvet."],"exits":[{"to":678,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Ivory Scroll"]},
  {"id":680,"x":710,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Gilded Longleaf","descriptions":["Bedrolls in varying stages of occupation lie strewn about the room, and supplies are piled throughout the room.  Along one wall, a large map of Ilithi is covered with small round markers, perhaps to help plot the next location of the wandering House."],"exits":[{"to":678,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Gilded Longleaf"]},
  {"id":681,"x":710,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Waxen Moons","descriptions":["Curiously empty, the only thing of notice in this room is the banner which hangs in it."],"exits":[{"to":678,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":682,"x":690,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Grey Storm","descriptions":["The strong scent of ozone fills the room, apparently unnoticed by the mages sorting through the remains of the House lore.  Piles of spell scrolls are heaped onto tables, and nearby several large wooden crates hold various talismans and unlabelled bottles of some cloudy liquid.  The occasional crow or owl flies into the room through the open window, depositing more onto the piles."],"exits":[{"to":678,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Grey Storm"]},
  {"id":683,"x":690,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Gentle Lion","descriptions":["Shining armor hung on hooks near the entrance belongs to the hardworking paladins reviewing religious texts, inventory lists, and planning the rebuilding of their House.  Cramped tables cluster near a raised pedestal which holds a timeworn book of laws securely locked in a glass case."],"exits":[{"to":678,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Gentle Lion"]},
  {"id":684,"x":680,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Fourth Floor Foyer","descriptions":["Covering most of the northern wall, a massive scroll reaches skyward, its pale tan surface covered with countless names.  High above, several mosaic stained glass skylights have been carefully disguised among the vivid paintings of cathedral ceiling, bathing the area in a rainbow of color.  From behind a simple pine desk, a frazzled clerk copies various records to a thick black book placed on the desk before him.","Covering most of the northern wall, a massive scroll reaches skyward, its pale tan surface covered with countless names.  High above, several mosaic stained glass skylights have been carefully disguised among the vivid paintings of the cathedral ceiling.  From behind a simple pine desk, a frazzled clerk copies various records to a thick black book placed on the desk before her."],"exits":[{"to":685,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":678,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"},{"to":734,"exit":"go","move":"go open skylight"}],"aliases":["house registration"]},
  {"id":685,"x":680,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Butterfly Garden","descriptions":["Exotic plants line the glass walls from floor to ceiling, and make this room feel more like a rainforest than a consulate in Shard.  Multihued butterflies glide to and fro over the dew-soaked petals of the thriving flora, just as content to perch on a leaf as on a visitor's finger.  In the center of the room is a small sitting area comprised of a metal table with a blue-green glass top and a few chairs.  In one corner is a man-made waterfall, the gentle flow of its water cascading over heated stones."],"exits":[{"to":684,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"aliases":["Butterfly Garden"]},
  {"id":686,"x":920,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Hall","descriptions":["Arching high overhead, the vaulted ceiling of the main hall glitters with a thousand crystal stars.  Glowing spheres tinted the many colors of the heavens float in myriad constellations, slowly turning about in a celestial dance.  Arches to the east and west open up into spacious meeting rooms, a midnight blue runner between them."],"exits":[{"to":687,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":688,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood arch"},{"to":689,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad staircase"},{"to":696,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding steps"}]},
  {"id":687,"x":930,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Meeting Room","descriptions":["Prominently placed on a raised dais, a black marble podium gleams in the soft light of the ornate crystal candelabra overhead.  Far dimmer light emanates from stained glass sconces along the walls, illuminating the clusters of low brocade silk couches which ring the room while keeping the main focus towards the center."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":688,"x":910,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Feasterie","descriptions":["A stately piano sits at the ready near one of the the rich red brocade curtains, an elaborate golden candelabra atop it.  An enormous silk-draped table piled high with food and drink takes up most of the space in this room, a dark ferishanloa chair at each silver-edged place setting.  Underfoot is a heavy rug of indigo silk, silver-dipped threads running through it to sparkle in the candlelight."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":689,"x":940,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Den","descriptions":["Burning low and surrounded by plush brocade silk couches, the brushed bronze brazier in the center of the room is a social meeting point for those who spend time relaxing and studying in the House proper.  Here mages gather for casual conversation, the tall skylight above providing a view of the heavens at all times."],"exits":[{"to":690,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":691,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":693,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":694,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad stairs"},{"to":686,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":690,"x":940,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Library","descriptions":["Smelling strongly of parchment and ink, this room's dry atmosphere is ideal for the keeping of the House's scrolls.  Heavy wooden bookshelves line the room, though one wall is entirely taken up by a large bay window overlooking the front lawn."],"exits":[{"to":689,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":691,"x":950,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Study Area","descriptions":["Fine parchment charts of each of the main constellations cover the matte black walls, the creamy hue of the star charts stark against them.  Dark mahogany desks are positioned facing the walls, each stocked with carved seaglass inkwells filled with rich blue ink and stoppered with chunks of rosy wax."],"exits":[{"to":692,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":689,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":692,"x":950,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Mystic Corner","descriptions":["Sheer jewel-toned silks drape over the walls of the room, sunlight filtering in just enough to illuminate the room with a hazy red glow.  Dark, gnarled shelves are covered with bottles and jars of unidentifiable substances behind a partially open crystal-beaded curtain.  Low to the floor is a round table of some sort of rough stone with deep red crystalline veins.  A rich red brocade silk cushion supports a large crystal ball atop the pillow-ringed table."],"exits":[{"to":691,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":693,"x":930,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Children's Area","descriptions":["Brightly colored rugs depicting panther cubs at play enclose this cozy room.  Fluffy cushions are thrown about, ready to provide a soft landing spot for a child's bottom.  Stacks of picture books illustrating some of the more exciting adventures of the gods litter small low tables, and the walls and ceiling appear to have been decorated by the hands of a child -- sloppy fingerpainted comets adorn a starry sky."],"exits":[{"to":689,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":694,"x":900,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Stairwell","descriptions":["Hooks are affixed to one wall at the top of the stairwell, ready to hold the cloaks and umbrellas that might be necessary on the rooftop observatory depending on the weather.  A woven reed mat sits just inside the door to the roof.  On the floor sits a small statue of a shadowling with rough mats for its bat-like wings provided to scrape the soles of muddy boots."],"exits":[{"to":695,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"},{"to":689,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding steps"}]},
  {"id":695,"x":910,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Rooftop","descriptions":["Thick stone blocks form the roof of the House atop which a gleaming silver telescope rises like a spire.  Numerous runes are carved into it, though many are scratched and damaged beyond recognition.  A hefty brushed steel kettle of hot cocoa dangles above a wide granite firepit within quick reach, ready to warm even the coldest late-night stargazer."],"exits":[{"to":694,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}]},
  {"id":696,"x":960,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Lower Level","descriptions":["Thick rugs cover the cool stone floor underfoot, muffling the sound of footfalls.  The ceilings are uncharacteristically low here, though the decor is as luxurious and mystical as the rest of the House.  Richly woven tapestries, many of Shard in its infancy, adorn the close walls."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broad stairs"},{"to":697,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}]},
  {"id":697,"x":960,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Water Closet","descriptions":["Dozens of twisting bronze pipes are attached to one another at odd angles in a bizarre form of engineering.  At the foot of the conglomeration of piping is a small burnished chamber pot etched with a blossoming rosebud.  Near the door is a small marble stand on which are a bronze washbasin and a pink bar of soap."],"exits":[{"to":696,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}]},
  {"id":698,"x":950,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Beneath the Willow Tree","descriptions":["Long branches trail nearly to the ground around a majestic weeping willow tree, some dipping the tips of their leaves into the clear pond nearby.  The willow's broad trunk disappears above into a dense tangle of fragrant leaves that rustle softly in even the slightest breeze."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"go","move":"go grounds"},{"to":699,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trunk"}]},
  {"id":699,"x":970,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Silver Star, Atop the Willow Tree","descriptions":["High in the willow's branches is a smooth wooden platform with an unobstructed view of the daytime sky.  A downward glance reveals the bustling city of Shard, the din a faint buzz from here.  Towards the northwest, the massive black marble building which is home to the House of the Silver Star stands proudly, its facade as impenetrable as the secrets within.","High in the willow's branches is a smooth wooden platform with an unobstructed view of the nighttime sky.  Towards the northwest, the massive black marble building which is home to the House of the Silver Star stands proudly, little visible through its drawn curtains.  A downward glance reveals the city of Shard, illuminated with thousands of lights cut through by the pools of darkness where the rivers lie."],"exits":[{"to":698,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trunk"}],"aliases":["Willow Tree"]},
  {"id":700,"x":80,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Entrance","descriptions":["An austere lobby carved from solid granite supports the tower above.  Alchemists continually line the stairs leading up, waiting to claim a good spot at the crafting stations.  The sound of shuffling feet and disagreements over seasonal pricing can be heard from the floor above."],"exits":[{"to":701,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Society","Alchemy Prestige"]},
  {"id":701,"x":80,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Alchemical Materials","descriptions":["Softly glowing gaethzen spheres hang over glass-lidded pine cases that display a variety of materials for sale.  A dark wool carpet depicting a cornucopia of alchemical ingredients covers the floor, ready to mask any possible stains from careless hands."],"exits":[{"to":702,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":700,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":703,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Supplies"]},
  {"id":702,"x":80,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Books","descriptions":["Stained-glass windows depicting a menagerie of alchemists in various stages of the craft surround the top of the granite-walled tower.  A young Human keeps herself busy by collecting the piles into neat stacks, only to frown and readjust them into an alternate arrangement."],"exits":[{"to":701,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":704,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":705,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Books"]},
  {"id":703,"x":70,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Alchemical Tools","descriptions":["A bored-looking Elven boy sits next to a steel cabinet in this tight alcove.  He occasionally opens one of the various drawers to dust the tools within, keeping them in pristine condition until sold."],"exits":[{"to":701,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Tools"]},
  {"id":704,"x":70,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Maker's Marks","descriptions":["A pair of apprentice alchemists scrub the soot-streaked walls of this alchemical proving ground where local residents confirm their worth for the Ilithi Alchemical Society chapter.  A pinch-nosed Elothean holding a ledger grumbles behind a paperwork-laden desk, furiously scribbling notes on the latest batch of goods delivered by both hopeful prospects and the well-established champions of the arts."],"exits":[{"to":702,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":705,"x":90,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Shard Alchemy Society, Work Room","descriptions":["A fresh breeze flows through two high-cut windows and removes the musty smell of prepared herbs.  Three large stone wheels capable of grinding alchemical herbs and plants dominate one side of the room.  Along the other side several stoves equipped with flat-iron tops wait for crafters to dry things with them."],"exits":[{"to":702,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Dryer","Plant Dryer"]},
  {"id":706,"x":800,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Triage Building","descriptions":["A pervading sense of orderliness rests within the expansive single-room building.  The open floor plan is sectioned off into easily recognizable areas outfitted for distinct purposes.  To the east wall rests a large medicinal cabinet and a stack of pallets.  Several padded benches line the walls near the entrance and an ebony weapons rack appears on the western wall.  Towards the back, several pallets are set out for the care of terminal patients and dead bodies."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Triage Building"]},
  {"id":707,"x":160,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Cellar Passage","descriptions":["Two lanterns provide faint illumination for the tavern's cellar.  A long procession of overstocked wine racks, ale barrels, and crockery cabinets lines the mortised stone corridor, interrupted by a series of heavy wooden doors, presumably leading to more storage areas."],"exits":[{"to":708,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":708,"x":150,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, The Back Bar","descriptions":["A holdover from a time when wearing the symbol of the Bard's Guild was a death sentence and secrecy was necessary, this quiet wine cellar has once again been cleared out to provide a sanctuary from those hiding from the perils of politics or the hazards of a satirical verse.  Scrolls are laid out on the table, the elegant mark of a skilled calligrapher across their surface.  A polished maple door leads into a private conservatory set aside for the guild."],"exits":[{"to":707,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":709,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}]},
  {"id":709,"x":150,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Bards' Room","descriptions":["Comfortable couches of various sizes and states of repair are pushed into no discernible order in this small but cozy room.  Kept at a moderate temperature and serviced by a waitress who stops in from time to time to take orders, the room is a little piece of peace created so that bards may meet in secret and discuss their hopes and dreams in safety, sheltered from the chaos running so rampant in the outside world."],"exits":[{"to":710,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":708,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}]},
  {"id":710,"x":140,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Liani's Heaven, Bards' Repose","descriptions":["A warm fire in the fireplace greets provides a cheery centerpiece for a room obviously designed with quiet comfort in mind.  Tapestries on the walls muffle the sounds from elsewhere in the cellar, while needlepoint rugs covering the flagstones underfoot provide a soft cushion to travelers seeking a moment of repose.  Scattered about the floor, plush pillows allow seating to be easily adjusted to fit large meetings as easily as small groups of bards discussing their next performance."],"exits":[{"to":709,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":711,"x":780,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Depot","descriptions":["An assortment of supply-laden wagons and carts rumble in through an enormous diamondique arch.  Vendors peddle supplies to eager crafters all throughout the entryway.  Nearby a gate leads to the inner rooms, and some thick oak doors lead to more shops."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go diamondique arch"},{"to":712,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"},{"to":718,"exit":"go","move":"go oak doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Society","Engineering supplies"]},
  {"id":712,"x":760,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Workroom","descriptions":["At one end of the room stands a work bench covered with tools.  Deep grooves and scratches cover the bench's oak surface.  Wood shavings and stone bits dot the rough granite floor below."],"exits":[{"to":713,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":711,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workroom1"]},
  {"id":713,"x":740,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Workroom","descriptions":["At one end of the room stands a work bench covered with tools.  Deep grooves and scratches cover the bench's oak surface.  Wood shavings and stone bits dot the rough granite floor below."],"exits":[{"to":714,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":712,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":715,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workroom2"]},
  {"id":714,"x":740,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Workroom","descriptions":["At one end of the room stands a work bench covered with tools.  Deep grooves and scratches cover the bench's oak surface.  Wood shavings and stone bits dot the rough granite floor below."],"exits":[{"to":716,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":713,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workroom4"]},
  {"id":715,"x":720,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Workroom","descriptions":["At one end of the room stands a work bench covered with tools.  Deep grooves and scratches cover the bench's oak surface.  Wood shavings and stone bits dot the rough granite floor below."],"exits":[{"to":713,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workroom3"]},
  {"id":716,"x":760,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Walkway","descriptions":["A suspended wooden walkway connects both halves of the Engineering Society.  Below, a statue garden demonstrates the very best works of art from local crafters."],"exits":[{"to":717,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":714,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Engineering prestige","Engineering charts"]},
  {"id":717,"x":780,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Bookstore","descriptions":["Cluttered stacks of books completely fill a recessed pit in the corner.  Book sellers for the Society shrug to confused patrons, seemingly unapologetic regarding the mess.  One neat and organized table of books stands out from the rest."],"exits":[{"to":718,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":716,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering books","Engineering clerk"]},
  {"id":718,"x":780,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Shard Engineering Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Tools hang from corkboard decorating this long, rectangular room.  A thick sent of oil clings to the air and the scraping sound of stone sharpening metal drones on in the background.  Some nearby salespeople wait to help customers."],"exits":[{"to":717,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":711,"exit":"go","move":"go oak doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering tools"]},
  {"id":719,"x":500,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Main Entrance","descriptions":["Enveloped in dark pink granite walls, the main entrance exudes a warmth of colors from the parquet bloodwood flooring to the multitude tapestries hanging from the ceiling.  Mannequins in one corner display a few of the masterpieces made by Ilithi's more promising tailors while display cases filled with jewelry items occupy another.  Overhead, a prestige board hangs from the intricately carved ceiling beams to display the names of the most dedicated to each outfitting discipline throughout each of the provinces."],"exits":[{"to":720,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":721,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":722,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go granite arch"}],"aliases":["Outfitting Society","Outfitting Prestige"]},
  {"id":720,"x":500,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Book Store","descriptions":["The scent of tanning lotions lingers in the air from the hides covering the walls.  An overworked Elven fellow sits behind a small table scraping away at some leather that he pulls from the large pile on the table.  Several tall racks against a wall hold a plentiful supply of crafting books."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting books"]},
  {"id":721,"x":520,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Pine paneled walls are nearly covered by racks of raw cloth and leather that flank either side of the narrow hallway.  In one corner sits a mannequin completely destitute of any type of clothing.  Tailors of all kinds rush back and forth, busy with their wares, dropping a random pin on the floor adding to the collection of scrap."],"exits":[{"to":723,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":719,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":726,"exit":"go","move":"go grey arch"},{"to":727,"exit":"go","move":"go beige arch"},{"to":728,"exit":"go","move":"go azure arch"}]},
  {"id":722,"x":480,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Main Office","descriptions":["Two clerks sit behind the counter taking orders and sorting through the day's various requisitions.  A pile of invoices and work orders are stacked high on the Society Master's desk in the rear of the office next to a tall book shelf."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Outfitting clerk"]},
  {"id":723,"x":520,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Tool Shop","descriptions":["The supply shop projects an air of quiet efficiency at all times with clerks refilling the various empty slots with new tools for sale.  Bottles, fabrics, and canvases stand neatly arranged on shelves that line the wall behind a polished white granite counter.  Several workrooms nearby provide enough static noise to block out the clerks idle conversations."],"exits":[{"to":724,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":721,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting tools"]},
  {"id":724,"x":520,"y":840,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Material Depot","descriptions":["Three finely crafted rocking chairs sit around a round table in the center of the room where denizens will often sit and play a quick dice game while working away.  Shelves line the room where someone can set aside their work for a moment of rest, although those come few and far between.  A counter stocked with many types of fabrics and furs dominates one side of the room to make crafting materials readily accessible."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":723,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting supplies"]},
  {"id":725,"x":520,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway comes to an abrupt end where it branches off into to three rooms separated by granite arches.  Scrap cloth and leather along with empty bottles litter the otherwise empty tile floor.  Busy tailors shuffle in and out of the rooms, avoiding the garbage on the floor, hurrying to get more supplies."],"exits":[{"to":724,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":729,"exit":"go","move":"go green arch"},{"to":730,"exit":"go","move":"go white arch"},{"to":731,"exit":"go","move":"go puce arch"}]},
  {"id":726,"x":530,"y":870,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Expansive windows open out to the north, giving a humbling view of the Great Tower.  Beneath a hefty loom is a lumpy burlap rug showing signs of wear atop a large lump, which props up the rug, from the shoes of many a weaver propping his feet up as he worked.  A grey granite arch leads back out into the building.","Darkness pours through the expansive windows as small candles on the sill illuminate the area.  Beneath a hefty loom is a lumpy burlap rug showing signs of wear atop a large lump, which props up the rug, from the shoes of many a weaver propping his feet up as he worked.  A grey granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":721,"exit":"go","move":"go grey arch"}],"aliases":["Weaving1"]},
  {"id":727,"x":530,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Open prairies and grasslands are painted in a panoramic mural that cover the stone walls from floor to ceiling.  Planted pots of junegrass and lilies are set up in a horseshoe around a hefty loom.  A beige granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":721,"exit":"go","move":"go beige arch"}],"aliases":["Weaving2"]},
  {"id":728,"x":530,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Small motes of dust drift by calling attention to the light provided by a series of several tiny skylights in the ceiling.  Stained glass windows line the wall, providing patches of colored light as the sun shines through to illuminate the hefty loom sitting in the center of the room.  A long, thin rug decorated with embroidered sunbursts has a threadbare trail evidently marking where most weavers stand to perform their craft.  An azure granite arch leads back out into the building.","Smoke from several sconces lining the room swirl out of the dim skylights overhead, and create a smoky fog along the ceiling.  Stained glass windows line the wall, reflecting the warm glow off the colored panes back into the room.  A long, thin rug decorated with embroidered sunbursts stretches in front of a hefty loom, a threadbare trail evidently marking where most weavers stand to perform their craft.  An azure granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":721,"exit":"go","move":"go azure arch"}],"aliases":["Weaving3"]},
  {"id":729,"x":530,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Alternating panels of ironwood and cedar surround the walls to form stripes of dark and light.  Torchlight reflects off the highly polished walls to showcase the large spinning wheel sitting atop a plush cotton rug near the center of the room.  Beneath it, the alternating woods come together in a point.  The only other piece of furniture to grace the room is a long workbench against the back wall.  A green granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"go","move":"go green arch"}],"aliases":["Spinning1"]},
  {"id":730,"x":530,"y":820,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Hundreds of stained glass panels make up the ceiling of this room, filtering the daylight through a myriad of colors.  A painted spinning wheel sits below the colored skylight atop a rug dyed in vibrant greens and blues.  The workbench lining the back wall is splattered with various colored paints to add to the visual effect.  A white granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"go","move":"go white arch"}],"aliases":["Spinning2"]},
  {"id":731,"x":530,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Shard Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Large panes of thick, frosted glass make up the ceiling of this room, letting the daylight filter through to provide ambient flood lighting.  A large spinning wheel sits below the skylight atop an intricate grass rug woven in a zig-zag pattern.  The workbench lining the back wall generally serves as a place to take a quick respite or work on a project that requires more attention to detail.  A puce granite arch leads back out into the building."],"exits":[{"to":725,"exit":"go","move":"go puce arch"}],"aliases":["Spinning3"]},
  {"id":732,"x":360,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Milene's Rose, Private Booth","descriptions":["Circular and featuring just the right compliment of shadows to light, comfortable seats, padded with blue velvet upholstery that features the signature black rose motif of Milene's, await those who enter here.  The soft perfume of flowers drifts through the air, and a crisp midnight blue cloth of thick linen covers the tabletop."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Private Booth"]},
  {"id":733,"x":700,"y":70,"z":0,"title":"Brickwell Tower, The Crystal Sparrow","descriptions":["Set up by the Trader's Guild, the Crystal Sparrow is a small inn for those who are too busy with Guild business, or too tired from their travels, to visit one of the city's many finer establishments.  The stone walls of the room have been covered by cherrywood paneling carved with various images in sylvan theme.  A small crystal sparrow sits on display in a golden cage hung from the center of the ceiling.  A few tables are scattered around the room, spaced to provide privacy for the inn's patrons."],"exits":[{"to":510,"exit":"go","move":"go stairwell"}],"aliases":["Crystal Sparrow"]},
  {"id":734,"x":740,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Houses Consulate, Rooftop Platform","descriptions":["From its northwest-facing position atop the consulate building, this precarious strip of rooftop space offers an especially stunning view of Shard's sky-piercing Great Tower, set dramatically against the turbulent thundercloud that rages above Stormwill Tower further in the distance.  Sunlight reflecting off windows and crystalline spires adds a lucent shimmer to the sprawling cityscape below.","From its northwest-facing position atop the consulate building, this precarious strip of rooftop space offers an especially stunning view of Shard's sky-piercing Great Tower, set dramatically against the turbulent thundercloud that rages above Stormwill Tower further in the distance.  Hundreds of glowing windows break the nighttime gloom below, speckling the cityscape with points of soft light."],"exits":[{"to":684,"exit":"go","move":"go open skylight"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Rooftop Platform","dirigible","airship","Eternal Etrana","Aesry Surlaenis'a"]},
  {"id":735,"x":960,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A niche in the wall appears recently excavated with its contents spread on the floor."],"exits":[{"to":736,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":667,"exit":"go","move":"go hole","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":736,"x":960,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Dampness seems to linger in the air, perhaps evaporation from the vent outside."],"exits":[{"to":737,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":735,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":737,"x":960,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Passages off this central area provide access to the regions farther reaches."],"exits":[{"to":742,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":736,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":738,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":738,"x":940,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  These dark dirt walls emit a putrid scent that seems to coat anything that enters."],"exits":[{"to":737,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":741,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":740,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":739,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":739,"x":920,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A bevy of spiders have constructed webs across the far corner of this space, making it cramped and inhospitable."],"exits":[{"to":738,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":740,"x":920,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A stone column seems to emerge from the dirt walls in a spray of variegated color, probably a discard from some prior building."],"exits":[{"to":738,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":741,"x":940,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  The walls here look likely to crumble, and the faint scent of vinegar mingles with the dust."],"exits":[{"to":738,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":742,"x":980,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  The excavation here must have been done by a whirling dervish, because the walls and floor are extremely uneven making keeping one's balance difficult."],"exits":[{"to":743,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":744,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":737,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":743,"x":1000,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  The atmosphere is almost suffocating, yet filled with tension that is almost palpable.  A crude etching of a viper is centered on the right wall."],"exits":[{"to":742,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":744,"x":980,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, A Narrow Passage","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Overhead, fine dust sifts from tiny cracks in the ceiling indicating a subterranean creature may have opted to make it their residence."],"exits":[{"to":742,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":745,"x":1080,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["This lengthy tunnel is narrow and confining, as if the miners were trying to sneak past what was above.  The walls are full of chisel marks that give the space a texture which reflects light in odd patterns.  Dry, heavy air -- a stark contrast to the moisture in the vent -- wafts through occasionally carrying different scents."],"exits":[{"to":746,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":665,"exit":"go","move":"go vent","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":746,"x":1080,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A few stray pebbles litter the ground decreasing the likelihood of avoiding detection."],"exits":[{"to":747,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":745,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":751,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":747,"x":1100,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Set off to the northeast side of the main tunnel, there is an open feeling to this space that belies its evil."],"exits":[{"to":748,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":749,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":750,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":746,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":748,"x":1100,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Air currents in here circulate in such a fashion that the echo mimics a low cackle every now and then."],"exits":[{"to":747,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":749,"x":1120,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["The dirt walls in this space are striated in shades running from brown to pink.  Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable."],"exits":[{"to":747,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":750,"x":1120,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  The walls here look likely to crumble, and the faint scent of vinegar mingles with the dust."],"exits":[{"to":747,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":751,"x":1060,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A shiny spot on the floor encourages care lest one slip and crash into the wall or worse."],"exits":[{"to":752,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":746,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":754,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":753,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":752,"x":1060,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  Some warped jokester has etched a caricature into the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":751,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":753,"x":1040,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  This semi-circular space is narrow and confining, so much so it is difficult to turn around without bumping into the wall."],"exits":[{"to":751,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":754,"x":1040,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Undershard, The Blasted Tunnel","descriptions":["Each footfall announces the presence of anyone not exercising a modicum of stealth.  Muffled sounds drift through the passageway, the location of their origin indeterminable.  A chill fills the air here, as trapped air swirls in an attempt to find its way out."],"exits":[{"to":751,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":755,"x":42,"y":194,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Atrium","descriptions":["Built in circular splendor, the Enchanting Hall is designed to make the narrow building seem much larger on the inside than it appears from the outside.  Opposite of a crystalline archway, a spiral ramp winds its way up the tower, breaking only to allow access to each level.  A stream of water falls from the magnificent domed glass ceiling, filling a shallow pool in the center of the room that gives sanctuary to a multitude of brightly colored fish."],"exits":[{"to":757,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go crystalline door"},{"to":756,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Society","Enchanting Prestige"]},
  {"id":756,"x":42,"y":214,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Society Master's Office","descriptions":["Thick, plush red carpet reaches from one goldenrod-colored wall to the next, bathing the room in posh elegance.  Sturdy, lacquered bookshelves line the room, displaying numerous titles for the discerning reader.  A silk-clad Elothean librarian sits at a nearby desk, gazing down through her spectacles at a book in her hand."],"exits":[{"to":755,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Master"]},
  {"id":757,"x":42,"y":184,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Tool Store","descriptions":["Uneven and sporadically spaced floorboards give a glimpse of the lower level as it wraps around the tower to form a charmingly quirky balcony.  Dozens of gaethzen fireflies are placed just out of reach, illuminating the space while adding to the whimsical oddness of the tower.  Attendants bustle around the shop as they pull down tools, restock, and wait upon customers."],"exits":[{"to":758,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":755,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Tools"]},
  {"id":758,"x":42,"y":174,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Supply Store","descriptions":["Numerous planters line the walls of the translucent-floored tier, many of them blossoming with flowers.  Daisies and daffodils lend a splash of yellow, while dozens of tulips dazzle in shades of deep red and pink.  Clerks mill about behind a curvy counter, tidying up and restocking supplies."],"exits":[{"to":759,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":757,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Supplies"]},
  {"id":759,"x":42,"y":164,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Book Store","descriptions":["Swirls of copper, silver, and gold shimmer within the thick glass floor, distorting the view of the lower level.  Filled with an assortment of books and scrolls, glass shelves line the circular walls of the room.  Clerks bustle about as they attend to the needs of the waiting customers."],"exits":[{"to":760,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":758,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Books"]},
  {"id":760,"x":42,"y":154,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Ascendant Tier","descriptions":["Encircling a mosaic medallion embedded into the thick glass floor are thirteen bronze triptychs, each of them turned to reveal their neutral aspect.  The eyes of the neutral gods stare blankly at mosaic in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":761,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":759,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":762,"exit":"go","move":"go copper door"},{"to":763,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze door"},{"to":764,"exit":"go","move":"go pewter door"}]},
  {"id":761,"x":42,"y":144,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Transcendent Tier","descriptions":["Set into a thick glass floor are a plethora of esoteric gold and silver sigils, each elaborate in their simplicity, yet too complex to define.  Several pewter pedestals holding mirrored bowls are placed about the area in a seemingly haphazard manner."],"exits":[{"to":760,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":765,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"},{"to":766,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"},{"to":767,"exit":"go","move":"go platinum door"}]},
  {"id":762,"x":25,"y":154,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Copper Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":760,"exit":"go","move":"go copper door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 1","Copper"]},
  {"id":763,"x":59,"y":154,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Bronze Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":760,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 3","Bronze"]},
  {"id":764,"x":25,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Pewter Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":760,"exit":"go","move":"go pewter door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 2","Pewter"]},
  {"id":765,"x":42,"y":124,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Silver Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":761,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 6","Silver"]},
  {"id":766,"x":58,"y":131,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Gold Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":761,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 5","Gold"]},
  {"id":767,"x":59,"y":144,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Enchantment, Platinum Workroom","descriptions":["Fairly spacious, the workroom is set up in an ideal fashion for working with enchantments.  Several gaethzen orbs in the ceiling allow enough light to work by, aided by crystal lanterns that hang near each corner.  The room is relatively quiet, tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the tower."],"exits":[{"to":761,"exit":"go","move":"go platinum door"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Workroom 4","Platinum"]},
  {"id":768,"x":1030,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Entrance Garden","descriptions":["Massive wrought-iron gates mark the only break in the walls of polished marble that enclose this meticulously manicured compound.  Statuesque tiger lilies rise in neat rows from mounds of grey-green foliage to either side of the slate walkway.  Silk pennants line the path, each lit by its own gaethzen orb.  To the northeast, two large stone towers flank a series of small gardens."],"exits":[{"to":769,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":118,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":769,"x":1040,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Garden of Heroes","descriptions":["Standing astride platforms of charcoal basalt, a row of solemn bronze statues rings this circular garden.  White chrysanthemums cascade from large stone urns between the figures, and a formal planting in the center of the area pairs irises with a solitary gnarled cherry tree.  To the north, a graceful lacquered footbridge leads across a crescent-shaped pool while an archway leads into the eastern tower."],"exits":[{"to":768,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go western tower"},{"to":773,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern tower"}]},
  {"id":770,"x":1030,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Western Tower Entryway","descriptions":["Open and airy, grey marble forms the entire massive structure, even up to the frescoed ceiling.  Glass windows with heavy red velvet curtains pulled aside provide an expansive view of the exterior gardens.  High-backed chairs of ornately carved blackwood are placed to one side for the comfort of guests not escorted beyond the spiraling stairway."],"exits":[{"to":771,"exit":"go","move":"go blackwood arch"},{"to":769,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"}]},
  {"id":771,"x":1020,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Dining Hall","descriptions":["Low, round tables of highly polished blackwood are scattered over the heavy woven rug underfoot.  Bright candelabra fill the room with light reflected from pale yellow crystal, lending it a mellow ambience absent from the rest of the austere towers.  Sideboards heaped with food are placed against a marble wall near the entrance, refilled at all hours for those mages who would burn the midnight oil."],"exits":[{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go blackwood arch"},{"to":772,"exit":"go","move":"go open door"}]},
  {"id":772,"x":1010,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Kitchen","descriptions":["Holding enough cookware and supplies for all the residents of the tower and their guests, a floor-to-ceiling cupboards are almost continually open.  A hearth, large enough to roast an entire steer, graces the middle of the western wall.  Flanking it on both sides are massive iron stoves.  Chattering cooks and errand boys weave a complex dance around the many cabinets filled with foodstuffs and racks of wine."],"exits":[{"to":771,"exit":"go","move":"go open door"}]},
  {"id":773,"x":1050,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Eastern Tower","descriptions":["Almost perfectly round, the hall features a massive stairway that spirals upwards, hugging the marble wall.  Windows provide light and a pleasant view of the gardens.  A cobblestone fireplace flanked by tapestries stands before a set of plush armchairs."],"exits":[{"to":769,"exit":"go","move":"go broad archway"},{"to":774,"exit":"go","move":"go massive stair"}]},
  {"id":774,"x":1050,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Hall","descriptions":["Heavy rugs underfoot muffle the sound of footfalls on the stone floor.  A tall goldbark vase holding a large arrangement of tiger lilies is the only adornment here, though the scent of ozone hangs thickly on the air."],"exits":[{"to":773,"exit":"go","move":"go massive stair"},{"to":775,"exit":"go","move":"go curving steps"}]},
  {"id":775,"x":1050,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Meeting Hall","descriptions":["Rows of stone benches covered with thin grey velvet cushions surround a raised dais in the center of the simply furnished hall.  Curving steps lead downward to the rest of the tower, and a heavy door set with leaded glass leads onto the sky bridge connecting the two towers.  Overhead is a ceiling of swirled glass in bold colors."],"exits":[{"to":774,"exit":"go","move":"go curving steps"},{"to":776,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}]},
  {"id":776,"x":1040,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Sky Bridge","descriptions":["Black and grey slate tiles stretch across the bridge that ties the two towers together in an elaborate knotwork mosaic.  The pattern is accented by the tiny, almost translucent, white flowers that grow between each square.  Pale morning glories cling to the balustrade of polished marble that encloses the area.  At its center rises an obelisk surrounded by delicate, pearlescent orchids."],"exits":[{"to":775,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"},{"to":777,"exit":"go","move":"go thick door"}]},
  {"id":777,"x":1030,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Hallway","descriptions":["A carved blackwood chair sits at the end of the hall, the long leaves of a tall fern plant partly draping over its high back.  A narrow window allows for a view of the Great Tower, standing majestically in the center of the cityscape.  A black door leads to a guest bedroom, and a thick door set with leaded glass leads out to the sky bridge connecting the two towers."],"exits":[{"to":778,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":776,"exit":"go","move":"go thick door"},{"to":780,"exit":"go","move":"go black door"}]},
  {"id":778,"x":1040,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Hallway","descriptions":["Faint scorch marks mar the grey slate floor here, perhaps from some impromptu duel gone wrong.  Long swags of charcoal-hued Elothean silk hang from the high ceiling to flank a carved obsidian flame fountain, across from which is a lacquered door."],"exits":[{"to":777,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":779,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"}]},
  {"id":779,"x":1030,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Lounge","descriptions":["Loosely clustered around an elaborately carved fireplace are crushed velvet couches in rich sapphire tones, each set with pale grey pillows of raw Elothean silk.  A loosely woven rug softens the sound of footfall, narrows strips of gold gossamer giving reflected light the appearance of flame when a fire blazes in the hearth.  Glass windows provide both a view of the immaculate gardens below and the city of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"},{"to":778,"exit":"go","move":"go stairs"},{"to":781,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}]},
  {"id":780,"x":1020,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Guest Room","descriptions":["Two overstuffed leather chairs sit beneath the narrow window of this comfortably appointed room.  A black lacquered four-poster bed sits beside a matching nightstand holding a cluster of white beeswax pillar candles.  A luxurious panther fur rug partly covers the ebony floor, its limbs spread wide before a small bronze brazier.  Exotic jeweled masks add a touch of color and mystery to the room."],"exits":[{"to":777,"exit":"go","move":"go lacquered door"}]},
  {"id":781,"x":1020,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"House of the Grey Storm, Dormitory","descriptions":["Simple wooden cots, each with a smooth velvet coverlet, line the wall.  Heavy chests with the house crest carved on the lids are placed at the foot of every bed beneath a small table adorned with a bronze oil lamp.  Many mages find solace here after long hours of practice and study before striking out on their own or moving into one of the apartments higher in the tower."],"exits":[{"to":779,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}]},
  {"id":782,"x":655,"y":415,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Item Registration Office","descriptions":["Different paintings depicting the Great Tower in different styles adorn almost every inch of open wall space.  Rows of large metal cabinets line the wall behind a high counter that separates the clerks from the general public.  The spotless red tile floor shines as if it had been polished just moments ago."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":783,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"}]},
  {"id":783,"x":655,"y":405,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Registrar's Office","descriptions":["A large metal desk sits in the exact center of the office.  Lined up around the walls are more large metal cabinets, half of them open with hundreds of papers hanging out as if in middle of processing."],"exits":[{"to":782,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Item Registration Office","Registration Office"]},
  {"id":784,"x":675,"y":425,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Carousel Family Services","descriptions":["A series of guarded arches line the southern wall.  The complicated framework of iron and timbers spans across the ceiling.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights form the strikingly complex mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":785,"x":480,"y":1080,"z":0,"title":"Serene Surfaces","descriptions":["Cleverly placed mirrors hung on the white paneled walls create the illusion the small shop is larger than it is, allowing patrons to not feel overcrowded while browsing its wares.  A dark blue rug serves to accent the assortment of tables arranged along the walls and center space of the room, their shapes and sizes ranging from tall and narrow to short and round."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Serene Surfaces"]},
  {"id":790,"x":140,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Shard Meeting Tower, Entrance","descriptions":["Though relatively small compared to the other towers in Shard, the meeting tower is quite sturdily built and perfectly circular.  The rather low ceiling of the landing level is made from polished cedar wood, and its floor is a lustrous white marble.  The long hallway bisects the tower past stone walls, a narrow ramp leading upward to the other levels."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":793,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":791,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"},{"to":792,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"aliases":["Meeting Tower"]},
  {"id":791,"x":150,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Hall of the Moons","descriptions":["Shaped into a nearly perfect semi-circle, the wide room is lit by braziers burning on the ends of tall silver poles.  Emblazoned onto the curving walls is a continuous mural of the nighttime sky, with all three moons shown in conjunction with each other.  Comfortable chairs are scattered throughout the room, and a few red curtains partially shroud a few small windows."],"exits":[{"to":790,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}],"aliases":["red room"]},
  {"id":792,"x":130,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Hall of the Hunt","descriptions":["Shaped into a nearly perfect semi-circle, the wide room is lit by braziers burning on the ends of tall silver poles.  Emblazoned onto the curving walls is a continuous mural of a dense forest, with several deer hidden in among the trees.  Comfortable chairs are scattered throughout the room, and a few green curtains partially shroud a few small windows that look out onto the street."],"exits":[{"to":790,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"aliases":["green room"]},
  {"id":793,"x":140,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Shard Meeting Tower, Second Landing","descriptions":["Small windows on each end of the hallway look out just above the rooftops of the city, and the Crystal Tower is visible from the eastern window.  Tall pillars stand at even intervals through the short hallway.  A narrow red carpet runs the length of the hall, leading to ramps that lead up or down respectively, each one hugging the edge of the outer wall."],"exits":[{"to":790,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":796,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":794,"exit":"go","move":"go stormy door"},{"to":795,"exit":"go","move":"go sparkling door"}]},
  {"id":794,"x":150,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Hall of Storms","descriptions":["Shaped into a nearly perfect semi-circle, the wide room is lit by braziers burning on the ends of tall silver poles.  Emblazoned onto the curving walls is a continuous mural of a raging storm, with jagged forks of lightning striking at the floor.  Comfortable chairs are scattered throughout the room, and a wide window looks out on Stormwill Tower to the north."],"exits":[{"to":793,"exit":"go","move":"go stormy door"}]},
  {"id":795,"x":130,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Hall of Crystal","descriptions":["Shaped into a nearly perfect semi-circle, the wide room is lit by braziers burning on the ends of tall silver poles.  Set into the curving walls are numerous semi-precious gems and crystals, creating a scintillating pattern of color that suffuses throughout the room.  Comfortable chairs are scattered throughout the room, and a few white curtains partially shroud a few small windows."],"exits":[{"to":793,"exit":"go","move":"go sparlking door"}]},
  {"id":796,"x":140,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Shard Meeting Tower, Third Landing","descriptions":["Thin sheets of dark shale line the lower half of the pale walls, creating a mosaic effect that vaguely resembles the skyline of Shard.  Gold veins pierce the white marble that covers the floor, forming a shimmering spiderweb effect.  A ramp slopes downward, leading back to the second landing."],"exits":[{"to":793,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":798,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow steps"},{"to":797,"exit":"go","move":"go golden door"}]},
  {"id":797,"x":150,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Hall of the Gods","descriptions":["Shaped into a nearly perfect circle, the large room is lit by braziers burning on the ends of tall silver poles.  Emblazoned onto the curving walls is a continuous mural showing numerous avatars of the gods, each rendered in exacting detail.  Comfortable chairs and couches are scattered throughout the room, and a wide window looks out on the Tower of Honor to the south."],"exits":[{"to":796,"exit":"go","move":"go golden door"}]},
  {"id":798,"x":140,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Shard Meeting Tower, Rooftop Balcony","descriptions":["Open to the air, the perfectly round balcony is surrounded by a three-foot wall that has an alternating brick pattern at the top.  Low benches are set in even intervals along the rooftop, giving a place to sit.  Wyvern Mountain is visible past the walls of the city to the west, and the entirety of the Crystal Tower rises to the east."],"exits":[{"to":796,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow steps"}]},
  {"id":799,"x":1050,"y":310,"z":0,"title":"Moon Mage Guild, Seers' Study","descriptions":["The skylights above curve down to form the exterior wall of this wedge-shaped chamber, offering a breathtaking view of the western half of the city and Wyvern Mountain beyond.  One interior wall is lined with sturdy bookcases, while the other features a large cork board next to a desk stocked with paper and writing implements.  A complicated web-patterned mosaic on the floor converges on a black marble lectern near the crystal wall."],"exits":[{"to":543,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":800,"x":400,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Shard Forging Society, Bulk Materials","descriptions":["The sounds of the nearby forges are muted in this roofed, open space.  Countless traders and wagons are efficiently directed through a loop from Xibar's Crescent Road, through a processing area where their wagons are unloaded and reloaded, and then back out onto the streets once again.  Clerks dash about with their paperwork to keep the assembly flowing, though one remains at a counter to take orders.  From time to time, the heat and soot from within the society proper are swirled through on a breeze."],"exits":[{"to":658,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bulk Forging Supplies","Bulk Forging Materials"]},
  {"id":801,"x":492,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Crane Couriers, Printing Room","descriptions":["Precious little floor space exists in this cramped but well-kept showroom.  Heavily laden supply shelves line each wall, and various presses, cutters, and paper milling machines dominate the crowded area behind the service counter, where an apron-clad Elothean clerk waits to consult with potential customers."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":802,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":802,"x":504,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Crane Couriers, Special Collections","descriptions":["Appointed with comfortable brocade sofas and highly polished display cabinetry, the print shop's rear salon serves as quiet consultation space.  Two large ink-and-watercolor paintings complement the fine furnishings from prominent positions on the wainscoted wall that faces the doorway."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":803,"x":665,"y":425,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Carousel Square","descriptions":["A massive conical building rises from the cobbles at the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly against the drab backdrop of the surrounding stone and wood.  A bejeweled mosaic set above an oval doorway reads \"THE CAROUSEL.\""],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":804,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go oval doorway"}]},
  {"id":804,"x":665,"y":435,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Rundmolen Post Office","descriptions":["Tucked away in a corner of the square is a long alabaster counter set into the conical carousel beneath a colorful striped awning.  Wide yellow stripes contrast with deep crimson alternating bands across the sturdy canvas while bright blue tassels hang from the corners.  Vast, countless rows of differently sized shelves are behind the counter, and complex Dwarven mechanisms can be heard as they rearrange the package-covered storage.  Clerks shuffle endlessly back and forth between the counters and shelving as they assist patrons with their packaging and mailing needs."],"exits":[{"to":803,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["mail","post office"]},
  {"id":805,"x":460,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Shard Housing Office, Entry","descriptions":["Designed to be functional and efficient, there's little in the way of decoration or frills to be found.  The walls are cleanly painted a light, calming shade of blue while the floor is tiled with alternating squares of white and black.  Desks, each manned by a single Dwarven clerk, lie on either side of the open space."],"exits":[{"to":806,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":807,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":54,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":806,"x":470,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Shard Housing Office, Prospective Buyers","descriptions":["A shallow dish holds three candles, each a different thickness and height and only one of which is burning.  The clerk seated behind the desk meticulously checks and re-checks figures in a large tome.  From time to time, the clerk looks up and waves an eager patron closer to sort their paperwork before efficiently sending them on their way."],"exits":[{"to":805,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["housing clerk","house clerk"]},
  {"id":807,"x":450,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Shard Housing Office, Transfers","descriptions":["A small, potted cactus consisting of several prickly knobs growing off of one another is the only decoration to be seen here.  Otherwise, the desk is neatly organized with stacks of parchments, a feathered quill resting in a half-filled inkwell, and a heavy tome of records that the clerk casually pages through."],"exits":[{"to":805,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["housing transfer","house transfer"]},
  {"id":809,"x":125,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Stormshine Room","descriptions":["A tile mosaic spans the curved walls and shifts from ominously dark grey storm clouds to billowing white clouds in a brilliant blue sky.  Overhead, a lantern shielded by cloudy crystal on one side and clear amber on the other complements the aesthetic as it casts dimmed light to the stormy side of the room and sunny yellow light to the other.  A single long bench curves around some protective railing that overlooks the rotunda below."],"exits":[{"to":810,"exit":"northeast","move":"ne"},{"to":473,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}],"aliases":["Stormshine Room"]},
  {"id":810,"x":135,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Observatory Room","descriptions":["A false ceiling patterned to resemble a starry night sky hangs overhead.  Through impressive engineering, large crystalline orbs, each colored to simulate one of Elanthia's moons, move across the sky as their real counterparts would and provide tinted illumination for patrons to navigate by.  The varied aromas of the foods being prepared and served in the food court below suffuse the air.  Tall windows between the shopfronts grant a modest view of the true sky outside."],"exits":[{"to":811,"exit":"east","move":"e"},{"to":809,"exit":"southwest","move":"sw"}],"aliases":["Observatory Room"]},
  {"id":811,"x":145,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, River Room","descriptions":["Water falls thunderously from a spout in one wall near the ceiling, creating a small waterfall that still manages to cast misty spray around the pool in the floor.  A river speeds out from the pool and winds its way around the shop entrances, and small bridges cross it at key points to provide access.  While visually novel in its design, the crashing and rushing water creates enough noise that visitors frequently yell at their companions just to be heard."],"exits":[{"to":812,"exit":"southeast","move":"se"},{"to":810,"exit":"west","move":"w"}],"aliases":["River Room"]},
  {"id":812,"x":155,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Plaza, Treehouse Room","descriptions":["The canopy of the giant oak below explodes out from the floor here.  The overall design strongly resembles a treehouse with rope bridge-like pathways snaking through and around the branches.  Beyond the roped-off areas, varieties of ivy and colorfully flowering vines creep along the ground and over the shop entrances.  The air is filled with strong floral scents atop earthy undertones."],"exits":[{"to":811,"exit":"northwest","move":"nw"}],"aliases":["Treehouse Room"]}
 ],
